<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Mupun NT</book>
  <para style="h">Ɗak Jeplep</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ɗak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ɗak</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɗak Jeplep Jesu Mo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ɗak Jeplep</para>
  <para style="mt2">Jesu Mo</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Cweerpwoo nKaa Sham Riin Ɗeɓang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1"/>Dǝm pǝ gha Tiyofilus. Nɗǝǝn ɓǝǝt-haal fen ɗenshee, ɓǝ wen ran pwoo nkaa mbii ɗe Jesu wur cìn mo, kǝ mbii ɗewur kám mo. <verse eid="ACT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2"/>Dǝm wul parpuus ɗe Naan mang wur kaa kǝ nǝ aɗeng. Aku ɗang Naan mang wur kaa kǝ nǝ aɗeng, ɓǝ wur leshap nnen ɗewur kǝ bǝlǝp mo, mbǝkǝ mo ɗee ɗe a jeplep fin mo, shi iiko mǝ Riin Ɗeɓang. <verse eid="ACT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>Mbǝ teer mo laarfeer aɓwoon ɗe Jesu kǝ yool a peemúut, ɓǝ wur woo shin mmo yit ɗes, nɗǝǝn ar mo shini-shini, ɗe nǝ kám agaak nǝ, wur ɗi mmeen azeen-zeen. Mo naa Jesu, kǝ wur leshap mmo nkaa mulki mǝ Naan. <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/>Par mǝ puus sǝ, ɓǝ kaaɗe wur ɗi ashak kǝ jeplep fin mo, ɓǝ wur leshap mmo ɓalɓal nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Taji wu yool wu yit Jerusalem kas. Ɗangɓe wu tong, wu naa gam zuum ɗe puun fen wur kǝ ten cweer nwun, ɗe wuu kǝlǝng nǝ mpwoo fen. <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/>Dǝ Joon wur cìn baptisma ngurum mo a shi am, ɗang ɗee meeteer mo ɗi a lee ɗak, ɓǝ mon ncìn baptisma nwun a shi Riin Ɗeɓang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:5">Mo Mang Jesu Kàa Kǝ Wur Aɗeng<verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Kaaɗe jeplep Jesu mo kuur ashak, ɓǝ mo tal pǝ wur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Daa, gha mbǝ cin shin mulki nǝ nnen Isreil mo a nɗǝǝn meeteer ɗesǝ mo ee?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>Jesu lap mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Baa ɗesǝ nǝ a muu, mbǝkǝ nwun man puus nǝ, kǝ ɓit ɗe Daa kǝ ten le mo nɗǝǝn iiko fin kas. <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/>Ɗangɓǝ Naan wur nshin ɓal nwun, katɗang Riin Ɗeɓang sham nkaa wun. Ɓǝ wun mbǝ ɗee a langtǝng fen mhffig</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:8">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus is taken to Heaven" file="ib04180b.jpg" size="col" loc="Acts. 6;11" copy="Cook" ref="1.8">Mo mang Jesu kaa adeng Naan</figure>o nɗǝǝn Jerusalem, kǝ nɗǝǝn Judiya jir, kǝ Samariya, dǝm wul nɗǝǝn yil mo jir zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/>Kaaɗe wur sat pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo mang wur kaa kǝ nǝ aɗeng a yit mo. Yaksǝ nluu jì paa wur, baa mo kutɗi naa wur kas. <verse eid="ACT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Kaaɗe mo ɗi nkaa ban yit mo mo kaa kǝ nǝ aɗeng, ɓǝ mee gurum mo vǝl, mo jì ɗar pǝ mo ɗi, kǝ nlǝr piyaa petpet <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>Nen nǝ mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wun nnen Galili mo, a mii le ɗang wuu ɗar, wuu ban yit kaa kǝ nǝ aɗeng ii? Jesu ɗe wu naa mo kǝ mang wur kaa kǝ nǝ aɗeng pǝ wun ɗi sǝ, ɓǝ wur mbǝ baa sham a kǝsǝ zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Bǝlip Mee Gurum A Koppee Judas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Ɓǝ jeplep mǝ Jesu mo yool yit Zuul Paat ɗe nǝ kus kǝ Jerusalem, ɗejong nǝ kǝ Jerusalem a meel mǝndong ɓejee ɗak. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/>Kaaɗe mo jì wul nɗǝǝn pee kaam nǝ, ɓǝ mo dǝm kàa nɗǝǝn luɗeng, a pee ɗe moo tong ɗi. A mon nɗesǝ, Pita, kǝ Joon, kǝ Jemis, kǝ Andru, Filip kǝ Tomas, Bartolomi, kǝ Matiyu, kǝ Jemis ɗyem Alfiyas, kǝ Simon Zelot, memee mɓut mee nnen ɗe gyet mo ɓalkaa mo mbǝ tang mulki mǝ yil mo, kǝ Judas làa Jemis. <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Nen ɗesǝ mo ɓalkaa mo mo ashak mbǝ ɗangnaan shidaar-shidaar, shi pǝtuup mǝndong ashak kǝ pak shurep mo, kǝ Meri nǝǝn Jesu, kǝ ɗyemnǝǝn fin mo zak.<verse eid="ACT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Nɗǝǝn meeteer mǝnǝ mo, ɓǝ nen shinzeen nǝ mo kuur ashak, (ɗe ɗuu mo nǝ wul kambil mǝndong kǝ laarvǝl), ɓǝ Pita yool ɗar atǝng nnaar mo mbǝ leshap, ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>&lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa mo, nǝ a tǝng kǝ mo gampwoo ɗe mo kǝ ten ran nɗǝǝn ɓǝǝt haal mǝ Naan. Pwoo ɗe gyet Riin Ɗeɓang le kǝ Devit leshap nkaa Judas ngwe ɗewur ɗee a ngukám ar nnen ɗe dǝ mo yaa Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Dǝ wur a memee mɓut mmun, kǝ dǝ wur cìn pak ɗak fun ɗesǝ nǝ zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/>(Shi shool ɗe Judas lap mbǝ kwat ɗak fin ɗebish, ɓǝ wur dǝm seet mee maar ɗishik. A pee ɗewur sham taa wur muut, wur piin ɓut fin, dǝm kat pinbut wur mo pwat ɓeer. <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Mbii ɗesǝ nǝ ɗee a ɗemǝman ngurum ɗe moo tong nɗǝǝn yil nJerusalem jir, moo pet maar ɗesǝ nǝ shi liispwoo mo a Akeldama. Ɗe shii mǝnǝ a maar toom).<verse eid="ACT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>&lt;&lt;Mbǝɗǝ mo Jeplep Jesu mo ten ran nɗǝǝn ɓǝǝt haal Zabura nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wu ar kǝ nlu wur nǝ ɗee a kǝrem. Taji mee gurum tong nɗǝǝn nǝ kas,&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Kǝ mo ran zak nǝnee, &lt;Wu yit kǝ mee gurum ɗee ɗi a koppee wur nǝ.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21"/>&lt;&lt;Mbǝ mǝnǝ, ɓǝ nǝ ret kǝ mmun bǝlǝp mee gurum mɓut nnen ɗe peegyet mo ɗi ashak kǝ mun, kaaɗe dǝ Daa Jesu wur kǝ mwaan dǝm kǝ mun shipee-shipee sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22"/>Yool mɓít ɗe Joon kǝ cìn baptisma ngurum mo, dǝm wul parpuus ɗe Naan mang Jesu kaa kǝ nǝ aɗeng, pǝ mun ɗi. Nǝ ɗee a tǝng kǝ memee mɓut nnen ɗe mun mbǝlǝp sǝ mo, wur ɗee a ngusatpwoo nkaa yool kǝ Jesu a peemúut nǝ ashak kǝ mun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Aasǝ ɓǝ mo le gurum mo vǝl ɗe sǝm mo mo a Josep ɗe moo pet wur a Barsabas koo Jastus, kǝ Matiyas zak. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Yaksǝ mo ɗangnaan nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Daa, gha ɗe a man pǝtuup gurum mo jir. A kám ngwe ɗe waa a bǝlǝp mmun, nɗǝǝn des ɗevǝl sǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>Mbǝkǝ ngwe nǝ cìn ɗak ɗi a koppee mǝ Judas kaa memee nɗǝǝn jeplep kǝ Jesu mo sǝ. Dǝ Judas yool yit ɗak nǝ ɗi, mbǝkǝ nwur dǝm ɗi a pee ɗyem fin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Kaaɗe mo ɓwet bǝlǝp nǝ, ɓǝ nǝ taa nkaa, Matiyas. Yool mmǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo tang Matiyas ashak kǝ jeplep ɗe kaapaat baamǝndong nǝ mo.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Riin Ɗeɓang Sham Parpuus Pentikos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>Kaaɗe parpuus Pentikos nǝ wul, ɓǝ nen shinzeen nǝ moo kuur ashak a pee mǝndong jir. <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Yaksǝ, nnen mman, ɓǝ mee ɗoo ɗe fiipee ka kut ɗeɓal-ɓal sǝ, nǝ tong aɗeng sham gam lu ɗe moo tong ɗi jir. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Yaksǝ mo naa mee mbii kàa mbǝlem wus sǝ, nǝ sham lang nkaa mo jir <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Mo gam mo jir shi Riin Ɗeɓang, yaksǝ mo ɗoom leshap mo shi liispwoo mo shini-shini, kaaɗe Riin Ɗeɓang kám mmo sǝ.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Nɗǝǝn meeteer mǝnǝ mo, ɓǝ pak nen Yahudi mo nɗǝǝn Jerusalem ɗe moo kǝǝr Naan mo ɗi, kǝ ɗe mo pwat nɗǝǝn yil mo shini-shinǝ jir, mo jì nJerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Kaaɗe gurum mo kǝlǝng ɗoo nǝ, ɓǝ ɗuu mǝ gurum nǝ mo kuur a peeshak. Nǝ aapwoo ngurum nǝ mo, mbǝɗe koo a ngwe ɗeɗangyi, ɓǝ wur kǝlǝng nen shinzeen nǝ mo nkaa leshap shi liispwoo mǝ yil fin. <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>Nǝ lekǝǝrmuut, ɗang nǝ aapwoo mo, ɓǝ mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Nen ɗe moo leshap sǝ mo jir, a nen Galili mo. <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>Cirang ɗang koo a ngwe ɗǝɗang nɗǝǝn mun, pǝ kǝlǝng mo nkaa leshap shi liispwoo mǝ yil fin ii? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Mun mu tong a nyil mPartiya, kǝ Mediya, kǝ Elam, kǝ nen ɗe mo tong nɗǝǝn Mesopotamiya, kǝ Judiya, kǝ Kapadosiya, kǝ Pontus, kǝ Eshiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>Kǝ Firijiya, kǝ Pamfiliya, kǝ Ijip, kǝ ngaar Libiya, kus kǝ Sairin, kǝ pak fun mo a mǝzep ɗe mo tong nyil nRom jì ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>(Mo a nen Yahudi mo, kǝ nen ɗe mo jì ɗeɗel nɗǝǝn nen Yahudi mo). Kǝ nen Kritan mo, kǝ nen Arab mo. Muu kǝlǝng mo nkaa leshap nkaa mbii aapwoo ɗǝnan-nan ɗe Naan wur cìn mo shi liispwoo mǝ yil fun mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Nǝ aapwoo mmo, ɗang nǝ suur mo jir, ɗang mo baa tal pǝ shak nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A mii a shii mbii ɗesǝ yii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Ɗangɓǝ pak gurum mo nwang pwoo mmo, ɗang mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Nen ɗesǝ mo raa a am anab.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 2:13">Pita leshap nƊuu Gurum Mo Parpuus Pentikos<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Ɓǝ Pita yool ɗar atǝng ashak kǝ jeplep ɗe kaapaat baamǝndong sǝ mo, ɓǝ wur ɗiyeep ɗoo fin ɓalɓal, ɓǝ wur sat nɗuu gurum nǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wun nen Yahudi mo, kǝ wun nen ɗe wuu tong nJerusalem jir. Wu lekom kǝ nwen sat shii mbii ɗesǝ mo ɗi nwun. <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Baa nen ɗesǝ mo raa a am anab kǝ nǝ yir kaa mo kaaɗe wuu pan sǝ kas, mbǝɗe pee nǝ kutɗi a pwoofeer mǝ bít nɗesǝ ɓejee ɗak. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Ɗangɓǝ, ɗesǝ nǝ a mbii ɗe gyet ngusat pwoo Naan Jowel kǝ ten sat sǝ nǝnee,<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>&lt;Naan wur sat nǝnee, Nɗǝǝn meeteer mǝ kyes nǝ mo. Ɓǝ an mbǝ nɗoo Riin fen nkaa gurum mo jir. Jep fuu ɗemish mo, kǝ ɗe mat mo, mon nsatpwoo Naan ngurum mo, kǝ mbii ɗe mo mbǝ jì akyeen. Zǝlang fuu mon nnaa mbii ɗesǝsok mo, ɗe Naan wur rǝɓet kám nǝ mmo, kǝ dǝkaam fuu mon nsuun suun mo. <verse eid="ACT 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Kǝzak, nɗǝǝn teer mǝnǝ mo, ɓǝ an mbǝ ɗoo Riin fen nkaa kǝrem fen ɗemish mo, kǝ ɗe mat mo. Ɓǝ mon nsatpwoo fen, kǝ mbii ɗe mo mbǝ jì akyeen zak. <verse eid="ACT 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>An mbǝ cìn mbii lukshik mo aɗeng, ɗang an mbǝ cìn mbii aapwoo mo nɗǝǝn yil nǝ, ɗe toom kǝ wus, kǝ ɗiyeel, mon ɗen kàa gǝrong-gǝrong, <verse eid="ACT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>akuɗang puus ɗeɗes, kǝ iiko mǝ Daa nǝn njì, ɓǝ Puus nǝn nciir ɗee a peenkwoo, kǝ tar nǝn nciir ɗee a toom zak. <verse eid="ACT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Parmǝnǝ, ɓǝ koo a ngwe ɗeɗangyii, ɗewur pet sǝm mǝ Daa ɓǝ a wur nkat ɓam.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>&lt;&lt;Wun nen Isreil mo! Wu lekom kǝ wu kǝlǝng pwoo ɗesǝ mo ɗe. Jesu ngu Nazaret, ngwe ɗe Naan kat retnyit kǝ wur, kǝ ɗe Naan cìn mbii lukshik mo, kǝ mbii aapwoo mo kǝ Sǝmpwoo mo nsar wur a yit fuu. Wun shikáa fuu wu man nǝ, mbii ɗesǝ mo cìn a kǝsǝ. <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/>A Jesu ɗesǝ ɗe mo seet wur nsar fuu. Mbǝɗǝ a Naan kǝ ten le, kǝ wur man nǝ, nǝn ncìn a kǝsǝ. A wun wu tu wur, mbǝɗe a wun wu le, kǝ nnenshikbish mo pwas wur nkaa shiyeep. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/>Ɗangɓe Naan yool kǝ Jesu a peemúut, kǝ wur fween Jesu nɗǝǝn jeel mǝ muut, mbǝɗe baa muut nǝ mmak yaa wur le ntuun nǝ kas. <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/>Mbǝɗǝ gyet Devit kǝ ten leshap nkaa Jesu nǝnee, wen naa Daa ashak kǝ an shidaar-shidaar. Mbǝɗǝ wur kus kǝ an, ɓǝ baa mee mbii mmak daampee nghan kas. <verse eid="ACT 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ, ɓǝ pǝtuup fen nǝ gam kǝ retnyit, ɗang lis fen met kook retnyit. Dǝm wul a ɗe fwooshik fen tong nɗǝǝn canciin zak. <verse eid="ACT 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>Mbǝɗǝ baa gha mmak yit seen fen nɗǝǝn kǝcir kas, kǝ baa gha mmak yit Ngwe Ɗeɓang fwaa nwur naa wam nɗǝǝn kǝcir kas. <verse eid="ACT 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>Waa a ten a kám ar ɗe mo a mǝ seen nghan. Kǝ gha mbǝ ngam pǝtuup fen shi retnyit ntoom fwaa zak.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>&lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa mo, wu lekom, kǝ nghan leshap ɗi nwun rǝrret nkaa puunkaam fun Devit, ɗe gyet wur muut, ɓǝ mo wum wur, kǝcir wur nǝ ɗi mpee ɗesǝ har cicinsǝ. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/>Gyet wur a ngusat pwoo mǝ Naan, ɗang wur man mbii ɗe Naan kǝ ten cweer nǝnee, wur nyool le memee nɗǝǝn ɗang wur mo, kǝ nwur ɗee ɗi a mishkoom koo Devit sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Gyet Devit kǝ ten naa mbii ɗe Naan nyool cìn akyeen, a kǝsǝ ɓǝ, wur leshap nkaa yool mǝ Kristi a peemúut nǝnee. Baa Naan nyit wur a peemúut kas, kǝ baa fwooshik wur nǝn nwam nɗǝǝn kǝcir kas. <verse eid="ACT 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>A Jesu ɗesǝ ɗe Naan kǝ yool kǝ wur a peemúut, ɗang mun sǝ jir, mun a langtǝng nǝ Jesu kǝ yool a peemúut. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Mo kǝ le Jesu a ɗeɗes, yaksǝ wur kǝ tong nsarse mǝ Naan, wur kǝ lap Riin Ɗeɓang pǝ Naan kaaɗe gyet wur kǝ cweer sǝ. Mbii ɗe wuu naa, kǝ ɗe wuu kǝlǝng sǝ, a zuum mǝ Riin Ɗeɓang ɗewur kǝ ɗoo shin sham nkaa mun. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34"/>Baa gyet Devit kǝ kaa aɗeng kas, ɗang wur shikáa fin sat nǝnee &lt;Daa wur kǝ sat nDaa fen nǝnee, A tong nsarse fen. <verse eid="ACT 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35"/>Dǝm wul a ɗe an nle shaarlek fwaa mo ɗee a mbii leshii ngha.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>&lt;&lt;Mbǝ mǝnǝ, wu yit kǝ nnen Isreil mo jir, mo man azeen-zeen nǝnee, An pǝ leshap a nkaa Jesu ɗe wu pwas wur sǝ. Ɗangɓe Naan kǝ le wur ɗee a Daa, kǝ Kristi zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Kaaɗe gurum nǝ mo kǝlǝng pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ nǝ sul pǝtuup mmo hakyeng, yaksǝ mo sat mPita kǝ koor jeplep nǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa mo, mun mbǝ ncìn a mii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Ɓǝ Pita lap mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wu tuwap, mbǝkǝ mmo cìn baptisma ɗi nwun jir ngwe ɗeɗangyii nɗǝǝn wun, nɗǝǝn sǝm kǝ Jesu Kristi, mbǝkǝ nNaan fwo shikbish fuu mo ɗi nwun. Ɓǝ wun mbǝ lap zuum mǝ Riin Ɗeɓang. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Pwoo ɗe mo cweer nǝ, a mbǝ wun, kǝ jep fuu mo, kǝ mbǝ nen ɗejong mo jir, kǝ koo a ngwe ɗeɗangyii ɗe Daa fun Naan wur mpet zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Shi pwoo mo ɗes, ɓǝ wur leshap mmo ɓalɓal, ɗang wur sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wu shang káa fuu mo mɓut kar ɗe nǝ mbǝ jì nkaa nen ɗebish ɗe nyicinsǝ mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Nen ɗe mo shinzeen mpwoo ɗewur le nǝ, ɓǝ mo cìn baptisma mmo, parpuus mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo kat gurum mo ɗyikye koo ngal kun sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Moo tong ashak shidaar-shidaar mbǝ kǝlǝng kám mǝ jeplep Jesu mo, kǝ shaar ashak, kǝ moo sese ashak, kǝ ɗangnaan ashak zak.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 2:42">Tong Nǝ Dǝm Dan Jesu Mo<verse eid="ACT 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Jeplep mǝ Jesu nǝ mo, cìn mbii aapwoo mo kǝ mbii lukshik mo ɗes, nǝ le kǝ gurum mo kǝǝr Naan zam. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/>Nen ɗe mo shinzeen nJesu jir, ɓǝ mo ɓalkaa mo mo ashak, kǝ mo le mbii mo mo ashak jir, a pee mǝndong. <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Mo sǝrep mbii mo mo, kǝ long fur mo jir, mbǝkǝ mo shwap ɗi ashak, koo a wii, ɓǝ baa wur kat mee mbii jee nwur kas. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Koo puus ɗeɗangyii ɓǝ moo dǝm kuur ashak, nɗǝǝn Lu Naan ɗeɗes nǝ, kǝzak mo kǝ se mbiise fur mo ashak nɗǝǝn lu fur mo shi retnyit hakyeng, kǝ shi pǝtuup ɗemǝndong. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Moo kwoop Naan, ɗang gurum moo kǝlǝng retnyit kǝ mo. Koo a puus ɗeɗangyii, ɓǝ Daa wur jì kǝ nen ɗe mo kǝ kat ɓam ɗyikye mmo.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Pita Bar Mee Gwar Ɗewur A Kurumkut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Par sǝ ɓǝ Pita kǝ Joon mo kàa nLu Naan ɗeɗes mbǝ ɗangnaan koo kun ɗe mǝ puus sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Yaksǝ mo kat mee gwar ɗe mo làa wur a kurumkut mpwoo lu nǝ, ɗe moo pet a Ɗeret. Koo puus ɗeɗangyii ɓǝ moo mang wur jì le mpwoo lu nǝ, mbǝkǝ nwur ɗang shool ɗi pǝ nen ɗe moo ɗel nɗǝǝn Lu Naan ɗeɗes nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Kaaɗe wur naa Pita kǝ Joon mo mbǝ ɗel nɗǝǝn Lu Naan nǝ, ɓǝ wur ɗang shool pǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Pita kǝ Joon mo ban yit nkaa wur. Ɓǝ Pita sat ngwar nǝ nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A naa mun.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Yaksǝ wur lepyit nkaa mo, mbǝɗe wur pan nǝ, mon nshin mee mbii nɗin. <verse eid="ACT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Pita sat ngwar nǝ nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Baa an kǝ mee shool azurfa, koo zinariya kas. Mbii ɗe an kǝ nǝ, ɓǝ an nshin ngha. Nɗǝǝn sǝm kǝ Jesu Kristi ngu Nazaret, a yool a mwaan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>Pita yaa sarse mǝ gwar nǝ, kǝn nwur wur ɗiyeep gwar nǝ ɗi. Yaksǝ abet-abet, ɓǝ kwakshii wur mo, kǝ ɓaas wur mo katɓal. <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>Ɓǝ gwar nǝ yool mǝreppee shi shii fin mo, ɗang wur ɗoom mwaan, dǝm ɗel nɗǝǝn Lu Naan ɗeɗes nǝ ashak kǝ mo zak. Wur nkaa mwaan, ɗang wur nkaa mǝreppee, kǝzak wur nkaa kwoop Naan. <verse eid="ACT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>Kaaɗe gurum mo naa wur nkaa mwaan, ɗang wur nkaa kwoop Naan, <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>ɓǝ mo man nǝ, a gwar ɗe di moo mang wur jì le mpwoo lu Naan ɗe moo pet a Ɗeret mbǝkǝ nwur ɗang shool ɗi pǝ gurum mo. Nǝ aapwoo ngurum nǝ mo zam, kǝzak nǝ lekǝǝrmuut mo mbǝ mbii ɗe mo cin ngwar nǝ.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita Leshap Ngurum Mo nDǝǝn Lu Naan Ɗeɗes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>Kaaɗe gwar nǝ wur ɗyiin nɗang Pita kǝ Joon, ɓǝ nǝ aapwoo ngurum nǝ mo zam, yaksǝ mo su dǝm pǝ mo ɗi nɗǝǝn kuut ɗe moo pet a mǝ Solomon. <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Kaaɗe Pita naa a kǝsǝ, ɓǝ wur sat ngurum nǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wun nen Isreil mo! A mii le ɗang bar gwar ɗesǝ nǝ aapwoo nwun yii? A mii le ɗang wuu ban yit nkaa mun, koo a shi mee ɗeɗes fun, koo a shi mee ɗeret fun, ɗang mu le ngwar ɗesǝ mwaan yii? <verse eid="ACT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/>A Naan mǝ Abraham kǝ mǝ Aizik kǝ mǝ Jekop, kǝ mǝ puun fun mo, a wur le nguɗak fin Jesu a ɗeɗes. Dǝ a wun wu seet Jesu, ɗang wu cii wur ntoom Pailet, kaaɗe Pailet sat nǝ, ɗyin mbǝ ɓwet Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/>Dǝ wu cii ngwe Ɗeɓang, ɗewur a ngwe ɗe ndǝre, mbǝkǝ nwun ɗang mmo ɓwet a ngutukáa ɗi nwun. <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>Wu tu ngwe ɗewur a tuus mǝ seen, ɗe a wur shin seen ngurum mo. Ɗangɓe Naan yool kǝ wur a peemúut, ɗang mun a langtǝng mǝnǝ. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>A shi shinzeen nɗǝǝn sǝm kǝ Jesu, a nǝ le ɗang gwar ɗesǝ, kat bar. Gwar ɗe wu naa, kǝ ɗe wu man sǝ. A nɗǝǝn sǝm kǝ Jesu, kǝ shinzeen ɗe nǝ put pǝ wur ɗi, a nǝ le ngwar ɗesǝ wur ɗee a ngu nkoom kǝdǝng-dǝng, a yit fuu jir.<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>&lt;&lt;Yaksǝ ɗyemnaa mo, wen man nǝ, mbii ɗe dǝ wun kǝ nennan fuu mo, wu cìn nJesu, ɓǝ dǝ wu cìn a mbǝ ciin man. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Ɗangɓe Naan yit kǝ mo cìn mbii ɗesǝ mo jir, a mbǝkǝ mmo gampwoo ɗe gyet Naan kǝ ten sat mpwoo nensatpwoo fin mo nǝ, Kristi fin mbǝ shwaajeel. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Wu tuwap, mbǝkǝ nwun ciir pǝ Naan ɗi, mbǝkǝ nNaan fwoo shikbish fuu mo ɗi nwun. Katɗang wu tuwap azeen-zeen, ɓǝ Naan mbǝ naa ngam wun shi mbii ɗe mo a mǝ Riin fin, mbǝkǝ taji nǝ waam wun kas. <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>Kǝ wur mbǝ lep Jesu Kristi, ɗewur kǝ ten bǝlǝp wur mbǝ wun. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Wur mbǝ tong nɗǝǝn ɗengnaan, dǝm wul parɗe Naan ciir kǝ mbii mo ɗee a ɗepwoo jir akuɗang. Kaaɗe gyet Naan kǝ ten cweer mpwoo nensatpwoo fin ɗeɓang mo pǝgyet ɗi yam-yam sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/>Gyet Mosis sat nǝnee, &lt;Daa Naan fuu mbǝ yool kǝ mee ngusatpwoo fin nwun, mɓut nnen fuu mo, kaa wen sǝ.&gt; Nǝ a tǝng nwun lekom, kǝ nwun kǝlǝng mbii ɗewur mbǝ sat mo ɗi nwun jir. <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/>Koo a ngwe ɗeɗangyii ɗe baa wur mbǝ lekom kǝ nwur kǝlǝng ngusatpwoo Naan mǝnǝ ɗi kas, ɓǝ mon nshang wur baa kǝ nǝ mɓut nen Naan mo. <verse eid="ACT 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>Nensatpwoo mǝ Naan mo jir, yool mɓít Samuwel, kǝ nensatpwoo Naan ɗe mo jì mɓwoon wur zak, mo jir mo kǝ ten leshap nkaa teer ɗesǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/>Pwoo ɗe gyet Naan wur cweer mpwoo nensatpwoo fin mo nǝ a mbǝ wun, kǝ nwun sekop mǝ mbii ɗe gyet Naan wur kǝ ten cweer mpuun fuu mo shi toom, kǝ ɗe gyet wur sat Abraham nǝnee, &lt;A nɗǝǝn ɗang fwaa, ɓǝ gurum ɗe nɗǝǝn yil nǝ mo jir, mon nkat ɗeret.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Kaaɗe Naan wur bǝlǝp nguɗak fin, ɓǝ Naan wur shee lep wur shin jì a pǝ wun ɗi, mbǝkǝ nwur le ɗeret ɗi nkaa wun, kǝ mbǝkǝ nǝ ciir ɗi kǝ koo a wii nɗǝǝn wun, kǝ nwur yit cìn mbii ɗebish mo ɗi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Pita Kǝ Joon, Ntoom Nennan Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Kaaɗe Pita kǝ Joon, mo ɗi nkaa leshap ngurum nǝ mo, ɓǝ pak pris mo, kǝ ngwe ɗeɗes mǝ nentap Lu Naan ɗeɗes, kǝ pak nen Sadusi mo, mo jì pǝ mo ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Nǝ láa mmo mɓut, mbǝɗe jeplep ɗevǝl nǝ mo, nkaa kám ngurum mo nǝ, Jesu kǝ yool a peemúut. Ɗe nǝ kám nǝ, katɗang gurum mo murep, ɓǝ mon nyool a peemúut mmǝnǝ. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Mo yaa Pita kǝ Joon, ɓǝ mo dǝm shoot mo teer nlushoot, mbǝɗe kansǝǝn kǝ cìn. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Jir aasǝ gurum mo ɗes mo shinzeen mpwoo nǝ, ɗe daas mo kus kǝ wul ngal paat.<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Dǝɗaar nǝ, ɓǝ nen taatǝleng mǝ nen Yahudi mo, kǝ nen ɗenan-nan mo mo, kǝ nenkám Wàar Mosis mo, mo kuur ashak, nJerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Kǝ Anas ɗewur a pris ɗeɗes met jir, wur ɗi ashak kǝ mo, kǝ Kayafas, kǝ Joon kǝ Alekzanda, kǝ nen ɗe mo a ɗang mǝ pris ɗeɗes met jir nǝ zak. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Kaaɗe mo lep kǝ mmo dǝm jì kǝ Pita kǝ Joon, ɓǝ mo le mmo ɗar ntoom mo. Yaksǝ mo ɗoom tal pǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A shi ɗeɗes mǝ wii, koo a nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ wii, ɓǝ wuu cìn mbii ɗesǝ yii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Mbǝɗǝ Pita wur gam kǝ Riin Ɗeɓang, ɓǝ wur lap mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wun nen taatǝleng mǝ gurum mo, kǝ nen ɗenan-nan mo. <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>Katɗang wu tokɗyeel mun cicinsǝ a mbǝ ɗeret ɗe mo cìn ngwar ɗe dǝ wur a kurumkut sǝ, kǝ nkaa ar ɗe gwar nǝ wur ɗee a ɗebǝbar sǝ, <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>ɓǝ wu yit kǝ mbii ɗesǝ ɗee a mǝ man pǝ wun ɗi, kǝ nen Isreil mo jir nee, a shi sǝm mǝ Jesu Kristi ngu Nazaret, ɗe wu pwas wur nkaa shiyeep ɗewur muut, ɗangnaan yool kǝ wur a peemúut. A mbǝ Jesu, ɗang gwar ɗesǝ wur ɗar ntoom fuu a ɗebǝbar. <verse eid="ACT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/>A Jesu a ngwe ɗe mo kǝ ten ran pwoo nkaa wur nɗǝǝn ɓǝǝt-haal mǝ Naan nǝnee, &lt;Ngǝk ɗe wun nen ɗyiklu mo wu cii, ɓǝ a nǝ ɗee a ngǝk ɗekǝkoop met jir nɗǝǝn kwang mǝ lu nǝ.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>Baa gurum mon nwaa mak kat mee ɓam pǝ mee ngwe ɗi kas. Mbǝɗǝ nɗǝǝn yil ɗesǝ jir, ɓǝ baa Naan kǝ shin ɗeɗes mmee ngwe, mbǝkǝ nwur ɓam gurum mo ɗi kas, tǝng a nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Jesu Kristi ɓejee ɗak&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Kaaɗe mo naa Pita kǝ Joon, mo leshap ɓalɓal, baa kǝ mee kǝǝrmuut kas, ɓǝ nǝ aapwoo mmo, mbǝɗe baa Pita kǝ Joon mo a mee mbii kas, kǝzak baa mo kǝ kam tang ran dǝm jong kas zak nǝ tang mo pǝtuup nǝ ɗe mo ashak kǝ Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Baa nenɓeetpwoo nǝ mo mak cìn mee mbii kas, mbǝɗe mo naa gwar ɗe mo kǝ bar wur nǝ, wur ɗar ɗi ashak kǝ Pita kǝ Joon. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Aasǝ, ɓǝ mo le kǝ mmo pwat kǝ Pita kǝ Joon, mbǝkǝ mmo ɓeet ɗi ashak mbii ɗe mon ncìn kǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>Mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Mmun ncìn a mii kǝ nen ɗesǝ mo yii? Azeen-zeen gurum ɗe moo tong nɗǝǝn nJerusalem jir, mo kǝ man nǝ, Naan kǝ cìn mee mbii lukshik ɗeɗes nsar kǝ Pita kǝ Joon, ɗang baa mun mmak cíipwoo nǝ kas. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Mbǝkǝ taji gurum mo ɗes mo kǝlǝng pwoo ɗesǝ nǝ kas, ɓǝ wu yit kǝ mmun cíi mmo nǝ, taji mo baa leshap ɗi mmee gurum nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Jesu kas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Kaaɗe mo waa pet Pita kǝ Joon mo ɗel, ɓǝ mo sat mmo ɓalɓal nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Taji wu baa wu sat meepwoo, koo wu kám mee mbii nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Jesu kas.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Ɗangɓe Pita kǝ Joon mo lap mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wun shikáa fuu wu ɓeet, kyet nǝn nret nNaan nyit kǝ mmun cìn a mbii ɗe wun wu sat aa? Koo a mbii ɗe Naan sat yii? <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Baa mun mbǝ nook leshap nkaa mbii ɗe mu naa, kǝ mbii ɗe mu kǝlǝng kas.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Aɓwoon ɗe mo kǝ gwak mo ɓalɓal kǝ lekǝǝrmuut mmo, ɓǝ mo ɓwet mo, baa nenɓeetpwoo nǝ mo mak cin mee kar ɗebish mPita kǝ Joon kas, mbǝɗe gurum nǝ mo jir, mon nkaa kwoop Naan mbǝ mbii ɗe mo naa nǝ cìn. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Gwar ɗe mo bar wur shi ar ɗe mǝ aapwoo nǝ, ɓit wur mo met nlaarfeer.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nenshínzeen Mo Ɗangnaan Mbǝ Leshap Ɗeret Nǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Kaaɗe mo ɓwet Pita kǝ Joon, ɓǝ mo dǝm pǝ nniyee fur mo ɗi. Mo sat nniyee fur nǝ mo, mbii ɗe pris ɗenan-nan mo, kǝ nen ɗenan-nan mo sat mmo jir. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/>Kaaɗe nen shinzeen nǝ mo kǝlǝng pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo ɗangnaan shi pǝtuup mǝndong, nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Daa Ɗehai, ɗe waa a le ɗeng kǝ yil, kǝ am kuur mo, kǝ mbii ɗe mo nɗǝǝn mo jir. <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/>Gyet a shi Riin Ɗeɓang, ɓǝ waa a leshap mpwoo mǝ kǝrem fwaa ɗewur a puunkaam fun Devit nǝnee &lt;A mii le ɗang gurum ɗe baa mo a nen Yahudi mo kas, mo yool ntuup yii? A mii le ɗang gurum nǝ mo kǝ pan ɗebish nɗǝǝn pǝtuup fur mo, mbǝ cìn mbii ɗebuu mo yii? <verse eid="ACT 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>Deskoom ɗe mǝ yil nǝ mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">mo kǝ ɗak sut fur mo mbǝ lek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">kǝ nenpanyil mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">kǝ ɓalkaa fur mo ashak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">mbǝkǝ mmo yaa lek ɗi kǝ Daa Naan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">kǝ Kristi fin zak.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>Mbǝɗǝ azeen-zeen nɗǝǝn pee nkaam ɗesǝ, ɓǝ Herot kǝ Pontus Pailet, ashak kǝ nen ɗe baa mo a nen Yahudi mo kas, kǝ nen Isreil mo, mo kǝ kuur ashak, mbǝkǝ mmo ɗee a shaarlek mǝ nguɗak fwaa Jesu Ɗeɓang, ɗe waa a bǝlǝp wur, ɗe a gha le nwur ɗee a Kristi. <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Mo kuur ashak, mbǝkǝ mmo cìn koo a mbii ɗeɗangyii ɗe a gha aa ten a le shi iiko fwaa kǝ reɓet fwaa nǝ, mbii nǝ mon ncìn a kǝsǝ. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Yaksǝ Daa Naan a naa kǝǝrmuut ɗe moo le mmun. A shínɓal mmun kǝrem fwaa mo, mbǝkǝ mmun satpwoo fwaa ɗi ɓalɓal, baa ashak kǝ kǝǝrmuut kas. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>A le kǝn iiko fwaa nǝ bar gurum mo, kǝ a le kǝ mbii lukshik mo kǝ mbii aapwoo mo cìn nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ nguɗak fwaa Jesu Ɗeɓang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Kaaɗe mo kyes ɗangnaan mǝnǝ, ɓǝ pee ɗe moo kuur ɗi ashak, nǝ sǝǝn. Mo gam kǝ Riin Ɗeɓang jir, yaksǝ mo yaa satpwoo mǝ Naan ɓalɓal agaak, baa ashak kǝ kǝǝrmuut kas.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nenshínzeen Nǝ Mo Lelong Fur Mo Ashak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>Nen ɗe mo shinzeen nJesu jir, ɓǝ pan mo mo, kǝ mǝse mo mo ɗee a ɗemǝndong jir zak. Baa mee gurum nɗǝǝn mo mak sat nǝ, long fin nǝ a mǝnǝ mbǝshin kas, ɗang mo le mbii fur mo jir, ashak. <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Jeplep nǝ mo ɗee a langtǝng shi iiko, nkaa yool mǝ Daa Jesu a peemúut. Daa Naan le ɗeret nkaa mo jir hakyeng. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Baa mee ngwe ɗee, a ngujeel nɗǝǝn mo koo mǝndong kas, mbǝɗe nen ɗe mo kǝ maar mo, kǝ lu mo, ɓǝ mo sǝrep mo jir, <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>ɓǝ mo jì shin shool mǝ mbii ɗe mo kǝ sǝrep nǝ mon njeplep mǝ Jesu nǝ mo. Ɓǝ jeplep nǝ mo shwap shool nǝ nnen shinzeen nǝ mo nciit-nciit, mbǝkǝ koo ngwe ɗeɗangyii, ɓǝ wur kat mbii ɗewur kǝ reɓet.<verse eid="ACT 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Kaaɗe mo nkaa cìn mǝnǝ kǝsǝ, ɓǝ Josep ngu Livai, ɗewur put a nyil nSaiprus, kǝ ɗe jeplep nǝ mo le sǝm nwur a Barnabas, (ɗe shii mǝ sǝm mǝnǝ a nǝ, Ngwe ɗewur kǝ caapee). <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>Wur mang mee maar fin seet, ɓǝ wur jì shin shool nǝ jir njeplep nǝ mo.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Ananiyas Kǝ Mat Fin Saffira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Mee gwar ɗi, ɗe moo pet sǝm wur a Ananiyas, kǝ mat fin Saffira, mo mang mee maar fur mo seet. <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>Ɗangɓe wur kǝ mat fin mo ɓalpwoo mo ashak, mbǝkǝ mmo sok pak shool nǝ ɗi, ɗang Ananiyas jì shin koor shool nǝ njeplep nǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Ɗangɓe Pita sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ananiyas, a mii le ɗang a yit kǝ nngujwaan gam pǝtuup fwaa, kǝn nghan cìn ɗung ɗi nRiin Ɗeɓangyii? Mbǝɗǝ aa sok pak shool maar nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Akuɗang aa mang maar nǝ a seet, ɓǝ baa dǝ nǝ a mwaa kas aa? Kǝzak aɓwoon ɗe dǝ a mang maar nǝ a seet, ɓǝ baa shool nǝ a mwaa kas ee? A mii le ɗang a kat pan mǝ cìn mbii ɗesǝ nɗǝǝn pǝtuup fwaa yii? Baa a cìn ɗung ɗesǝ nǝ a ngurum mo kas, a cìn ɗung nǝ a nNaan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Kaaɗe Ananiyas kǝlǝng pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ wur taa nyil, wur muut. Nen ɗe mo kǝlǝng muut nǝ jir, ɓǝ kǝǝrmuut ɗeɗes yaa mo hakyeng. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Zǝlang mo jì ɗel nɗǝǝn lu nǝ, ɓǝ mo ɓwoot kúm wur nǝ shi zaal, ɓǝ mo mang kúm nǝ put kǝ nǝ a tool, ɗang dǝm wum wur.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Aɓwoon ɗe mo tong koo awa kun sǝ, ɓǝ mat wur Saffira jì ɗel nlu nǝ. Baa war man mbii ɗe nǝ kǝ tung kas. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Pita tal pǝ war nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Yi sat nghan, kyet a jee mǝ shool ɗe wu seet kǝ maar nǝ nɗesǝ aa?&gt;&gt; War lap nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ii, a jee shool nǝ mmǝnǝ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Pita sat nwar nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A mii le ɗang wu ɓalpwoo ashak kǝ mish fii, mbǝkǝ nwun wu kam Riin mǝ Daa Naan ɗi ee? Yi kǝlǝng shii mǝ nen ɗe mo waa nwum mish fii mo kǝ jì wul mpwoo lu sǝ. Mo mbǝ mang kúm fii nǝ put kǝ nǝ a kǝsǝ zak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Abet-abet ɓǝ war sham taa nyil nshii Pita, yaksǝ war muut. Kaaɗe zǝlang nǝ mo jì ɗel nlu nǝ, ɓǝ mo kat war kǝ muut, ɓǝ mo mang kúm nǝ put kǝ nǝ a tool, ɓǝ mo dǝm wum war pǝshak kǝ mish fer. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Kǝǝrmuut ɗeɗes yaa nen shinzeen nǝ mo jir, kǝ nen ɗe mo kǝlǝng pwoo nkaa mbii mǝnǝ mo.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jeplep Mo Cìn mBii Lukshik Kǝ mBii Aapwoo Mo Ɗes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Jeplep nǝ mo cìn mbii lukshik mo, kǝ mbii aapwoo mo ɗes, nnaar gurum nǝ mo. Nenshínzeen nǝ moo kuur ashak jir nɗǝǝn kuut mǝ Solomon shi pǝtuup ɗemǝndong. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Ɗangɓe nɗǝǝn koor gurum ɗe baa mo shinzeen kas, ɓǝ baa mee ngwe mak gung, ɗewur mɓàlkáa fin ashak kǝ mo kas. Jir kǝsǝ, ɓǝ gurum mo kǝ kwoop mo hakyeng. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Gurum mo ɗes, daas mo kǝ shurep mo, mo shinzeen nDaa, ɓǝ mo ɓalkaa fur mo ashak kǝ nen shinzeen nǝ mo, ɗe nen shinzeen nǝ mo ɗes hakyeng. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Mbǝ mbii aapwoo ɗe jeplep nǝ mo cìn, ɓǝ gurum mo kok nengok mo jì le pǝkom ar nkaa gwaansaam mo, kǝ kurkwaa mo, mbǝkǝ katɗang Pita jì ɗel, ɓǝ mǝ riin wur nǝ ntáa tung pak nengok nǝ mo ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Nen ɗe mo nɗǝǝn yil ɗe mo neer Jerusalem ciirkaat mo jì kuur. Mo jì kǝ nen ɗe baa mo kǝlǝng koom kas, kǝ nen ɗe riin ɗebish mo kǝ lejeel mmo, ɓǝ jeplep nǝ mo bar mo jir.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Lejeel nJeplep Nǝ Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Pris ɗeɗes met jir kǝ nen ɗe mo ashak kǝ wur jir, ɗe mo a soon mǝ nen Sadusi mo, mo gam kǝ zuur mbǝ jeplep nǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>Mo yak jeplep nǝ mo, mo dǝm le mo nɗǝǝn lushoot. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Ɗangɓe mpar, ɓǝ mee ngulep mǝ Daa jì wang pwoo lushoot nǝ mmo, ɓǝ wur pwat kǝ mo, ɗang wur sat mmo nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>&lt;&lt;Wu dǝm, wu ɗar nɗǝǝn Lu mǝ Naan ɗeɗes nǝ, kǝn nwun satpwoo mǝ seen ɗesǝ nǝ ɗi ngurum mo jir.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Kaaɗe mo kǝlǝng pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ ɗaar mɓít-mɓít, mo dǝm ɗel nɗǝǝn Lu mǝ Naan ɗeɗes nǝ, ɓǝ mo yaa kámpwoo Naan ngurum mo. Ɓǝ pris ɗeɗes met nǝ jì kǝ nen ɗe mo ashak kǝ wur, ɓǝ mo pǝrep nenɓeetpwoo mo, kǝ nen ɗenan-nan ɗe mǝ nen Yahudi mo, mo kuur ashak jir. Yaksǝ mo lep jepkam mo shindǝm nlushoot nǝ, mbǝkǝ mmo jì ɗi kǝ jeplep nǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Ɗangɓe kaaɗe jepkam nǝ mo dǝm, ɓǝ baa mo dǝm kat jeplep nǝ mo ɗi nɗǝǝn lushoot nǝ kas. Yaksǝ jepkam nǝ mo baaji sat mmo nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>&lt;&lt;Mu kat lushoot nǝ a shishoot rǝrret, kǝ nentappee nǝ mo kǝ ɗar mpwoo lu nǝ mo, ɗang kaaɗe mu wang lu nǝ, ɓǝ baa mu kat jeplep nǝ mo ɗi kas.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Kaaɗe ngwe ɗeɗes nkaa nentap Lu mǝ Naan ɗeɗes nǝ, kǝ pris ɗǝnan-nan mo kǝlǝng pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ nǝ daampee mmo zam, mbǝ jeplep nǝ mo, mbǝɗe baa mo man mbii ɗe nǝ kǝ kat jeplep nǝ mo kas. <verse eid="ACT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Mee gurum jì sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wu naa, nen ɗe wu le mo nɗǝǝn lushoot sǝ, mon nkaa kam-kam ngurum mo nɗǝǝn Lu mǝ Naan ɗeɗes nǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Yaksǝ ngwe ɗeɗes nkaa nentap Lu mǝ Naan ɗeɗes nǝ dǝm, ashak kǝ pak nentap lu mǝ Naan nǝ mo, mo dǝm jì kǝ jeplep nǝ mo. Ɗang baa mo dǝm jì kǝ mo a shi mee ɓal kas, mbǝɗe mo kǝǝr gurum nǝ mo, mbǝkǝ taji gurum nǝ mo car mo shi ndǝng kas.<verse eid="ACT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Kaaɗe mo jì kǝ jeplep nǝ mo, ɓǝ mo le mmo ɗar ntoom mǝ nenɓeetpwoo nǝ mo. Yaksǝ pris ɗeɗes met jir nǝ tal pǝ Pita kǝ Joon nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/>&lt;&lt;Muu tǝǝrsar nwun ɓalɓal nǝ, taji baa wu kám mee mbii ngurum mo nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Jesu kas. Ɗangɓe mbii ɗe wuu cìn ɗesǝ nǝ, wuu ɗaar a mbǝkǝ nwun sat ɗi ngurum mo nǝ, a mun mu tu gwar ɗesǝ nǝ, kǝzak wu gam Jerusalem shi kám fuu ɗesǝ nǝ zak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Ɗangɓe Pita kǝ jeplep nǝ mo, mo lap mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Nǝ a tǝng kǝ mun cìn a mbii ɗe Naan sat, met mbii ɗe gurum mo sat. <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>Jesu ɗe wu tu wur, ɗe wu pwas wur nkaa shiyeepyoom, ɓǝ Naan mǝ puun fun mo, kǝ yool kǝ Jesu a peemúut. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Naan kǝ yool kǝ Jesu a peemúut, ɓǝ yaksǝ Jesu kǝ tong nsarse mǝ Naan, a wur a Laakop kǝ Nguɓam zak. A wur wang ar tuwap nnen Isreil mo, mbǝkǝ nNaan fwo shikbish mo mo ɗi zak. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Mun a langtǝng mǝ mbii ɗesǝ mo, kǝ Riin Ɗeɓang ɗe Naan shin nnen ɗe mo cìn ɗyen wur, mo kǝ cìn langtǝng nǝ a kǝsǝ zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Kaaɗe kuur mǝ nenɓeetpwoo nǝ mo kǝlǝng pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ nǝ láa mmo mɓut hakyeng, dǝm wul a ɗe moo reɓet twe jeplep nǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Ɗang mee ngu Farisi ɗe kǝ kám Wàar mǝ Mosis, ɗi sǝm wur a Gamaliyel, gurum mo jir mo kǝ shin ɗeɗes nwur. Wur yool ɗar atǝng nɗǝǝn lu ɓeetpwoo nǝ, ɓǝ wur le kǝ mmo pwat kǝ jeplep nǝ mo a tool ɓe reppee lee. <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>Ɓǝ wur sat nnen ɓeetpwoo nǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa mo, nen Isreil mo. Wu tap kǝ mbii ɗe wuu reɓet cìn nǝn ndes ɗesǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Gyet yam-yam, ɓǝ mee gwar ɗe, ɗe mo kǝ pet sǝm wur a Tudas, wur kǝ cam yool a kǝsǝ. Gyet wur lekáa fin a koo mee ngwe ɗeɗes sǝ, ɗe gurum mo koo kambil feer sǝ mo dǝm nɗang wur. Ɗang aɓwoon ɗe mo tu wur, ɓǝ nen ɗe mo dǝm nɗang wur nǝ jir, mo rangkáa, baa mo ɗee a mee mbii kas. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Aɓwoon Tudas, ɓǝ Judas, mee ngu Galili yool zak, nɗǝǝn ɓit ɗe moo tang ɗuu gurum mo ɗi, yaksǝ wur dul pak gurum mo dǝm nɗang shin, ɗang aɓwoon ɗe mo tu wur zak, ɓǝ nen ɗe mo dǝm nɗang wur jir, mo rangkáa. <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Mbǝmǝnǝ an pǝ sat nwun, taji wu cìn mee mbii ndes ɗesǝ mo kas. Wu yit mo mbǝsut. Mbǝɗǝ katɗang pwoo ɗe moo kám ngurum mo, kǝ ɗak ɗe mo kǝ cìn nǝ a mǝ mǝse mǝ gurum, ɓǝ nǝn nyool ɗee a ɗebuu. <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>Ɗang katɗang mbii ɗe moo cìn nǝ a mǝ Naan, ɓǝ baa mu mmak se koorong nkaa mo kas. Wu tap taji nwun ɗee koo wun a nlek kǝ Naan sǝ kas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Nenɓeetpwoo nǝ mo kǝlǝngkar Gamaliyel nǝ. Mo pǝrep jeplep nǝ mo cin jì ɗel zak, ɓǝ mo sǝrem mo, kǝzak mo tǝǝrsar mmo ɓalɓal nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Taji baa wu sat mee pwoo ɗi nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Jesu zak kas.&gt;&gt; Aɓwoon pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo ɓwet mo. <verse eid="ACT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Jeplep nǝ mo pwat ntoom mǝ nenɓeetpwoo nǝ mo shi retnyit, mbǝɗe mo mak shwaajeel mbǝ sǝm mǝ Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Yool parmǝnǝ, ɓǝ baa mo nook kám kǝ leshap mǝ Naan ngurum mo, nɗǝǝn Lu mǝ Naan ɗeɗes nǝ kǝ nɗǝǝn lu mǝ gurum mo, koo puus ɗeɗangyii kas, nǝ Jesu a Kristi.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Mo Bǝlip Nenɓam Mo Pwoovǝl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Kaaɗe nenseet nɗang Jesu mo ɗoom yaa ɓul, nɗǝǝn meeteer mǝnǝ mo, ɓǝ mee ɓǝlep yool nnaar mǝ nnen ɗe mo man pwoo mǝ nen Grik mo kǝ nen Yahudi ɗe mo kǝ tong nJerusalem, mbǝɗe nen ɗe mo man pwoo Grik nǝ mo sat nǝ, baa mo kǝ shìn mbiise Matkáa fur mo mɓut mbiise ɗe moo shwap shidaar-shidaar kas. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Aasǝ ɓǝ, jeplep ɗe kaapaat baavǝl nǝ mo pǝrep kuur mǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu mo jir, kǝ mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Baa nǝ ret kǝ mmun nook satpwoo mǝ Naan, mbǝkǝ mu ɗee ɗi ɓàk mbiise kas. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ, ɗyemnaa mo, wu bǝlǝp mee gurum mo pwoovǝl nnaar fuu, ɗe mo kǝ mǝse ɗeret, kǝ ɗe mo gam kǝ Riin Ɗeɓang, kǝ ɗe mo manshii mǝ mbii zak. Mbǝkǝ mun le mo tap ɗi kǝ ɗak shwap mbiise nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Ɗang mun, mbǝ sekyeen kǝ ɗangnaan shidaar-shidaar kǝ satpwoo mǝ Naan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Pwoo ɗe jeplep nǝ mo sat nǝ, ret nkuur mǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo jir. Aasǝ ɓǝ mo bǝlǝp Stivin, ɗewur gam kǝ shinzeen, kǝ Riin Ɗeɓang, kǝ Filip, kǝ Prokorus, kǝ Nikanor, kǝ Timoti, kǝ Parmenas, kǝ Nikolas ngu Antiyok, ɗe gyet wur kǝ piring mbǝ seyil nNaan mǝ nen Yahudi mo. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Mo jì kǝ nen ɗe mo kǝ bǝlǝp mo ntoom jeplep nǝ mo, ɓǝ mo ɗangnaan kǝzak mo lesar fur mo nkaa mo.<verse eid="ACT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Pwoo Naan nǝ sekyeen, dǝm wul a ɗe nenseet nɗang Jesu ɗe mon nJerusalem mo ɓul ɗes hakyeng, kǝ pris mo ɗes mo shinzeen nJesu Kristi.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Yaa Stivin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Stivin, ɗewur gam kǝ ɗeret kǝ ɓal mǝ Naan, wur cìn mbii lukshik mo, kǝ mbii aapwoo ɗenan mo nnaar gurum mo. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Ɗangɓe pak gurum mo ɗi, ɗe mo a mmee lu Naan ɗe mo kǝ pet a lu Naan mǝ nen Frimen mo. Nen ɗesǝ mo a nnen Yahudi ɗe mo pwat nyil nSairin, kǝ Alekzandriya, kǝ ngaar yil nSilisiya, kǝ mǝ yil Eshiya mo zak, mo yool kǝ pwoo mo, kǝ ɓeetshik nkaa Stivin. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Ɗang baa mo mak katɓal ɗe mon nɗar kǝn mo cin ɓeetshik ɗi kǝ Stivin kas, mbǝɗe wur leshap a shi ɗyen ɗe Riin mǝ Naan shin nwur. <verse eid="ACT 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Mo kar pak gurum mo a sǝsok, mbǝkǝ mmo sat ɗi nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Mu kǝlǝng Stivin satpwoo ɗebish nkaa Mosis, ɗang wur baa satpwoo ɗebuu nkaa Naan zak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Pwoo ɗe mo sat nǝ láa ngurum nǝ mo mɓut, ɓǝ pak nen ɗǝnan-nan mo, kǝ pak nenkám Wàar Mosis mo. Mo yool kǝ tuup, mo dǝm yaa Stivin, ɓǝ mo jì kǝ wur ntoom mǝ kuur mǝ nenɓeetpwoo mo. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Kǝzak mo jì kǝ langtǝng mǝ ɗung mo, ɗe mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Gwar ɗesǝ wur leshap ɗebish nkaa Lu Naan ɗeɗes nǝ, kǝ nkaa Wàar Mosis shidaar-shidaar zak. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Mu kǝlǝng wur sat nǝ, Jesu ngu Nazaret mbǝ shirip Lu mǝ Naan ɗeɗes nǝ, kǝn nwur cǝǝr kǝ mbii ɗe muu loot kǝ cìn mo, ɗe gyet Mosis shin mo mmun.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Nen ɗe moo tong ɗi a pee ɓeetpwoo nǝ jir, mo ban yit fur mo nkaa Stivin, ɓǝ mo naa yit wur nǝ ɗee a koo yit ngulep mǝ Naan sǝ.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Stivin Leshap nKuur Mǝ Nenɓeetpwoo Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Pris ɗeɗes met jir nǝ wur tal pǝ Stivin nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Mbii ɗe moo sat nkaa gha sǝ, mo azeen aa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>Yaksǝ Stivin lap nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa mo, kǝ puun mo, wu lekom, kǝn nwun kǝlǝng mbii ɗe an mbǝ sat nǝ ɗi. Gyet Naan Ɗehai wur woo shin fin mpuun fun Abraham, ɓǝ wur kutɗi nyil mMesopotamiya, akuɗang wur dǝm tong nɗǝǝn yil nHaran. <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>Naan sat nwur nǝnee, &lt;A yool a yit yil fwaa, kǝ ɗang fwaa mo zak, kǝn nghan dǝm ɗi mmee yil ɗe an mbǝ kám nǝ ngha.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/>Abraham yool yit yil nen Kaldiya mo, kǝn wur dǝm tong ɗi nɗǝǝn yil nHaran. Aɓwoon ɗe puun Abraham muut nyil nHaran, ɓǝ Naan jì kǝ Abraham nɗǝǝn yil ɗesǝ, ɗe wuu tong nɗǝǝn nǝ yaksǝ. <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/>Ɗangɓǝ baa Naan shin rep pak yil nǝ Abraham, mbǝkǝ nǝ ɗee ɗi a mǝ káa wur, koo kaa mang shii mǝndong sǝ kas. Jir kǝsǝ, ɓǝ Naan cweerpwoo Abraham nǝ, wur mbǝ shin yil nǝ Abraham, kǝ nǝ ɗee a mbii sekop wur, dǝm wul kǝ ɗang wur ɗe mon njì mɓwoon wur zak. Koo ɗe gyet mɓít mǝnǝ, ɓǝ baa Abraham kǝ mee làa kas aku. <verse eid="ACT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/>Gyet Naan sat zak nǝnee, &lt;Dang Abraham mon mbǝ ɗee a mǝzep mo nɗǝǝn mee yil ɗecì. Nenyil mǝnǝ mon nle kǝ mmo cìn ɗak laatong zak, kǝ mon nle mmo ɗee a kǝrem mo, mbǝ ɓit kambil feer.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/>Naan wur baa sat ɗyikye zak nǝnee, &lt;An mbǝ tokɗyeel nnen ɗe mo le mo ɗee a kǝrem, ɗang aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ an mbǝ pwat kǝ mo aku mɓut yil mǝnǝ, mbǝkǝ mmo jì seyil ɗi nghan nɗǝǝn pee ɗesǝ.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/>Naan sat Abraham can-can, kǝ nǝ ɗee a Sǝmpwoo (alaama) mǝ pwoo ɗe Naan kǝ ten cweer nAbraham shi toom. Mbǝ mǝnǝ kaaɗe Abraham làa Aizik, ɓǝ wur can ɗyem fin nǝ nkaa puus nɗepwookun. Aizik can làa wur Jekop a kǝsǝ zak, kǝ Jekop can jep fin mo, ɗe mo a puun fun ɗe kaapaat baavǝl sǝ mo a kǝsǝ zak.<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>&lt;&lt;Puun fun ɗesǝ mo, mo cìn zuur kǝ Josep, yaksǝ mo seet kǝ wur sham nyil Ijip koo kǝrem sǝ. Ɗangɓe Naan ɗi ashak kǝ wur. <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/>Naan ɓam Josef mɓut jeel ɗe mo taa nkaa wur jir. Naan shin ɗeret nJosep, kǝ manshii mǝ cìn mbii ntoom Feero, mishkoom Ijip, ɗe nǝ le nwur ɗen Josep a ɗeɗes nkaa yil Ijip, kǝ nkaa lu fin zak. <verse eid="ACT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/>Mee neen ɗeɗes taa nyil Ijip jir, kǝ yil nKeenan ɗe nǝ jì kǝ jeel ɗeɗes hakyeng, ɗe le baa puun fun mo kat mbiise kas. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>kaaɗe Jekop kǝlǝng nǝ, mbiise ɗi nyil Ijip, ɓǝ wur shee lep puun fun mo sham nyil Ijip nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/>A nɗǝǝn sham mo nɗevǝl nyil Ijip nǝ, ɗang Josef woo shin nɗyemnǝǝn fin mo. A mpeemǝnǝ, ɓǝ Feero man ɗang mǝ Josep mo jir. <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/>Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ Josep lep kǝ mmo kàa pet puun fin Jekop kǝ nen wur mo jir. Nen ɗe mo pet mo shin sham nyil Ijip nǝ jir, mo wul laarpwoovǝl baapaat. <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/>Nǝ le ɗang Jekop sham nyil Ijip, ɓǝ wur sham muut a nyil mǝnǝ, kǝzak puun fun mo jì murep a nyil Ijip zak. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/>Yaksǝ mo kok kúm mo mo kàa kǝ mo nyil nShekem, mbǝkǝ mo wum mo ɗi nɗǝǝn kǝcir ɗe gyet Abraham kǝ seet shi azurfa mo, nsar jep Hamor mo.<verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>kaaɗe pee nǝ wul kus, mbǝkǝ nNaan gam mbii ɗe gyet wur kǝ ten cweer Abraham, ɓǝ nen fun mo kǝ ɓul ɗes nɗǝǝn yil Ijip nǝ hakyeng. <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>Nen Ijip mo lep mee mishkoom ɗepwoo nyil Ijip, ɗe baa wur man mee pwoo nkaa Josep kas. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/>Mishkoom ɗesǝ wur gwam puun fun mo, ɗang wur shin jeel mpuun fun mo, wur le kǝ mpuun fun mo fwo jep fur mo mbǝkǝ mmo murep ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/>A nɗǝǝn ɓit mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo làa Mosis. Gyet Mosis a mee làa ɗeret naa zam. Puun wur mo kyeer wur nɗǝǝn lu mbǝ tar kun. <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/>Ɗang kaaɗe mo put dǝm le wur a tǝleng, ɓǝ reep Feero mang Mosis ɗyel, kǝ nwar kyeer wur koo làa fer sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Mo kám man mǝ nen Ijip mo mMosis jir, yaksǝ wur yool ɗee a mee ngwe ɗeɗes nɗǝǝn mbii ɗewur sat mo, kǝ mbii ɗewur cìn mo zak.<verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>&lt;&lt;Kaaɗe Mosis wul ɓit mo laarfeer, ɓǝ wur pan mputuup fin mbǝ dǝm naa ɗyemnǝǝn fin nen Isreil mo. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>Yaksǝ wur táa naa mee ngu Ijip nkaa shinjeel mmee ngu Isreil. Ɓǝ Mosis dǝm ɓam ngu Isreil nǝ, kǝ nwur lap ɗi ngwar nǝ. Yaksǝ Mosis tu ngu Ijip nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>Mosis pan nǝ, nen fin mo mmanshii mǝnǝ nǝ, Naan mbǝ ɓam mo a shi sar fin. Ɗang baa mo manshii nǝ kas. <verse eid="ACT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>Daar nǝ, ɓǝ Mosis kat mee nen Isreil mo vǝl, pǝ lek nshak. Yaksǝ wur reɓet ɓen mo, kǝ wur sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;Daa mo, wun a ɗyemnǝǝnshak, a mii le ɗang wuu lek nshak yii?&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>Ɗangɓǝ gwar ɗewur nkaa shinjeel ngǝnǝǝn nǝ, bet Mosis shin baa aku, kǝ nwur sat mMosis nǝnee, &lt;A wii le gha a mishkoom kǝ ngutokɗyeel nkaa mun ii? <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>Aa reɓet tu wen a kaaɗe doon a tu ngu Ijip sǝ mee?&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/>Kaaɗe Mosis kǝlǝng pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ wur su ar yil Ijip, kǝ nwur dǝm tong ɗi nyil mMidiyan, koo mǝzep sǝ. A nɗǝǝn yil mMidiyan nǝ, ɓǝ Mosis làa jep ɗemish mo vǝl.<verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>&lt;&lt;Aɓwoon ɓit mo laarfeer, ɓǝ mee ngulep mǝ Naan jì woo shin mMosis, shi mbǝlem wus nkaa mee laalǝǝt a yil kus kǝ zuul Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Kaaɗe Mosis naa wus nǝ, ɓǝ nǝ aapwoo nwur, ɓǝ wur gyes dǝm ɗi kus rep laalǝǝt nǝ, mbǝkǝ nwur naa ɗi rǝrret, ɓǝ wur kǝlǝng ɗoo mǝ Daa, nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>&lt;A an a Naan mǝ puun fwaa mo, Naan mǝ Abraham, kǝ mǝ Aizik, kǝ mǝ Jekop.&gt; Yaksǝ Mosis ɗaar, mbǝɗe kǝǝrmuut fes yaa wur zam, baa wur katɓal ɗewur mbǝ mak naa wus nǝ kas. <verse eid="ACT 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>Daa Naan sat mMosis nǝnee, &lt;A shwat kwoopshi ɗe mon nshii fwaa, mbǝɗe pee ɗe aa ɗar ɗi yaksǝ, nǝ a pee ɗeɓang. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Azeen-zeen, an kǝn naajeel nen fen ɗe mon nyil Ijip, kǝn kǝlǝng gwan mo mo. Mbǝmǝnǝ kǝn sham, mbǝkǝ nghan ɓam mo ɗi zak. Mbǝ mǝnǝ, a jì kǝ nghan lep gha shindǝm nyil Ijip.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>&lt;&lt;Gyet nen Isreil mo cii Mosis, ɓǝ gyet mo sat nǝnee, &lt;A wii le gha a mishkoom kǝ ngutokɗyeel nkaa mun yii?&gt; A Mosis a ngwe ɗe gyet Naan lep wur, mbǝkǝ nwur ɗee a Taakyeen kǝ Nguɓam mǝ nen Isreil mo shi ɓam mǝ ngulep mǝ Naan ɗe gyet wur woo shin mMosis nɗǝǝn rep laalǝǝt a yil sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/>A Mosis put kǝ nen Isreil mo nɗǝǝn yil Ijip, kǝzak gyet wur cìn mbii lukshik mo, kǝ mbii aapwoo mo nɗǝǝn yil Ijip nǝ, kǝ nɗǝǝn Am kuur Ɗenaat, kǝ a naaryil, mbǝ ɓit mo laarfeer zak.<verse eid="ACT 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/>&lt;&lt;Gyet a Mosis sat nnen Isreil mo nǝnee, &lt;Naan mbǝ yool lep mee ngusat pwoo Naan nwun, koo an sǝ, mɓut nnen fuu mo.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/>Gyet Mosis ɗi ashak kǝ kuur nen Isreil mo a naaryil, ashak kǝ puun fun mo, kǝ ngulep mǝ Naan ɗe gyet wur leshap kǝ Mosis nkaa nzuul Sinai. A mbǝɗe gyet Mosis kǝ kǝlǝngkar mǝ seen pǝ Naan ɗi shin mmun.<verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>&lt;&lt;Ɗangɓe gyet puun fun mo cii cìn mbii ɗe Mosis sat, kǝzak mo toklong shi Mosis, kǝ mo le mputuup fur mo mbǝ waa baa dǝm Ijip. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/>Mo sat Eeron nǝnee, &lt;A kǝlem pak naan mo mmun, ɗe mon ntaa mmun akyeen. Mbǝɗǝ baa mu man mbii ɗe nǝ kat Mosis ɗe gyet wur put kǝ mun nɗǝǝn nyil Ijip kas.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/>A nɗǝǝn meeteer mǝnǝ mo, ɓǝ mo kǝlem mee laanǝng kǝ nǝ ɗee mmo, koo mee naan sǝ. Mo jì kǝ mbiizuum mo laanǝng nǝ, yaksǝ mo serǝɓet mǝ retnyit mbǝ naan ɗe mo kǝlem shi sar fur mo. <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ ɓǝ Naan cǝǝr kǝɓwoon mmo, kǝzak wur le kǝ mmo seyil ɗi nzar mo, kǝ mbii ɗe aɗeng mo. Kaaɗe mo kǝ ten ran nɗǝǝn ɓǝǝt-haal mǝ nensatpwoo kǝ Naan mo nǝnee, &lt;Wun nen Isreil mo, nɗǝǝn ɓit ɗelaarfeer sǝ mo a naaryil, ɓǝ baa gyet wu saa long mo, kǝ wus mbiizuum mo, a mbǝ an kas. <verse eid="ACT 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>Ɗang gyet wuu mang a Tent mǝ kùm Molek, wu mwaan kǝ nǝ, kǝ zar mǝ kùm fuu Refan. Wu kǝlem mbii ɗesǝ mo, mbǝkǝ nwun seyil ɗi mmo. Mbǝ mǝnǝ, ɓǝ an mbǝ le kǝ mmo dǝm kǝ wun jong-jong, ɗe dǝm ɗel yil ɗe aɓwoon mBabilon.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>&lt;&lt;Gyet puun fun mo kǝ Tent mǝ langtǝng nǝ, Naan ɗi ashak kǝ mo a naaryil. Mo ɗak Tent mǝnǝ a nciit-nciit kǝ ɗe Naan shin mMosis naa. Mosis sat mmo tap ɗak a kǝsǝ zak. <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/>Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ puunkaam fun mo lap Tent mǝnǝ pǝ puun fur mo kǝ mmo mang Bìt mǝ Daa nǝ pan kaaɗe mo ɗel ashak kǝ Joshuwa nɗǝǝn yil ɗe Naan shin mmo. Naan ceen nenyil mǝnǝ mo, ɗe baa mo a nen Yahudi mo kas, a yit puun fun mo. Tent mǝnǝ war ɗi jì wul mɓít mǝ Devit. <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/>Devit kat ɗeret ntoom Naan, wur ɗang, mbǝkǝ nwur ɗyik mee peetong ɗi nNaan mǝ Jekop. <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/>Ɗangɓe a Solomon yool ɗyiklu Naan nǝ.<verse eid="ACT 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>Jir kǝsǝ, ɓǝ baa Daa Naan Ɗehai kǝ tong a nɗǝǝn lu ɗe gurum mo ɗyik kas. Pwoo ɗesǝ nǝ nciit kǝ pwoo ɗe gyet ngusatpwoo Naan ten sat nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>&lt;Naan sat nǝ, ɗengnaan nǝ a peetong fen, kǝ yil ɗesǝ nǝ a pee leshii fen zak. Wun nɗyik a mee lu ɗǝɗang nghan yii? Peeɗe an nnookɗi a nii? <verse eid="ACT 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>Baa a sar fen le mbii ɗesǝ mo jir kas aa?&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>&lt;&lt;Wun nencinshik mo, ɗe pǝtuup fuu mo ɗee a koo mǝ nenkum mo sǝ. Wuu ɗee a komjoor mo mbǝ cíikǝlǝngpwoo mǝ Naan, kǝzak wu cii Riin Ɗeɓang shidaar-shidaar, kaaɗe gyet puun fuu mo kǝ cìn sǝ. Mbǝmǝnǝ wun a koo puun fuu mo gyet sǝ zak. <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>Gyet puun fuu mo shínjeel nnenkop pwoo Naan mo jir. Gyet mo twe nen ɗe moo leshap nkaa jì Ngwe ɗe ndǝre sǝ, ɗe yaksǝ ɓǝ a wun seet wur, ɗang a wun, wu tu wur zak. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>A wun a nen ɗe wu lap Wàar mǝ Naan ɗewur shin nwun nsar nenlep mǝ Naan mo, ɗang baa wu cìn mbii ɗe Wàar nǝ mo sat kas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Tu Stivin Shi nGyǝk Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Kaaɗe nenɓeetpwoo nǝ mo kǝlǝng pwoo ɗe Stivin sat mmo, ɓǝ nǝ láa mmo mɓut ɗes hakyeng, yaksǝ mo ǝrep sar fur mo mbǝ tuup. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Mbǝɗǝ Stivin gam kǝ Riin Ɗeɓang, ɓǝ wur naapee kaa aɗeng, ɓǝ wur naa Ɗehai mǝ Naan, kǝ Daa Jesu kǝ ɗar nsarse kǝ Naan zak. <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>Ɓǝ Stivin sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wu naa mo wang ɗengnaan, kǝzak Làa kǝ Gurum kǝ ɗar nsarse mǝ Naan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Ɗangɓe gurum nǝ mo lep or shi ɗoo ɗeɗes, kǝ mmo duur kom fur mo shi sar fur mo, ɓǝ mo yool su jì taa nkaa Stivin. <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>Mo dul wur put mɓwoon pee nkaam nǝ, ɓǝ mo car wur shi gyǝk ɓǝ wur muut. Nen ɗe mo car Stivin nǝ mo, shwat nlǝr fur mo, mo le pǝ mee zǝlang ɗe moo pet sǝm wur a Sool. <verse eid="ACT 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Kaaɗe mon nkaa car Stivin, ɓǝ wur nkaa ɗangnaan nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Daa Jesu, a lap seen fen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Yaksǝ wur kurum mfurum, ɓǝ wur petpee shi ɗoo ɗeɗes nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Daa Naan, a fwoo shikbish ɗesǝ nǝ mmo.&gt;&gt; Kaaɗe wur sat pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ wur muut.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Sool Shínjeel Nenseet nDang Jesu Mo</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Nǝ fes ret nSool nyit zam, mbǝɗe mo tu Stivin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Parpuus mǝnǝ, ɓǝ jeel ɗeɗes nǝ táa nkaa kuur mǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu ɗe moo tong nJerusalem. Mbǝ jeel nǝ, ɓǝ mo rangkáa jir, dǝm nɗǝǝn yil nJudiya, kǝ Samariya, tǝng ɗee a jeplep nǝ mo ɗe nJerusalem ɓejee ɗak. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Pak nen ɗe mo kǝǝr Naan, mo wum Stivin, kǝzak mo yém mmaap mbǝ muut wur nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>Ɗangɓe Sool shínjeel nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo ɗes hakyeng. Wur dǝm ɗel shitul-shitul, kǝn nwur yak daas mo, kǝ shurep mo, dǝm shoot mo nɗǝǝn lushoot.<verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Kop Pwoo Naan nƊǝǝn Pee Kaam nSamariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Nen ɗe mo rangkáa nǝ mo. Mo dǝm kop pwoo Naan ngurum mo koo a pee ɗeɗangyii ɗe mo dǝm ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>Filip dǝm mmee pee kaam ɗe nen nSamariya, wur nkaa leshap ngurum mo nkaa Kristi mpee mǝnǝ. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Kaaɗe kuur mǝ gurum nǝ mo kǝlǝng, ɗang mo naa mbii lukshik ɗe Filip pǝ cìn mo zak, ɓǝ mo lekom, kǝzak mo lepan fur mo nkaa mbii ɗewur sat nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Riin ɗebish mo lep or ɗeɗes, kǝzak mo pwat mɓut ngurum mo ɗes. Mo bar gurum mo ɗes ɗe shik mo mo fii, kǝ kǝɓel mo. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ, ɓǝ gurum mo kat retnyit ɗes nɗǝǝn pee nkaam mǝnǝ.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Simon nGwu Mulak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Mee gwar ɗewur ɗi nɗǝǝn pee nkaam nǝ, ɗe sǝm wur a Simon, ɗe mbǝ ɓit mo ɗes, ɓǝ wur kǝcin mulak, kǝzak wur kǝcin mbii aapwoo mo a yit mǝ nen Samariya mo. Wur cutzung nǝ, ɗyin a mee ngwe ɗeɗes. <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>Gurum mo jir mo kǝ lepyit nkaa wur, yool nɗeɗyeen mo, dǝm wul nɗenannan mo, ɗang moo sat nǝ, gwar ɗesǝ wur aa ɓal mǝ Naan ɗe moo pet a iiko Ɗeɗes Met <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>Moo lepyit nkaa wur, a mbǝɗe ɓit mo ɗes, ɓǝ wur cìn mbii aapwoo mo a yit mo mo shi mulak nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Ɗang kaaɗe mo shinzeen mpwoo ɗeret ɗe Filip sat mmo, nkaa mulki mǝ Naan, kǝ nkaa Jesu Kristi zak, ɓǝ mo cìn baptisma ndaas mo, kǝ shurep mo ɗe mo shinzeen. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Simon shikáa fin shinzeen zak, ɓǝ mo cìn baptisma nwur. Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ wur dǝm nɗang Filip, ɗang nǝ aapwoo nwur mbǝ mbii lukshik mo, kǝ ɗak ɗǝnan-nan ɗewur naa Filip kǝcin mo.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Kaaɗe jeplep ɗe moo tong nJerusalem mo kǝlǝng nǝ, nen Samariya mo kǝ lappwoo Naan, ɓǝ mo lep Pita kǝ Joon dǝm pǝ mo ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Kaaɗe Pita kǝ Joon mo dǝm wul, ɓǝ mo ɗangnaan nkaa nen ɗe mo shinzeen nǝ. Mbǝkǝ nNaan shin Riin Ɗeɓang ɗe mmo. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Mbǝɗǝ baa Riin Ɗeɓang kǝ sham nkaa memee nɗǝǝn mo kas. Mo kǝ cìn a baptisma mmo nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Daa Jesu ɓejee ɗak. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Pita kǝ Joon, mo lesar fur mo nkaa mo, ɓǝ Naan shin Riin Ɗeɓang ngurum nǝ mo.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Kaaɗe Simon naa nǝ, moo shin Riin Ɗeɓang nǝ nnen shinzeen nǝ mo, a mbǝɗe jeplep nǝ mo lesar fur mo nkaa mo, ɓǝ wur shin shool mPita kǝ Joon, ɗang wur sat mmo nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>&lt;&lt;Wu shin ɓal mǝnǝ nghan zak, mbǝkǝ koo wii ɗe wen lesar fen nkaa wur, ɓǝ wur nkat Riin Ɗeɓang nǝ zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Ɗangɓǝ Pita sat nSimon nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Waa kǝ shool fwaa nǝ, wun nɗel nwus. Mbǝɗǝ aa pan nǝ, a mmak seet mbiizuum mǝ Naan a shi shool. <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>Baa mee mbii ɓàl gha kǝ mun mɓut ɗak fun ɗesǝ nǝ kas mbǝɗe baa pǝtuup fwa nǝ nɗere a kǝkyeen nNaan kas. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>A tuwap mbǝ pan fwaa ɗebish nǝ, kǝzak a ɗang Daa Naan, mbǝkǝ nNaan fwoo shikbish mǝ pan kǝ pǝtuup fwaa ɗebish nǝ ɗi ngha. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Mbǝɗǝ wen naa, aa gam kǝ zuur ɗebish, ɗang aa ɗee a ɗe ɓuɓwoot nɗǝǝn shikbish.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Simon sat mPita kǝ Joon nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Kuzuk, wu ɗang pǝ Daa Naan, mbǝkǝ taji memee nɗǝǝn mbii ɗe wu sat sǝ mo kat an kas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Aɓwoon ɗe Pita kǝ Joon mo kǝ satpwoo nkaa Jesu, ɗang mo leshap Naan zak, ɓǝ kaaɗe mo a ar kàa nJerusalem, ɓǝ mo taa kop pwoo ɗeret nǝ nɗǝǝn jepyil mo ɗes, ɗe mo nSamariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filip Kǝ Mee nGu Itiyopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Mee ngulep mǝ Naan sat mFilip nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A yool a sham nkor ngyeen a ar ɗe nǝ yool nJerusalem dǝm wul nGaza, ɗe nǝ a naaryil.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/>Wur yool seet, ɓǝ wur taakáat kǝ mee ngu Itiyopiya ɗewur a meermuut. Wur a mee ngwe ɗeɗes ɗewur tap kǝ long mǝ mishkoom ɗe mat, Kandes mǝ yil Itiyopiya. Gwar ɗesǝ wur waa a nJerusalem mbǝ seyil nNaan. <verse eid="ACT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>Kaaɗe wur a ar baa waa, ɓǝ wur kǝ tong nɗǝǝn mbiilang, wur nkaa tang ɓǝǝt-haal mǝ ngusatpwoo mǝ Naan Aizaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Ɓǝ Riin Ɗeɓang sat mFilip nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A dǝm kus kǝ mbiilang ɗesǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Filip su dǝm kus kǝ mbiilang nǝ, ɓǝ wur kǝlǝng gwar nǝ nkaa tang ɓǝǝt-haal mǝ ngusatpwoo mǝ Naan Aizaya. Yaksǝ Filip tal pǝ gwar nǝ nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A manshii mǝ mbii ɗe gha nkaa tang nǝ aa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Gwar nǝ lap nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Cirang ɗang an mbǝ mmanshii mǝnǝ ɗi ii? Kat baa a mee gurum kámshii mǝnǝ nghan kas ii?&gt;&gt; Gwar nǝ sat mFilip kàa tong ashak kǝ wur. <verse eid="ACT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>A pwoo ɗewur nkaa tang nǝ nɗǝǝn ɓǝǝt-haal nǝ nɗesǝ, ɗe nǝ sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wur a koo tǝm ɗe mo kǝ dǝm kǝnǝ, mpee saa sǝ. Koo tǝm ɗe ɗok tǝtǝk ntoom mǝ ngusaa shweep nǝ sǝ, Wur ɗok tǝtǝk a kǝsǝ zak. <verse eid="ACT 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>Mbǝɗǝ wur sham kǝ káa fin, ɓǝ baa mo tokɗyeel nwur nkaa zeen kas. A wii mmak yool leshap nkaa ɗang wur mo ii? Mbǝɗǝ mo kǝ mang seen wur nɗǝǝn yil nǝ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Ɓǝ ngu Itiyopiya nǝ wur tal pǝ Filip nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A sat nghan. Gyet ngusatpwoo mǝ Naan ɗesǝ wur leshap nǝ a nkaa wii? Wur leshap nǝ a nkaa shin aa? Koo a mee ngwe ɗecì yii?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Yaksǝ Filip ɗoom leshap ɗeret nkaa Jesu, shi pwoo ɗe gwar nǝ kǝ tang nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Kaaɗe mon mwaan a ar nǝ, ɓǝ mo jì wul mpee ɗe am ɗi, ɓǝ ngu Itiyopiya nǝ wur sat mFilip nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A naa am sǝsǝ! A mii ncíi kǝ nghan cìn baptisma nghan ii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>Filip lap nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Katɗang a shinzeen nJesu shi pǝtuup mǝndong azeen-zeen, ɓǝ mon ncìn baptisma ngha. Ngu Itiyopiya nǝ wur sat nǝ, Nshinzeen nǝ Jesu Kristi wur a Làa mǝ Naan azeen-zeen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Yaksǝ gwar nǝ wur le mbiilang nǝ ɗar. Ɓǝ Filip kǝ gwar ɗe nǝ, mo sham nɗǝǝn am nǝ dukvǝl, ɓǝ Filip cìn baptisma ngwar nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Kaaɗe mo kàa pwat mɓut am nǝ, ɓǝ Riin mǝ Daa, mang Filip dǝm kǝ wur mmee mpee. Baa ngu Itiyopiya nǝ wur kutɗi kǝ naa Filip zak kas. Yaksǝ wur sekyeen kǝ mwaan fin, kǝzak wur gam kǝ retnyit. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Gurum mo naa Filip nɗǝǝn yil Azotus. Wur dǝm shipee-shipee nɗǝǝn pee nkaam nǝ mo jir, mbǝ kop pwoo ɗeret nǝ, dǝm wul nSizariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Tuwap Mǝ Sool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Sool sekyeen kǝ shinjeel nnenseet nɗang Jesu mo, wur tang ar mbǝ twe mo. Aasǝ ɓǝ, wur dǝm pǝ pris ɗeɗes met jir nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>Yaksǝ Sool ɗang pǝ pris ɗeɗes nǝ, mbǝkǝ nwur shin lep a rǝran mmo ɗewur ndǝm kǝ mmo nLu mǝ Naan mo, ɗe mo nDamaskus, mbǝkǝ katɗang wur kat nen ɗe moo dǝm nɗang ar Jesu, koo daas mo kǝ shurep mo, ɓǝ wur yak mo jì kǝ mo nJerusalem.<verse eid="ACT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>Kaaɗe wur jì wul kus kǝ Damaskus, ɓǝ nnen mman, ɓǝ mee peeɓang tong aɗeng sham ɓangpee ɗewur ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>Yaksǝ wur taa nyil, kǝzak wur kǝlǝng mee ɗoo kǝ sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Sool, Sool! A mii le ɗang aa shinjeel nghan yii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Yaksǝ Sool tal nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A gha a wii Daa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Ɗoo nǝ lap nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A an Jesu, ɗe gha nkaa shinjeel nghan. <verse eid="ACT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>A yool a ɗel nɗǝǝn pee nkaam nǝ, ɓǝ mon nsat nghan mbii ɗe nǝ a tǝng gha ncìn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Nen ɗe mon mwaan nǝ ashak kǝ wur mo ɗar tǝtǝk, baa mo le mee shap kas, mo kǝlǝng ɗoo nǝ, ɗang baa mo naa nguleshap nǝ kas. <verse eid="ACT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Sool yool ɗar atǝng, ɓǝ wur wang yit fin, ɗang, baa wur mak naapee kas. Mbǝ mǝnǝ ɓǝ mo yaa sar nwur, mo ɗel kǝ wur nDamaskus. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Mbǝ teer mo kun, ɓǝ baa wur mak naapee kas, kǝzak baa wur se mee mbiise, koo shwaa mee mbii kas zak.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Mee nguseet nɗang Jesu ɗi nDamaskus, ɗe moo pet wur a Ananiyas. Daa sat Ananiyas nɗǝǝn suun nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ananiyas!&gt;&gt; Yaksǝ wur lap nǝnee, &lt;&lt;An sǝsǝ Daa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Daa sat nwur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A yool a dǝm a ar ɗesǝ, ɗe moo pet a Sham ndǝr-ndǝr, ɓǝ a tal mee gwar ɗe moo pet sǝm wur a Sool, wur a ngu Tarsus. Wur ntul Judas. Yaksǝ ɓǝ wur nkaa ɗangnaan. <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/>Nɗǝǝn suun wur, ɓǝ wur naa mee gwar ɗe moo pet sǝm wur a Ananiyas, wur jì ɗel, ɗang wur lesar fin nkaa wur, mbǝkǝ nyit fin mo baa naapee ɗi zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Ɗangɓe Ananiyas lap nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Daa, gurum mo ɗes mo kǝ leshap nghan, nkaa niyang ɗe gwar ɗesǝ wur kǝcin nnen fwaa ɗe mon nJerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Kǝzak wur jì mpee ɗesǝ nDamaskus, shipee ɗe pris ɗenan mo shin nwur, mbǝkǝ nwur yak nen ɗe mo shinzeen nɗǝǝn sǝm fwaa jir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Ɗangɓe Daa lap wur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A yool a dǝm, mbǝɗe an kǝn bǝlǝp wur, mbǝkǝ nwur cìn ɗak ɗi nghan. Wur mbǝ le kǝn nnen ɗe baa mo a nen Yahudi mo kas, kǝ mishkoom mo, kǝ nnen Yahudi mo man sǝm fen zak. <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>An mbǝ kám nwur jeel ɗe nwur mbǝ shwaa mo mbǝ sǝm fen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Ananiyas yool dǝm ɗel nɗǝǝn lu Judas nǝ. Wur lesar fin mo nkaa Sool, ɗang wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa Sool, Daa Jesu ɗewur woo shin fin ngha, kaaɗe gha a ar jì mpee ɗesǝ, a wur lep an, mbǝkǝ nghan baa a naapee ɗi zak. Kǝ mmo gam gha shi Riin Ɗeɓang zak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Abet-abet ɓerep mee mbii mo koo feel mǝ pupwap sǝ, mo pwat nyit Sool, mo sham ɗong nyil, ɓǝ yit wur mo cin naapee. Yaksǝ wur yool ɗar atǝng, ɓǝ mo cìn baptisma nwur. <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Aɓwoon ɗewur kǝ se mbiise, ɓǝ wur baa katɓal zak.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 9:19">Sool Kop Satpwoo Naan nDamaskus</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sool tong ashak kǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu ɗe mon nDamaskus, mbǝ meeteer mo ruk. <verse eid="ACT 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Abet-abet ɓǝ wur dǝm nɗǝǝn lu mǝ Naan mo ɓǝ wur ɗoom sat nǝ, Jesu a Làa Naan. <verse eid="ACT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Nen ɗe mo kǝlǝng wur jir, ɓǝ nǝ aapwoo mmo, ɗang mo tal nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Baa a gwar ɗewur twe nen ɗe mo shinzeen nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Jesu, nɗǝǝn Jerusalem sǝ nɗesǝ kas ee? Wur jì mpee ɗesǝ a mbǝkǝ nwur yak mo dǝm kǝ mo a ɓuɓwoot pǝ pris ɗǝnan-nan mo ɗi zak kas aa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Ɗangɓe Sool katɓal, kǝn nwur leshap ɗi ɓal-ɓal, ɗe nǝ kám agaak nǝ, Jesu wur a Kristi azeen-zeen. Pwoo ɗewur sat nǝ mo, nǝ daampee nnen Yahudi ɗe moo tong nDamaskus.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sool Put nSar Nnen Yahudi Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>Aɓwoon meeteer mo ɗes, ɓǝ nen Yahudi mo ɓeetpwoo kǝ sut, mbǝkǝ mmo tu Sool ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>Ɗang pwoo ɗe mo ɓwoot nǝ taa nkom Sool. Mo tap pwoo lu ɗe mon mpee nkaam nǝ mpar kǝ puus, mbǝkǝ mmo tu Sool ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Ɗangɓe nen shinzeen ɗe mo dǝm ɗang Sool nǝ mo, mo mang wur nɗǝǝn kǝci mpar, ɓǝ mo ɓwet wur sham mɓwoon pee nkaam nǝ nɗǝǝn mee fung.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sool Wul nJerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Kaaɗe Sool wul nJerusalem, ɓǝ wur tang ar ɗewur mbǝ ɓàlkáa wur ɗi ashak kǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu mo. Ɗangɓe mo jir, mo kǝǝr wur, mbǝɗe baa mo shinzeen nǝ, wur kǝ ɗee a nguseet nɗang Jesu kas. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Yaksǝ a Barnabas jì kǝ wur pǝ jeplep nǝ mo ɗi, kǝn nwur leshap ngurum nǝ mo, kaaɗe Sool kǝ naa Daa Jesu a ar, nǝ, Daa Jesu kǝ leshap kǝ Sool. Barnabas leshap mmo nkaa sat pwoo kǝ Naan nɗǝǝn Jesu agaak, ɗe Sool kǝ cìn nɗǝǝn Damaskus, baa ashak kǝ mee kǝǝrmuut kas, koo dǝɓen. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Aasǝ ɓǝ wur tong ashak kǝ mo. Kǝzak wur mwaan dǝm shipee-shipee nɗǝǝn Jerusalem, kǝzak wur satpwoo kǝ Naan ɓalɓal nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Daa Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Wur naa nleshap nǝ, kǝ ɓeetshik kǝ nen Yahudi ɗe moo kǝlǝng pwoo kǝ nen Helene mo, ɗe nǝ le kǝ mmo tang ar ɗe mon ntu wur ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Jir aasǝ kaaɗe nenseet nɗang Jesu mo kǝlǝng mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo dǝm kǝ Sool nSizariya, kǝ mo lep wur shindǝm nTarsus.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu ɗe mon nJudiya, kǝ Galili, kǝ Samariya, mo tongriyang nɗǝǝn meeteer mǝnǝ mo. Shi ɓam mǝ Riin Ɗeɓang, ɓǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo katɓal, ɗang mo ɓul zak. Moo mwaan nɗǝǝn kǝǝr mǝ Naan, ɗang moo shin ɗeɗes nNaan zak.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita Bar Aniyas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Pita mwaan shipee-shipee jir, ɓǝ wur jì wul pǝ nen Naan mo, ɗe mo kǝ tong nLidda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>Yaksǝ wur kat mee gwar ɗi mpee nkaam mǝnǝ, ɗe mo kǝ pet sǝm wur a Aniyas, ɗewur kǝ mee shwal ɗe nǝ fii shik wur, ɗe baa wur mak yool a peesaam kas, mbǝ ɓit mo pwookun. <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Pita sat nwur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Aniyas, Jesu Kristi wur bar gha. A yool a ciɓet mbiisaam fwaa.&gt;&gt; Abet-abet, ɓǝ wur yool. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Kaaɗe jir nen ɗe mo kǝ tong nɗǝǝn Lidda kǝ Sharon mo naa wur bar, ɓǝ mo cǝǝr kǝ pǝtuup fur mo, ɗe nǝ le mmo shinzeen nDaa.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita Yool Kǝ Tabita A Peemúut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Mee mat seet nɗang Jesu war ɗi nɗǝǝn yil nJoppa, ɗe sǝm war a Tabita, sǝm war nǝ shi liispwoo mǝ nen Heleni mo a Dokas, ɗe shii kǝnǝ a &lt;&lt;Tap.&gt;&gt; Mat ɗesǝ war kǝ cìn ɗak ɗeret mo, ɗang war kǝ ɓam nenjeel mo zak. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Nɗǝǝn meeteer mǝnǝ mo, ɓǝ mee shwal yaa war, ɗe nǝ le nwar muut. Kaaɗe mo vwang kúm war, ɓǝ mo le nɗǝǝn mee luɗeng. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Lidda kus kǝ Joppa, ɓǝ kaaɗe nenseet nɗang Jesu mo kǝlǝng nǝ Pita ɗi nJoppa, ɓǝ mo lep gurum mo vǝl shindǝm pǝ wur ɗe, mbǝkǝ mmo ɗang ɗi pǝ wur, kǝ nwur jì pǝ mo ɗi kǝkǝlak, taji wur taa ɗee bir kas. <verse eid="ACT 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Pita yool dǝm ashak kǝ mo, kaaɗe mo jì wul, ɓǝ mo kàa kǝ wur nɗǝǝn luɗeng nǝ. A pee ɗe matkaa mo jì ɗirang pǝ wur ɗi. Mo nkaa wal, ɗang mo kám nlǝr mo, kǝ leelep mo, ɗe dǝ Tabita kǝ raa mmatkáa nǝ mo, ɓǝ war kutɗi seen. <verse eid="ACT 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Ɗangɓe Pita le mmo pwat a tool jir, ɓǝ wur kurum mfurum, kǝ nwur ɗangnaan ɗi. Yaksǝ wur cǝǝr pǝ kúm nǝ ɗe, wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Tabita yi yool.&gt;&gt; Yaksǝ war wang yit fer. Kaaɗe war naa Pita, ɓǝ war yool tong atǝng. <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Ɓǝ wur yaa sar nwar, ɗang wur ɗiyeep war ɗar atǝng. Ɓǝ wur pǝrep nen mǝ Naan nǝ mo, kǝ matkaa nǝ mo, ɓǝ wur shin Tabita mo kǝ seen. <verse eid="ACT 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Mbii ɗesǝ nǝ ɗee a ɗemǝman nɗǝǝn yil nJoppa jir, ɓǝ gurum mo ɗes mo shinzeen nDaa. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Pita tong ashak kǝ mee nguɗak shim, ɗe mo kǝ pet sǝm wur a Simon, mbǝ teer mo ɗes ɗe nJoppa nǝ.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Pita Kǝ Konilus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>Mee gwar ɗi nɗǝǝn Sizariya, ɗe sǝm wur a Konilus, wur a mee ngwe ɗeɗes, ɗewur kǝ tap kǝ shiitoon mo kambil mǝndong, ɗe mǝ yil Itali. <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Wur a mee ngwe ɗewur le pǝtuup fin nkaa Naan, kǝzak wur kǝǝr Naan ashak kǝ nenlu fin mo jir. Wur shin zuum ngurum mo ɗes, kǝ wur kǝ naa ndang Naan shidaar-shidaar. <verse eid="ACT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Parmeeci sǝ, koo kun ɗe mǝ puus sǝ, ɓǝ nɗǝǝn suun, ɓǝ wur naa ngulep kǝ Naan agaak, ɗang ngulep nǝ sat nwur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Konilus,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>Ɓǝ Konilus naa ngulep nǝ shi yit kǝǝrmuut, ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A mii yii Daa?&gt;&gt; Ngulep mǝ Naan sat nKonilus nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Naan kǝ lap ɗang fwaa mo, kǝ mbiizuum ɗe aa shin nenjeel mo, ɓǝ mo kǝkàa wul pǝ Naan ɗi aɗeng, ɗang mo ɗee a mbii ɗe Naan pan gha zak. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Mbǝmǝnǝ, ɓǝ a lep mee gurum mo dǝm nJoppa, mbǝkǝ mmo dǝm pet mee gwar ɗe mo kǝ pet sǝm wur a Simon Pita, jì ntul fwaa. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>Wur tong a nlu Simon nguɗak shim, ɗe lu wur nǝ kus kǝ pwoo Am kuur sǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Kaaɗe ngulep mǝ Naan leshap kǝ Konilus, ɓǝ Konilus pet kǝrem fin mo vǝl kǝ mee shiitoon, ɗewur a ngwe ɗe ndǝre mɓut nen ɗe mo kǝ cìn ɗak ntul fin shidaar-shidaar. <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>Aɓwoon ɗewur sat mmo mbii ɗe nǝ cìn jir, ɓǝ wur lep mo dǝm nJoppa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Daar nǝ, ɓǝ mo yaa ar, ɓǝ mo jì wul kus kǝ pee nkaam nǝ. Pita kǝkàa nluɗeng mbǝ ɗangnaan, koo puus a naar sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>Neenláa nwur, ɗang wur reɓet mee mbii ɗewur nse. Kaaɗe mo kutɗi nkaa cet mbiise nǝ, ɓǝ Pita cin mee suun. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>Ɗee wur naa ɗengnaan nǝ wang, ɗang mee mbii tong aɗeng sham koo haal ɗeɗes sǝ. Mo yaa sham kǝnǝ nyil shi kwang nǝ mo feer. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Nɗǝǝn nǝ, ɓǝ koo a luwaa ɗeɗangyii, ɗe mo kǝ mwaan shi shii feer mo, kǝ ɗe mo kǝ fee shi ɓut mo, kǝ nyer ɗe mo kǝ yool ncáap mo ɗiɓut jir. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Ɓǝ Pita kǝlǝng mee ɗoo kǝ sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Pita a yool, a can a se.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Ɗangɓe Pita lap nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Hai Daa! Baa wen kǝn cam se mee luwaa ɗebuu, koo ɗe baa nǝ ret kǝ ngu Yahudi se kas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Pita waa cin kǝlǝng ɗoo nǝ ɗe zak, ɗe nǝ sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Mbii ɗe Naan kǝ le a ɗeɓang, ɓǝ taji waa a le a ɗebuu kas.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Mo cìn a kǝsǝ dǝm wul ar kun, ɓǝ mo waa baakàa kǝ haal nǝ aɗeng.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Kaaɗe Pita nkaa panshii mǝ suun nǝ, ɓǝ nen ɗe Konilus lep mo sǝ, mo kǝ ten yap lu mǝ Simon nǝ mo kat, ɓǝ mo jì ɗar mpwoo lu nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Mo petpee, ɓǝ mo tal nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Kyet gwar ɗe mo kǝ pet wur a Simon Pita sǝ, kǝ tong a nlu ɗesǝ ee?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Kaaɗe Pita kutɗi nkaa panshii mǝ suun ɗesǝ nǝ, ɓǝ Riin mǝ Naan sat nwur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A naa mee gurum mo kun, mo pǝ yap gha. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>A yool, a sham, kǝ nghan seet ashak kǝ mo, baa a shi mee kyetwo kas, mbǝɗe a an lep mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Ɓǝ Pita sham pǝ nen nǝ mo ɗi, ɓǝ wur sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;An sǝ, a an a ngwe ɗe wun pǝ yap nǝ. Wu jì a mbǝ miyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Mo lap nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A mee ngwe ɗeɗes nkaa shiitoon mo, ɗe mo kǝ pet sǝm wur a Konilus ɗewur a mee ngwe ɗe ndǝre, ngukǝǝr Naan. Ɗe nen Yahudi mo jir mo kǝ kwoop wur. A mee ngulep mǝ Naan ɗeɓang jì sat nwur nǝ, wur lep mo pet gha, kǝ nghan dǝm ɗi ntul fin, mbǝkǝ nwur kǝlǝng mbii ɗe gha mbǝ sat nǝ ɗi nwur.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Pita ɗel kǝ des ɗekun nǝ mo nlu, mbǝkǝ mmo teer ɗi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Daar nǝ, ɓǝ Pita yool seet ashak kǝ mo. Pak nenseet nɗang Jesu ɗe mon nJoppa mo seet ashak kǝ wur. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Daar nǝ, ɓǝ mo dǝm wul nSizariya. Konilus nkaa ɗarnaa mo. Wur kǝ ten pǝrep ɗang fin mo, kǝ shaar fin mo, mo kuur ashak ɗes. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Kaaɗe Pita a ar ɗel nɗǝǝn lu nǝ, ɓǝ Konilus kaat wur, ɓǝ wur taa mPita ntoom, mbǝ seeyil nwur. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Ɗangɓe Pita ɗiyeep Konilus, ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A yool atǝng, wen shikáa fen, an a gurum koo waa sǝ zak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>Pita nkaa leshap kǝ Konilus, ɓǝ kaaɗe wur ɗel, nɗǝǝn lu nǝ, ɓǝ wur kat gurum mo kǝ kuur ashak ɗes. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>Pita sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wun shikáa fuu wu man nǝ, baa nǝ ndǝre kǝ ngu Yahudi ɓalkaa fin ashak kǝ mee soon ɗecì mo, koo wur jì pǝ mo ɗi kas. Ɗangɓe Naan kǝ kám nghan, kǝ taji wen mpet mee gurum a ɗebuu, koo ɗebish kas. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ, kaaɗe wu lep mo pet an sǝ, ɓǝ wen jì pǝ wun ɗi, baa wen cii kas. Mbǝmǝnǝ wen reɓet kǝlǝng mbii ɗe nǝ le kǝ nwun pet an nǝ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Konilus sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Nǝ kus aa teer mo feer cicinsǝ, nciit kǝ pee kǝsǝ, ɓǝ nkaa ndang Naan nkun mǝ puus nɗǝǝn lu fen. Ɓǝ nnaa mee gwar sǝ, ɗe nlǝr wur mo piyaa pet-pet, wur jì ɗar a kyeen fen. <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>Yaksǝ wur sat nǝnee, Konilus! Naan kǝ lap ɗang fwaa, kǝ mbiizuum ɗe aa shin nenjeel mo sǝ, mo ɗee a mbii ɗe Naan wur pan gha zak. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ a lep-lep dǝm nJoppa, kǝ mo dǝm pet mee gwar ɗe sǝm wur a Simon Pita, wur kǝ tong a ntul mǝ Simon nguɗak shim, ɗe lu wur nǝ kus kǝ pwoo am kuur sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Abet-abet ɓǝ wen nlep-lep shindǝm pǝ gha ɗi. Nǝ ret zam kaaɗe a jì mpee ɗesǝ. Mun sǝ jir ntoom mǝ Naan yaksǝ, mbǝkǝ mmun kǝlǝng mbii ɗe Daa wur sat ngha, mbǝkǝ nghan sat ɗi mmun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita Leshap nTul Konilus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>Pita leshap mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Azeen-zeen wen naa nǝ, baa Naan kǝ ɓakyit mmee gurum kas. <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>Ɗangɓǝ Naan wur kǝ lap gurum mo jir, ɗe mo kǝ kǝǝr wur, kǝzak moo cìn mbii ɗeret mo zak. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>A pwoo ɗe Naan wur lep nnen Isreil mo nɗesǝ. Moo leshap ɗeret, ɗe nǝ a mǝ tongriyang mmo nɗǝǝn Jesu Kristi, ɗewur a Daa mǝ mbii mo jir, <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>Wun shikáa fuu, wu man mbii aapwoo ɗe mo kǝ cìn nɗǝǝn yil nJudiya jir. Gyet mo shee cìn nǝ a nGalili, aɓwoon ɗe gyet Joon ngucìn baptisma wur leshap mmo nkaa nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>Ɗesǝ nǝ a pwoo nkaa Jesu Ngu Nazaret, ɗe gyet Naan ɗoo Riin Ɗeɓang kǝ iiko nkaa wur. Wur dǝm koo a pee ɗeɗangyii, ɓǝ wur cìn ɗak ɗeret, ɗewur bar nen ɗe mon ndǝr ɓal mǝ nngujwaan jir, mbǝɗe Naan ashak kǝ wur. <verse eid="ACT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>Mun a langtǝng mǝ mbii ɗewur cìn mo jir nɗǝǝn yil nJudiya, kǝ nɗǝǝn Jerusalem zak. A wur a ɗe gyet mo tu wur, kaaɗe gyet mo pwas wur nkaa shiyeepyoom sǝ, ɗee wur muut. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>Jir aasǝ Naan yool kǝ wur a peemúut parpuus ɗekun, kǝzak Naan le kǝ nwur woo shin fin mmun agaak. <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>Baa a gurum mo jir mo naa wur kas, ɗang wur woo shin a mmun, ɗe Naan kǝ ten bǝlǝp mun, kǝ mmun ɗee ɗi a langtǝng fin. Gyet muu se mbiise kǝ shwaa am ashak kǝ wur, aɓwoon ɗewur kǝ yool a peemúut zak. <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Wur sat mmun ɓalɓal nǝ, mu satpwoo mǝ Naan ngurum mo jir zak, kǝ mmun tong a langtǝng ɗi nǝ, a Jesu wur a gwar ɗe Naan shin ɗeɗes nwur, mbǝkǝ nwur ɗee ɗi a ngutokɗyeel nnen ɗe mmeen mo, kǝ nnen ɗe mo kǝ murep mo zak. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>A wur a ngwe ɗe gyet nensatpwoo mǝ Naan mo jir, mo kǝ ten tong a langtǝng wur nǝ, a mbǝ sǝm wur, ɗang koo a ngwe ɗeɗangyii ɗewur shinzeen, ɓǝ wur nkat fwo mǝ shikbish wur mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Shin Riin Ɗeɓang nNen Ɗe Baa Mo A nNen Yahudi Mo Kas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Kaaɗe Pita kutɗi nkaa leshap ɗesǝ mmo, ɓǝ Riin Ɗeɓang sham nkaa nen ɗe mo pǝ kǝlǝng pwoo nǝ jir. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>Nen Yahudi ɗe mo a nen shinzeen ɗe mo jì ashak kǝ Pita sǝ, nǝ aapwoo mmo, Mbǝɗǝ mo naa Naan shin Riin Ɗeɓang shi zuum nnen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas zak. <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Mo kǝlǝng mo kǝ leshap shi pak liispwoo mo, ɗang mon nkaa shin ɗeɗes nNaan. Ɓǝ Pita sat nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>&lt;&lt;Kyet mee gurum mmak cíi nkaa am ɗe mon ncìn baptisma ɗi nnen ɗesǝ mo aa? Mbǝɗǝ mo kǝ lap Riin Ɗeɓang nǝ a kaaɗe gyet mmun mu lap sǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Yaksǝ Pita le kǝ mo cìn baptisma mmo nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Jesu Kristi. Mo ɗang pǝ Pita, mbǝkǝ nwur pan yém ɗi ashak kǝ mo mbǝ rep meeteer mo ruk akuɗang.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Pita Yakshii Mǝ mBii Ɗe Nǝ Cìn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Jeplep mo kǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu ɗe mon nJudiya, mo kǝlǝng nǝ, pak gurum ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas, mo kǝ lappwoo Naan zak. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Kaaɗe Pita kàa wul nJerusalem, ɓǝ nen shinzeen ɗe mo kǝ can mo, mo yool kǝ pwoo nkaa wur. <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>Mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Waa dǝm a ɗel nlu mǝ nen ɗe nsuluk mo har a se mbiise ashak kǝ mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Aasǝ ɓǝ Pita yaa yakshii mǝ mbii ɗe nǝ cìn jir, wur sat mmo nǝnee,<verse eid="ACT 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>&lt;&lt;Dǝ an nɗǝǝn pee nkaam nJoppa, ɓǝ kaaɗe an nkaa ɗangnaan ɓǝ wen suun. Ɓǝ nɗǝǝn suun nǝ, nnaa mee haal ɗeɗes ɗe nǝ tong aɗeng sham ɗe, nǝ kǝ kwang mo feer, nǝ sham wul pǝ an ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Wen ban yit nkaa nǝ, ɓǝ nnaa longlu mo, kǝ luwaayil mo, kǝ mbii ɗe mo kǝ fee shi ɓut mo, kǝ nyer ɗe mo kǝ yool ncáap, mo ɗi nɗǝǝn nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>Ɓǝ nkǝlǝng mee ɗoo, ɗe nǝ sat nghan nǝnee, &lt;Pita, a yool a saa mo, a se.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>Ɗangɓe wen nsat nǝnee, &lt;Hai Daa! Baa wen kǝn cam se mee luwaa ɗebuu, koo ɗe baa nǝ ret kǝ ngu Yahudi se kas.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>Yaksǝ ɗoo nǝ cin sat ɗi nghan aɗeng nǝnee, &lt;Mbii ɗe Naan le a ɗeɓang, ɓǝ taji a le nǝ a ɗebish kas.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>Mo cìn a kǝsǝ, dǝm wul ar kun, ɓǝ mo waa baa dul haal nǝ kaa kǝ nǝ aɗeng. <verse eid="ACT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>Abet, nciit kǝ mǝnǝ, ɓǝ gurum mo kun, ɗe mo kǝ lep mo nSizariya mbǝ jì pet an, mo kǝ ɗar mpwoo lu ɗe an ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>Riin mǝ Naan sat nghan nǝ, a seet ashak kǝ mo, baa ashak kǝ mee kyetwo kas. Pak nenseet nɗang Jesu mo peemee, mo seet ashak kǝ an zak, ɓǝ mu dǝm mu ɗel nlu kǝ gwar nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>Yaksǝ gwar nǝ wur sat mmun nǝ, ɗi naa mee ngulep mǝ Naan kǝ ɗar nɗǝǝn lu fin, ɗang ngulep nǝ sat nɗyin nǝnee, &lt;A lep shindǝm nJoppa, kǝ mo pet mee gwar ɗe mo kǝ pet sǝm wur a Simon Pita jì ntul fwaa.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Wur mbǝ nsatpwoo nghan ɗe nǝn nle kǝ nwun kat ɓam, waa kǝ nenlu fwaa mo jir.<verse eid="ACT 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>&lt;&lt;Kaaɗe nɗoom leshap, ɓǝ Riin Ɗeɓang sham nkaa mo, nciit kǝ ɗe dǝ wur sham nkaa mun nshee sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/>Ɓǝ nǝ le nghan panpwoo mǝ Daa, ɗe gyet wur sat nǝnee, &lt;Joon kǝ cìn baptisma ngurum mo a shi am, ɗangnaan wur mbǝ ncìn baptisma nwun a shi Riin Ɗeɓang.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Katɗang ɓǝ mbiizuum ɗesǝ, ɗe Naan wur shin mmo, nǝ a ɗemǝndong kǝ ɗewur shin mmun, mbǝɗe mu shinzeen nDaa Jesu Kristi, ɓǝ wen a wii, ɗe an mmak cíi nNaan yii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Kaaɗe mo kǝlǝng pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo ɗok tǝtǝk, yaksǝ mo kwoop Naan ɗeɗes. Mo sat nǝ, &lt;&lt;Daa Naan kǝ shínpee nnen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas, mbǝkǝ mo tuwap, kǝ mo kat seen ɗi zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nbenseet nDang Jesu Ɗe Mon Antiyok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>Nen ɗe dǝ mo rangkáa mbǝ jeel ɗe nǝ kǝ yool, ɗe nǝ le gyet mo tu Stivin, ɓǝ pak mo dǝm wul nyil mFonisha, kǝ Saiprus, kǝ pee nkaam nAntiyok. Baa mo satpwoo Naan nǝ, mmee nen ɗecì mo kas, tǝng a nnen Yahudi mo ɓejee ɗak. <verse eid="ACT 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Ɗangɓe pak nen shinzeen nǝ mo, ɗe mo a nen Saiprus mo, kǝ Sairin mo, mo dǝm wul Antiyok, ɓǝ mo kop pwoo Naan nǝ nnen Helene mo zak, kǝzak mo leshap ɗeret ngurum mo nkaa Daa Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Iiko mǝ Daa nǝ ɗi ashak kǝ mo, ɓǝ gurum mo ɗes mo shinzeen, ɓǝ mo ciir kǝ pǝtuup fur mo pǝ Daa Naan ɗi.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Pwoo nkaa mo nǝ wul nkom mǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu ɗe mo kǝ tong nɗǝǝn Jerusalem, ɓǝ mo lep Barnabas, kǝ nwur dǝm ɗe Antiyok nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Kaaɗe wur seet wul, ɓǝ wur naa ɗeret ɗe Naan le nkaa mo, ɓǝ wur kat retnyit, ɗang wur leshap mmo jir, mbǝkǝ mmo ɗar ɓalɓal nɗǝǝn shinzeen nNaan azeen-zeen shi pǝtuup fur mo jir. <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Barnabas a mee ngwe ɗe ndǝre, kǝzak wur gam kǝ Riin Ɗeɓang, kǝ shinzeen zak. Gurum mo ɗes mo shinzeen nDaa zak.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ Barnabas dǝm nTarsus, mbǝ yap Sool. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>Kaaɗe wur kat Sool, ɓǝ wur jì kǝ wur nAntiyok. Mbǝ ɓit mǝndong, ɓǝ Barnabas kǝ Sool moo kaat ashak kǝ nen shinzeen nǝ mo, yaksǝ mo kám-kam ngurum mo. Mo shee pet nenseet nɗang Jesu mo a Kristiyan a nɗǝǝn pee nkaam Antiyok.<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Nɗǝǝn teer mǝnǝ mo, ɓǝ pak nensatpwoo mǝ Naan mo pwat nJerusalem, ɓǝ mo jì Antiyok. <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/>Memee nɗǝǝn mo, ɗe sǝm wur a Agabus, wur yool ɗar atǝng, ɓǝ wur sat agaak shi iiko ɓal mǝ Riin Ɗeɓang nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Mee neen ɗeɗes nǝ mbǝ taa nkaa yil nǝ jir.&gt;&gt; Mo cìn mǝnǝ a nɗǝǝn ɓit ɗe Klodiyus a mishkoom. <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Nenseet nɗang Jesu mo le pǝtuup fur mo, kǝ koo weyi, ɓǝ wur shin mbii ɗewur mak, mbǝkǝ mmo lep ɓam dǝm ɗi nnen shinzeen ɗe mo kǝ tong nɗǝǝn yil nJudiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Kaaɗe mo cak zuum fur nǝ mo le ashak, ɓǝ mo lep shindǝm nnen ɗǝnan-nan mǝ nen shinzeen ɗe mo kǝ tong nɗǝǝn yil nJudiya nsar Barnabas kǝ Sool.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Mo Tu Jemis, Kǝzak Mo Shoot Pita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Nɗǝǝn teer mǝnǝ mo, ɓǝ mishkoom Herot ɗoom shinjeel ɓaanɓaan nkaa pak nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Wur tu Jemis, ɗyemnǝǝn mǝ Joon shi kwai. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Kaaɗe mishkoom Herot naa muut mǝ Jemis nǝ ret nnen Yahudi mon nyit, ɓǝ wur waa cin shin yaa Pita zak. Ɗesǝ nǝ ɗen a nciit kǝ ɗe mo kǝ se mbiise retnyit mǝ gilaas ɗe baa nǝ kǝ yist kas <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/>Kaaɗe Herot yaa Pita, ɓǝ wur le wur nɗǝǝn lushoot, nsar shiitoon mo kaapaat baapeemee, mbǝkǝ mmo tap wur ɗe rǝrret. Herot kǝ lepan nǝ, ɗyin mbǝ put kǝ Pita ntoom gurum mo aɓwoon mǝ retnyit nǝ mɓekǝ tok ɗiyeel. <verse eid="ACT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Kaaɗe Pita ɗi a ɓuɓwoot nɗǝǝn lushoot nǝ, ɓǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu mon nkaa ɗangnaan hakyeng, mbǝ wur.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Put Kǝ Pita nƊǝǝn Lushoot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Ɗangɓǝ mpar, ɗe daar ɓǝ Herot wur lepan mbǝ put kǝ Pita, mbǝkǝ nwur shinjeel ɗi nwur. Ɓǝ Pita nsaam nnaar shiitoon mo vǝl. Mo ɓwoot wur shi shoolbǝring mo vǝl. Nentappee mo ɗe mpwoo lushoot nǝ, mon nkaa tappee rǝrret. <verse eid="ACT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Yaksǝ ngulep mǝ Daa jì ɗar pǝ Pita ɗi, ɓǝ peeɓang nǝ ɓangpee nɗǝǝn lu nǝ. Ngulep mǝ Daa cut Pita nkwoop, wur mii Pita, ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A yool nkyen&gt;&gt; Yaksǝ shoolbǝring ɗe mo nsar wur mo ɗong nyil. <verse eid="ACT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Ngulep nǝ sat nwur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A lep lee fwaa, kǝzak a jwal kwoopshi fwaa mo.&gt;&gt; Ɓǝ Pita wur cìn mbii ɗe ngulep nǝ sat. Ngulep nǝ sat nwur zak nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A sǝp mbiisǝp fwaa. A jì nɗang an.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Pita put dǝm nɗang ngulep nǝ. Baa wur man nǝ, mbii ɗe ngulep nǝ cìn nǝ azeen kas. Mbǝɗǝ wur pan nǝ ɗyin a nsuun. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Kaaɗe mo ɗel nentappee ɗenshee mo, kǝ ɗevǝl mo, ɓǝ mo jì wul mpwoo lu ɗe mo ɗak a shi shool, ɗe nii naa nkwoop pee nkaam, ɓǝ pwoo lu mǝnǝ wang shikáa fer. Ɓǝ mo pwat, mo yaa ar ɗemǝndong. Ɓǝ nnen mman, ɓǝ ngulep nǝ wur yit Pita mbǝshin.<verse eid="ACT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Kaaɗe Pita kǝ winshin mɓut mbii ɗe nǝ cìn, ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Yaksǝ, wen mman azeen-zeen nǝ, a Daa lep ngulep fin, mbǝkǝ nwur jì ɓam an ɗi nsar Herot, kǝ mbii ɗe nen Yahudi mon nkaa lepyit nǝ, nǝn ncìn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>Kaaɗe wur winshin mɓut nǝ a kǝsǝ, ɓǝ wur dǝm nlu Meeri nǝǝn Joon, ɗe moo pet wur a Maak zak. A pee ɗe gurum mo kǝ kuur ɗi ɗes, kǝ mo nkaa ɗangnaan ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Kaaɗe Pita ɓwap pwoo lu, ɓǝ mee laareep ɗe mo kǝ pet sǝm war a Roda, war jì mbǝ wang pwoo lu nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>Kaaɗe war kǝlǝng ɗoo nǝ a mǝ Pita, ɓǝ baa war wang pwoo lu nǝ kas mbǝ retnyit. Ɗangɓe war waa cin shin, kǝ nwar sat nnen ɗe mo nɗǝǝn lu nǝ, Pita kǝ ɗar a tool mpwoo lu nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Mo sat nwar nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Yii tǝttar aa?&gt;&gt; Ɗangɓe war sat nǝ, tǝng a Pita azeen-zeen. Yaksǝ mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A ngulep wur.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Ɗangɓe Pita naa a mɓwap pwoo lu nǝ ɗak, ɓǝ kaaɗe mo wang pwoo lu nǝ, ɓǝ mo naa a Pita azeen-zeen, ɓǝ nǝ aapwoo mmo zam. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>Ɗangɓe Pita ɗǝk sar mmo, mbǝkǝ mmo ɗok tǝtǝk. Ɓǝ wur yakshii nǝ mmo, kaaɗe Daa put kǝ ɗyin nɗǝǝn lushoot nǝ. Wur sat mmo zak nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wu satpwoo ɗesǝ nǝ nJemis, kǝ koor nen shinzeen nǝ mo zak.&gt;&gt; Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ Pita yool dǝm mmee pee ɗecì.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Kaaɗe ɓitmang, ɓǝ mee ɓǝlep ɗeɗes yool nnaar shiitoon ɗe mo kǝ tap Pita nɗǝǝn lushoot nǝ, mbǝɗe baa mo man mbii ɗe nǝ cìn Pita kas. <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Herot kǝ le kǝ mmo dǝm yappee ɗe Pita dǝm ɗi, ɓǝ baa mo dǝm kat wur kas. Herot tal pǝ shiitoon nǝ mo rǝrret, ɓǝ wur le kǝ mmo twe mo ɗi. Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ Herot yool yit yil nJudiya, kǝ nwur dǝm ɗi nyil nSizariya, ɓǝ wur dǝm cìn mee rep teer mo ɗe mpee mǝnǝ.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muut Kǝ Herot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Herot langtuup kǝ nen Taya mo, kǝ nen Saidon mo hakyeng. Aasǝ ɓǝ mo ɓalkaa fur mo ashak, mbǝkǝ mmo dǝm naa wur ɗi. Mo shee yap ar ɗe mon ndǝm naa Herot a pǝ Blastus ɗi, ɗewur a ngwe ɗeɗes nkaa lu mishkoom nǝ. Yaksǝ mo dǝm pǝ Herot ɗi, ɓǝ mo ɗang pǝ wur, kǝ mmo kat tongriyang ɗi pǝ mishkoom, mbǝɗe yil mo nii kat mbiise a nɗǝǝn yil mishkoom nǝ.<verse eid="ACT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Kaaɗe puus ɗe mo kǝ le nǝ wul, ɓǝ Herot tap jwal lee fin ɗe mǝ mishkoom, wur tap tong nkaa mbii tong mǝ ɗeɗes fin, ɓǝ wur leshap nnen nǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Nen nǝ mo le or, ɗang mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗesǝ nǝ a ɗoo mǝ mee naan baa a mǝ gurum kas.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Nnen mman, ɓǝ mee ngulep mǝ Daa Naan cut Herot, mbǝɗe baa wur shin ɗeɗes nNaan kas. Ɓǝ yaksǝ nyet mo se Herot ɓǝ wur muut.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Gurum mo ɗes mo kǝlǝng pwoo mǝ Naan, ɓǝ mo shinzeen, ɓǝ pwoo mǝ Naan nǝ dǝm shipee-shipee zak. <verse eid="ACT 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Kaaɗe Barnabas kǝ Sool mo kyes ɗak fur, ɓǝ mo baaji nJerusalem ashak kǝ Joon ɗe mo kǝ pet wur a Maak.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Mo Lep Barnabas Kǝ Sool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Nɗǝǝn kuur kǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu ɗe mon Antiyok, ɓǝ pak nensatpwoo mǝ Naan mo, kǝ nenkam-kám mo ɗi. Barnabas, kǝ Simiyon ɗe mo kǝ pet wur a ɗetǝp, kǝ Lusiyus ngu Sairin, kǝ Manayen ɗewur wurang ashak kǝ mishkoom Herot, kǝ Sool. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Kaaɗe mon nkaa seyil nDaa ɗang mon nkaa yaa pwoo kǝ neen zak, ɓǝ Riin Ɗeɓang sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wu bǝlǝp Barnabas kǝ Sool wu le nghan, mbǝ ɗak ɗe an kǝn mpet mo mbǝ cìn nǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Ɓǝ mo yaa pwoo kǝ neen, ɗang mo ɗangnaan zak, ɓǝ mo lesar nkaa mo, ɓǝ mo ɓwet Barnabas kǝ Sool mo shinseet.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Satpwoo Mǝ Naan nSaiprus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Riin Ɗeɓang lep Barnabas kǝ Sool mo shindǝm nSelusiya, ɓǝ mo dǝm ɗel tii mpeemǝnǝ, kǝ mo dǝm ɗe nSaiprus. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Kaaɗe mo wul nSalamis, ɓǝ mo satpwoo mǝ Naan ngurum mo nɗǝǝn lu mǝ Naan mǝ nnen Yahudi mo. Joon ɗe sǝm wur a Maak sǝ, wur ɗe ashak kǝ mo mbǝ ɓam. <verse eid="ACT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Aɓwoon ɗe mo kǝ mwaan nɗǝǝn yil ɗe Am kuur neer nǝ cǝǝrkaat jir ɓǝ, mo dǝm wul mPafos, ɓǝ mo kat mee ngu Yahudi ɗe mo kǝ petsǝm wur a Barjesu wur a ngucìn yen ɗebish, kǝzak wur leshin a koo ngusatpwoo mǝ Naan sǝ, ɗang baa wur a ngusatpwoo Naan kas. <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>Wur ɗi ashak kǝ nguɗak mǝ ngwe ɗeɗes nǝ, gofna Sarjiyus Polo, wur a mee ngumanshii mbii zam. Gofna nǝ wur pet Barnabas kǝ Sool, mbǝɗe wur reɓet kǝlǝng pwoo mǝ Naan pǝ mo ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Ɗangɓe Elimas nguyen ɗebish sǝ, (A sǝm wur nǝ mmǝnǝ shi liispwoo mǝ Heleni) wur cíi mmo, mbǝɗe wur rǝɓet kǝ taji gofna nǝ wur shinzeen mpwoo mǝ Naan kas. <verse eid="ACT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Ɗangɓe Sool ɗe moo pet wur a Pool, wur gam kǝ Riin mǝ Naan, ɓǝ wur ban yit fǝn nzǝng nkaa ngucìn yen ɗebish nǝ, <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Waa làa mǝ ngunjwaan! Gha a shaarlek mǝ mbii ɗe ndǝre mo jir. Kǝzak pǝtuup fwaa nǝ gam kǝ gwampee, kǝ cìn nyang. Aa ɗaar shidaar-shidaar, mbǝkǝ nghan cǝǝr kǝ zeen mǝ Daa, mbǝkǝ nǝ ɗee ɗi a ɗung. <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>A naa yaksǝ, Daa Naan wur mbǝ le kǝ gha ɗee a vum. Baa gha mmak naa puus kas, mbǝ reppee lee.&gt;&gt; Abet-abet, ɓǝ vuun, kǝ peenkwoo mo jì paa Elimas, ɓǝ wur ɗoom yappee, mbǝ yap ngwe ɗe mbǝ yaakam nwur. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Kaaɗe gofna nǝ wur naa mbii aapwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ wur shinzeen, mbǝɗe nǝ fes aapwoo nwur nkaa kám ɗewur kǝlǝng nkaa Daa Naan.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Kǝ Shaarmwaan Fin Mo nYil Antiyok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Pool kǝ nnen ɗe mo ashak kǝ wur, mo yool mPafos, ɓǝ mo ɗel nɗǝǝn tii, kǝ mo dǝm ɗi mPaga ɗe nǝ nyil mPamfiliya, ɓǝ Joon Maak yit mo mpeemǝnǝ, kǝ nwur baa dǝm ɗi nJerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Mo yool mPaga, ɓǝ mo ɗel dǝm Antiyok ɗe nǝ mPisidiya. Parpuus Nookɗi, ɓǝ mo ɗel nɗǝǝn lu mǝ Naan, ɓǝ mo tong ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Aɓwoon ɗe mee gurum kǝ tang nɗǝǝn ɓǝǝt-haal mǝ Wàar mǝ Mosis mo, kǝ nɗǝǝn ɓǝǝt-haal mǝ nensatpwoo mǝ Naan mo, ɓǝ nen ɗǝnan-nan nkaa lu mǝ Naan nǝ, mo lep sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa mo, katɗang wun kǝ mee pwoo ɗe wun mbǝ sat ngurum nǝ mo, ɓǝ wu sat.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Pool yool ɗar atǝng, ɓǝ wur ɗiyeep sar wur, mbǝkǝ ngurum nǝ mo ɗok ɗe tǝtǝk, ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wun nnen Isreil mo, kǝ wun nen ɗe baa wun a nnen Isreil mo kas, ɗe wuu kǝǝr Naan, wu lekom fuu mo. <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/>Naan mǝ nnen Isreil mo, bǝlǝp puun fun mo ɗang wur le mo a ɗeɗes, ɓǝ mo a mǝzep nɗǝǝn yil Ijip. Wur put kǝ mo nɗǝǝn yil Ijip shiɓal fin ɗeɗes zak. <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/>Mbǝ ɓit mo laarfeer, ɓǝ wur mang gung kǝ mo a naaryil. <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/>Wur le kǝ mmo twe mee soon mo pwoovǝl nɗǝǝn yil nKeenan, ɓǝ wur shin yil mǝnǝ nnen fin Isreil mo, ɓǝ nǝ ɗee mo a mbii kok kop. Mo tong nɗǝǝn yil mǝnǝ mbǝ ɓit mo kambil feer kǝ laarpaat. <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ wur shin nentokɗyeel mo mmo, dǝm jì wul mɓít mǝ ngusatpwoo mǝ Naan Samuwel. <verse eid="ACT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>Kaaɗe mo ɗang pǝ Naan kǝ nwur shin mishkoom mmo, ɓǝ Naan shin Sool làa mǝ Kish mmo, ɗewur a ɗang mǝ Benjamin. Sool se mishkoom nǝ mbǝ ɓit mo laarfeer. <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/>Aɓwoon ɗe Naan shang Sool mɓut nɗak mishkoom nǝ. Ɓǝ wur bǝlǝp Devit kǝ nwur ɗee a mishkoom mo. Naan shin langtǝng nkaa Devit nǝnee, &lt;An kǝn nkat Devit làa mǝ Jese, a ngwe ɗe wen nreɓet hakyeng. Wur mbǝ cin mbii ɗe nsat mo nwur jir.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>A nɗǝǝn ɗang mǝ gwar ɗe ɗesǝ, ɓǝ Naan jì kǝ Jesu Nguɓam mbǝ nnen Isreil mo, kaaɗe gyet Naan kǝ ten tuweer mmo sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/>Akuɗang Jesu jì, ɓǝ Joon kǝ ten satpwoo Naan nnen Isreil mo jir nǝnee, &lt;Mo tuwap, mbǝkǝ mmo cin baptisma ɗi mmo zak.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/>Kaaɗe Joon kus kǝ kyes ɗak fin, ɓǝ wur tal pǝ gurum nǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;Wun, pǝpan nǝ, an a wii? Baa a an a ngwe ɗe wun mbǝ ɗarnaa jì wur kas. Ɗangɓe wu lekom, mee gurum mbǝ jì aɓwoon fen, ɗe koo a teng kwoopshi ɗe nshii wur mo, ɓǝ baa ɗeret fen nǝ mak kǝ nghan fwen teng kwoopshi wur nǝ mo kas.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>&lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa mo! Jep mǝ ɗang Abraham mo, kǝ nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas, ɗe mo kǝ kǝǝr Naan nɗǝǝn wun. A mbǝ wun jir, ɓǝ Naan kǝ lep pwoo ɓam ɗesǝ nǝ jì. <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Nen ɗe mo kǝ tong nɗǝǝn Jerusalem kǝ nennan fur mo, baa mo man nǝ, Jesu a Nguɓam kas, kǝzak baa mo manshii mǝ pwoo nensatpwoo mǝ Naan mo, ɗe mo kǝ tang koo a parpuus Nookɗi ɗeɗangyii kas zak. Gyet mo gampwoo ɗe gyet nensatpwoo mǝ Naan mo kǝ ten sat kaaɗe gyet mo tokɗyeel muut nJesu sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/>Koo ɗe baa gyet mo kat wur cìn mee shikbish ɗe nǝ mak muut nwur kas, ɓǝ mo ɗang pǝ Pailet kǝ mmo tu wur ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/>Kaaɗe mbii ɗe mo kǝ ten nran nkaa wur mo gam jir, ɓǝ mo sham kǝ kúm wur nkaa shiyeepyoom nǝ, ɓǝ mo dǝm le kúm wur nɗǝǝn gwoot kǝcir. <verse eid="ACT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Ɗangɓe Naan yool kǝ wur a peemúut. <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/>Mbǝ meeteer mo ɗes, ɓǝ wur woo shin fin nnen ɗe gyet mo kǝ mwaan ashak kǝ wur, yool nGalili jì nJerusalem. Yaksǝ ɓǝ mo ɗee a langtǝng wur pǝ gurum mo ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32"/>Mmun, muu satpwoo ɗeret nwun, a pwoo ɗe gyet Naan kǝ ten cweer mpuun fun mo. <verse eid="ACT 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33"/>Naan kǝgam pǝ mun jep mo mo nɗesǝ, kaaɗe wur yool kǝ Jesu a peemúut. Ɗesǝ nǝ nciit kǝ mbii ɗe mo kǝ ten ran nɗǝǝn Zabura ɗevǝl sǝ nǝnee, &lt;Gha a Làa fen, cicinsǝ an kǝn ɗee a puun fwaa.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>A pwoo ɗe Naan sat nkaa yool wur a peemúut nɗesǝ nǝnee, &lt;Baa wur mbǝ baa cam muut ɗe zak kas&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 13:34">Kǝzak Naan sat zak nǝnee, &lt;An mbǝ le ɗeret ɗe nǝ azeen-zeen nkaa wun, ɗe gyet kǝn ten ncweer nDevit.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>Kǝzak, wur sat nɗǝǝn mee Zabura nǝnee, &lt;Baa gha mmak yit kǝ ngwe fwaa ɗeɓang wam nɗǝǝn kǝcir kas.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>&lt;&lt;Gyet Devit kǝ cìn ɗak nciit kǝ ɗyen mǝ Naan mɓít fin mo, ɓǝ wur muut, ɓǝ mo wum wur ashak kǝ puun fin mo, ɓǝ wur wam. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Ɗang Jesu ɗe Naan kǝ yool kǝ wur a peemúut, baa wur wam nɗǝǝn kǝcir kas. <verse eid="ACT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ ɗyemnaa mo! Wu man nǝ, a mbǝ ɗeret mǝ gwar ɗesǝ nǝ, ɓǝ mun nkaa leshap nwun nkaa fwo mǝ shikbish fuu mo. <verse eid="ACT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39"/>A mbǝ Jesu zak, ɗang koo ngwe ɗeɗangyii ɗewur shinzeen, ɓǝ wur mbǝ kat ɓam nɗǝǝn shikbish mo jir. Ɗangɓe baa Wàar Mosis nǝ mo mak ɓam wun mɓut shikbish fuu mo kas. <verse eid="ACT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ, wu tap kǝ káa fuu mo, kǝ taji mbii ɗe gyet nensatpwoo mǝ Naan mo sat nǝ sham taa nkaa wun kas. Gyet mo sat nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>&lt;Wu lekom, wun nenɓákpee mo, nǝn aapwoo nwun, ɗang wu mmurep. Mbǝɗǝ an mbǝ cìn mee ɗak nɗǝǝn teer fuu mo, ɗak ɗe baa wun mbǝ shínzeen nnǝ kas, koo dǝɓen. Koo ɗe mee gurum leshap nwun nkaa nǝnee, ɓǝ baa wun mbǝ shínzeen kas.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Kaaɗe Pool kǝ Barabbas mo a ar put nɗǝǝn lu mǝ Naan nǝ, ɓǝ gurum nǝ mo ɗang pǝ mo, mbǝkǝ mmo cin leshap ɗi nkaa mbii ɗe mo kǝ sat mo, parpuus Nookɗi ɗe mbǝ jì zak. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Ɓǝ aɓwoon ɗe gurum mo rangkáa a peekuur nǝ, ɓǝ nnen Yahudi mo ɗes, kǝ nnen ɗe mo kǝ ciir ɗee a nnen Yahudi mo. Nen ɗe moo lepyit nkaa Naan, mo seet nɗang Pool kǝ Barnabas. Yaksǝ Pool kǝ Barnabas mo leshap mmo, shínɓal mmo mputuup, mbǝkǝ mmo mwaan ɗi nɗǝǝn ɗeret mǝ Naan.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Kaaɗe parpuus Nookɗi nǝ jì wul, ɓǝ nen pee nkaam nǝ mo ɗes hakyeng mo baaji kuur, mbǝ kǝlǝng pwoo mǝ Naan nǝ, ɗee rep pak mo nɗǝǝn pee nkaam nǝ a lee ɗak.<verse eid="ACT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Ɗangɓe kaaɗe nnen Yahudi mo naa gurum mo kuur ɗes, ɓǝ pǝtuup mo mo gam kǝ zuur zam, nǝ le mmo sat nǝ, mbii ɗe Pool sat nǝ mo a ɗung, ɗang mo leshap ɗebuu nkaa wur zak. <verse eid="ACT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Yaksǝ Pool kǝ Barnabas mo waa sǝǝt leshap nǝ ɓalɓal agaak baa kǝ mee kǝǝrmuut kas. Mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Nǝ a tǝng kǝ mo shee satpwoo mǝ Naan nǝ a nwun, ɗang wu ciipwoo Naan nǝ, kǝzak wu lesuk a koo baa wun kǝkoop nǝ mbǝ kat seen ɗe dǝm nghaa-nghaa kas. Ɓǝ yaksǝ, mun mbǝ yit wun, mbǝkǝ mmun dǝm mu satpwoo mǝ Naan nǝ ɗe nnen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>Mbǝɗǝ Daa kǝ sat mmun nǝnee, &lt;An kǝn le gha, mbǝkǝ nghan ɗee a peeɓang mbǝ nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas. Mbǝkǝ nɗǝǝn gha, ɓǝ gurum ɗe nɗǝǝn yil nǝ mo jir, mo mbǝ kat ɓam ɗi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Kaaɗe nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas, mo kǝlǝng pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo kǝlǝng retnyit zam, kǝzak mo lepwoo mǝ Naan a ɗeɗes. Nen ɗe mo kǝ ten bǝlǝp mo le, mbǝkǝ mmo kat seen ɗe dǝm nghaa-nghaa ɗi.<verse eid="ACT 13:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Pwoo kǝ Daa Naan nǝ dǝm shipee-shipee nɗǝǝn yil mǝnǝ jir. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Ɗangɓe nnen Yahudi mo kar pak shurep ɗe mo kǝǝr Naan, shurep ɗǝnan-nan mo, kǝ nen ɗenan-nan mǝ pee nkaam nǝ mo, kǝ mmo shinjeel ɗe nkaa Pool kǝ Barnabas. Ɗangɓe mo ceen Pool kǝ Barnabas put aku nɗǝǝn yil mo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/>Ɓǝ Pool kǝ Barnabas mo ɓwap ǝrong ɗe nǝn nkaa shii mo mo, mbǝkǝ nǝ ɗee ɗi a langtǝng nkaa nen pee nkaam nǝ mo, ɓǝ mo dǝm Ikoniyum. <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Nenseet nɗang Jesu mo gam kǝ retnyit zam, ɗang mo gam kǝ Riin mǝ Naan zak.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Pool kǝ Barnabas nDǝǝn Yil Ikoniyum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>nƊǝǝn Ikoniyum, ɓǝ Pool kǝ Barnabas mo ɗel nɗǝǝn lu mǝ Naan mǝ nnen Yahudi mo. Ɓǝ mo sat pwoo mǝ Naan, ɗe gurum mo ɗes nɗǝǝn nnen Yahudi mo, kǝ nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas, mo shinzeen. <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Ɗangɓe nnen Yahudi ɗe mo cii shinzeen mpwoo nǝ, mo kar, kǝzak mo lepshii nnen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas, mbǝkǝ mmo yool ɗi kǝ pwoo ɗebuu nkaa nenseet nɗang Jesu mo. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Pool kǝ Barnabas mo tong mpee nkaam mǝnǝ, mbǝ teer mo ɗes hakyeng, kǝ mmo leshap ngurum mo nkaa Daa ɓalɓal agaak, baa ashak kǝ mee kǝǝrmuut kas. Mo ɗee a langtǝng mǝ pwoo wur ɗeret nǝ, mbǝɗe Daa kǝ le kǝn Pool kǝ Barnabas mo cìn mbii lukshik mo, kǝ mbii aapwoo mo. <verse eid="ACT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Nen pee nkaam nǝ mo ɓàksut vǝl, pak mo dǝm nɗang pwoo mǝ nnen Yahudi mo, ɗang pak mo dǝm nɗang pwoo mǝ jeplep nǝ mo.<verse eid="ACT 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas, kǝ nnen Yahudi mo, mo ɓalpwoo mo mo ashak kǝ nen ɗenan-nan mǝ pee nkaam nǝ mo, mbǝkǝ mmo shinjeel ɗi njeplep nǝ mo, kǝ mmo car mo ɗi shi ghǝk zak. <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>Yaksǝ kaaɗe jeplep nǝ mo kǝlǝng mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo pwat shwe dǝm mpee nkaam nListira kǝ Debi, ɗe mo ngaar yil nLukoniya, kǝ pak jepyil ɗe mo neer pee nkaam mǝnǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Mo leshap ɗeret ngurum mo mpeemǝnǝ mo zak.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Car Pool nDǝǝn Yil nListira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Nɗǝǝn Listira nǝ, ɓǝ mee gwar wur ɗi, ɗe shii wur mo kut, mbǝɗe pǝgyet mo làa wur a kurumkut ɓe baa wur kǝ cam mwaan shi shii fin kas. <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>Wur lekom mbǝkǝ nwur kǝlǝng Pool ɗe nkaa leshap. Pool ban yit nzǝng nkaa gwar nǝ, ɓǝ kaaɗe wur naa gwar nǝ kǝ shinzeen ɗe nǝ mak kǝn mo bar gwar nǝ, <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>yaksǝ Pool sat shi ɗoo ɗeɗes nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A yool a ɗar shi shii fwaa!&gt;&gt; Ɓǝ gwar nǝ wur sham yool metpee, ɗang wur mwaan zak.<verse eid="ACT 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Kaaɗe kuur mǝ gurum nǝ mo naa mbii ɗe Pool cìn ɓǝ mo ɗiyeep ɗoo fur mo shi liispwoo mǝ nnen Lukoniya mo, mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A naan mo sham pǝ mun ɗe, nɗǝǝn nan koo mun gurum sǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Mo pet Barnabas a Ziiyos, ɗang mo pet Pool a Hamis, mbǝɗe a Pool wur a ngusatpwoo nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Yaksǝ mishkoom kùm ɗe mǝ Ziiyos, ɗe lu kùm wur nǝ kus kǝ pee nkaam nǝ, wur jì kǝ kus nǝng mo, kǝ pelɗem mo, ngaar pǝbong nǝ, mbǝɗe wur kǝ kuur gurum nǝ mo, mo kǝ reɓet wus mbiizuum njeplep nǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Ɗangɓe, kaaɗe, Barnabas kǝ Pool mo kǝlǝng mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo yilang nlǝr fur mo. Mo shwe dǝm ɗel nɗǝǝn kuur gurum nǝ mo, ɓǝ mo le or, ɓǝ mo sat nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>&lt;&lt;Hee des oo! A mii le ɗang wun pǝ reɓet cìn mbii mǝnǝ ii? Mun a gurum mo koo wun sǝ. Mu jì mpee ɗesǝ a mbǝkǝ mmo satpwoo ɗeret ɗe nwun, mbǝkǝ nwun yit mbii ɗebuu sǝ mo ɗi, ɗe baa mo kǝ mee koop nǝ kas. Mbǝkǝ nwun jì pǝ Naan ɗewur kǝ seen. A wur le ɗeng, kǝ yil, kǝ Am kuur mo, kǝ mbii ɗe nɗǝǝn mo jir zak. <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Dǝ yam-yam ɓǝ, a Naan shínpee ngurum mo jir, kǝ mo mwaan nɗǝǝn ar ɗe mo kǝ reɓet. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Jir kǝsǝ, ɓǝ baa wur kǝ cam nook cìn langtǝng mbǝ shin fin kas, mbǝɗe wur cìn mbii ɗeret mo. A wur shin fwan sham nwun aɗeng, kǝ mbii kǝkop fuu mo ntarpas, ɗang a wur shin mbiise nwun ɗes zak, kǝzak a wur gam pǝtuup fuu mo shi retnyit zak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Jeplep nǝ mo leshap ɗesǝ mmo, jir kǝsǝ, ɓǝ a prurut, ɗang mo cíi nkuur kǝ gurum nǝ mo, mbǝkǝ taji gurum nǝ mo wus mbiizuum mbǝ seyil mmo kas.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Ɗangɓe pak nnen Yahudi mo pwat Antiyok, ɗe nǝ mPisidiya, kǝ Ikoniyum, mo jì mangɗyeen ngurum nǝ mo, ɗe mo kar kuur gurum nǝ mo, mbǝkǝ mmo yool ɗi kǝ lek nkaa jeplep nǝ mo. Yaksǝ mo car Pool shi ghǝk, ɓǝ mo fee wur put kǝ nǝ aɓwoon pee nkaam nǝ. Mo pan nǝ, Pool kǝ muut. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Ɗang kaaɗe nenseet nɗang Jesu mo jì neer Pool, ɓǝ wur yool, wur ɗel nɗǝǝn pee nkaam nǝ. Daar nǝ, ɓǝ wur kǝ Barnabas mo pwat dǝm nDebi.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Pool kǝ Barnabas, mo dǝm leshap ɗeret nǝ nnen pee nkaam nDaabi mo, ɓǝ gurum mo ɗes mo shinzeen nDaa Jesu. Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo baaji nListira, kǝ Ikoniyum, kǝ Antiyok zak. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>Mo shínɓal mputuup nenseet nɗang Jesu mo. Mo leshap mmo, mbǝkǝ mmo ɗar ɗe ɓalɓal nɗǝǝn shinzeen mo, kǝ mo kám mo zak nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Mun shwaajeel ɗes, akuɗang ɓǝ mun mbǝ mmak ɗel nɗǝǝn pee ɗehai mǝ Naan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Pool kǝ Barnabas mo bǝlǝp nen ɗenan-nan mo, mbǝ koo a kuur mǝ nenseet ndang Naan ɗǝɗang mo ii, ashak kǝ ɗang, kǝ yaa pwoo kǝ neen zak, ɓǝ mo le nnen ɗe mo bǝlǝp nǝ mo nsar mǝ Daa, ɗe mo shinzeen nwur.<verse eid="ACT 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Aɓwoon ɗe mo kǝ taaɗel ngaar mPisidiya, ɓǝ mo jì wul mPamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Kaaɗe mo kǝ satpwoo nǝ nɗǝǝn Paga, ɓǝ mo yool sham dǝm Ataliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>Mo yool mpee mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo ɗel tii, kǝn mmo baaji ɗin Antiyok, pee nkaam ɗe dǝ mo shee ɗangnaan ɗi nkaa mo, mbǝkǝ nɗeret mǝ Naan nǝ kyeer mo ɗi nɗǝǝn ɗak, ɗe yaksǝ ɓǝ mo kǝ cìn kyes.<verse eid="ACT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Kaaɗe mo baaji wul, ɓǝ mo pet kuur nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo ashak jir, ɓǝ mo leshap ngurum nǝ mo nkaa mbii ɗe Naan le kǝ mmo cìn, kǝ kaaɗe wur wang ar mǝ shinzeen nnen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas zak. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Mo tong nɗǝǝn pee nkaam mǝnǝ ɗes, ashak kǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu mo.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Kuur Kǝ Nennan Mǝ Nen Jesu Mo nJerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>Pak gurum mo tong nJudiya mo jì nAntiyok, ɓǝ mo jì kám nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Katɗang baa mo can wun, kaaɗe Wàar mǝ Mosis sat sǝ kas, ɓǝ baa wun mbǝ mak kat ɓam kas.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Pool kǝ Barnabas mo cìn ɓeetshik ɗes kǝ mo, nkaa kám mǝnǝ. Aasǝ ɓǝ, mo bǝlǝp Pool kǝ Barnabas kǝ pak gurum mo nɗǝǝn nen shinzeen nǝ mo, kǝ mmo dǝm nJerusalem pǝ jeplep mo ɗi, kǝ nennan mǝ Eklesiya mo, mbǝkǝ mmo dǝm ɓeetpwoo ɗesǝ nǝ ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Eklesiya mo ɓwet mo, ɓǝ mo taa mer nyil mFonisha kǝ Samariya. Mo satpwoo tuwap mǝ nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas, kǝzak kaaɗe mo le pǝtuup mo mo pǝ Naan ɗi. Pwoo ɗesǝ nǝ jì kǝ retnyit nnenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo hakyeng. <verse eid="ACT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Kaaɗe mo wul nJerusalem, ɓǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu mo kǝ jeplep mo, kǝ nen ɗenan-nan mo, mo kaat mo. Yaksǝ mo yakshii mǝ mbii ɗe Naan wur cìn ashak kǝ mo jir. <verse eid="ACT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Yaksǝ pak nen shinzeen ɗe mo a mǝ ar mǝ nen Farisi mo, mo yool kǝ pwoo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Nǝ ret kǝ tǝng mo can nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas, kǝzak nǝ a tǝng mo tap Wàar mǝ Mosis rǝrret zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Jeplep mo, kǝ nen ɗenan-nan mǝ Eklesiya nǝ, mo kuur ashak, mbǝkǝ mmo naashii mǝ pwoo ɗesǝ nǝ ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>Aɓwoon ɗe mo kǝ ɓeetpwoo nǝ ɗes ndǝr-ndǝr hakyeng, ɓǝ Pita yool ɗar atǝng, ɓǝ wur sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa mo! Wu man nǝ, Naan shee bǝlǝp an mɓut nwun, mbǝkǝ nghan sat pwoo ɗeret nǝ ɗi nnen ɗe baa mo a nen Yahudi mo kas, kǝ mmo shinzeen ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/>Naan ɗewur man pǝtuup mǝ gurum mo jir, wur kám agaak nǝ, ɗyin ɗi lap mo, kaaɗe wur shin Riin Ɗeɓang mmo, nciit kǝ ɗe dǝ wur kǝ shin mmun sǝ zak. <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>Baa Naan ɓàkyit mmun kǝ mo kas. Wur vwang shikbish ɗe nɗǝǝn pǝtuup mo mo, a mbǝɗe mo shinzeen. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ yaksǝ, ɓǝ a mii le ɗang wun pǝ kam Naan ii? Wun nkaa le lée ɗe toon nkaa took mǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu mo, ɗe koo a puun fun mo, kǝ mun, ɓǝ baa mu mak mang lée nǝ mo kas. <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Hai! Mu shinzeen nǝ, a mbǝ ɗeret mǝ Daa fun Jesu, ɗang mu kat ɓam, kaaɗe mo kat ɓam nǝ sǝ zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Kuur mǝ gurum nǝ mo ɗok tǝtǝk, kǝ mmo lekom mbǝ kǝlǝng pwoo mǝ Barnabas, kǝ Pool, kaaɗe mo nkaa leshap mmo nkaa mbii lukshik mo, kǝ mbii aapwoo mo, ɗe Naan le kǝ mPool kǝ Barnabas mo cìn, nɗǝǝn nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas.<verse eid="ACT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Aɓwoon ɗe mo kyes leshap nǝ, ɓǝ Jemis sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa mo, wu lekom kǝ nwun kǝlǝng an ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Pita kǝ leshap nwun nkaa wal ɗe Naan shee kám nǝ nnen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas. Wur shwat pak mo nɗǝǝn mo, mbǝkǝ mmo ɗee ɗi a nen fin mo. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Ɗesǝ nǝ a nciit kǝ pwoo mǝ nensatpwoo mǝ Naan mo, ɗe mo kǝ ten ran nɗǝǝn ɓǝǝt-haal mǝ Naan nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>&lt;Aɓwoon ɗesǝ ɓǝ an mbǝ baajì. Mbǝkǝ nghan mbaa ɗi kǝ lu mǝ Devit ɗe nǝ shirip sǝ ɗi. An mbǝ baa ɗiyeep kǝrem lu ɗe mo kǝ shirip nǝ zak. <verse eid="ACT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>Mbǝkǝ nkoor gurum mo jir, ɓǝ mo jì tang Daa ɗi, kǝ jir nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas, ɗe an kǝn pǝrep mo, mbǝkǝ mo ɗee ɗi a nen fen mo. <verse eid="ACT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>A Daa kǝ sat a kǝsǝ! Wur kǝ ten le kǝ mbii ɗesǝ mo ɗee a ɗemǝman pegyet ɗi yam-yam.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>&lt;&lt;Mbǝ mǝnǝ, nnaa mǝnǝ, ɓǝ taji wu le nǝ luk nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas, ɗe mo ciir kǝ pǝtuup fur mo pǝ Naan ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/>Ɗangɓe mu ran lep a rǝran mmo, mbǝkǝ mmun sat ɗi mmo nǝnee. Taji mo se mee mbiise ɗe mo kǝ ten shin nkùm kas. Kǝzak taji mo cìn ngaa kas. Taji mo se luwaa mǝ long ɗe mo miyoor took nǝ kas. Kǝzak taji mo se toom kas zak. <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Mbǝɗǝ mo kǝ tang Wàar mǝ Mosis nǝ peedǝ ɗi yam-yam, koo a parpuus Nookɗi ɗeɗangyii nɗǝǝn lu mǝ Naan nǝ mo jir, kǝ nɗǝǝn pee nkaam nǝ mo jir zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Ran Lep nNen Ɗe Mo Shinzeen Ɗe Baa Mon A Nen Yahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Jeplep nǝ mo, kǝ nen ɗenan-nan mo, kǝ nen shinzeen nǝ mo jir, mo naa nǝ, nǝ ret kǝ mmo bǝlǝp pak gurum mo nnaar fur, mbǝkǝ mmo lep mo shindǝm Antiyok ashak kǝ Pool kǝ Barnabas. Ɓǝ mo bǝlǝp Judas ɗe moo pet wur a Barsabas, kǝ Silas zak, ɗe mo a ɗǝnan-nan mɓut nnen shinzeen nǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Yaksǝ mo lep mo shindǝm ashak kǝ lep a rǝran ɗe nǝ sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Jeplep mo, kǝ nen ɗenan-nan mǝ Eklesiya mo, mun ɗyemnǝǝn fuu mo, muu lep tokshik fun ɗeɗes dǝm pǝ wun ɗyemnǝǝn fun, nenseet nɗang Jesu mo, ɗe baa wun a nnen Yahudi mo kas. Ɗe wuu tong nɗǝǝn yil Antiyok, kǝ Siriya, kǝ Silisiya. <verse eid="ACT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>Mu kǝlǝng nǝ, pak gurum mo nɗǝǝn nen ɗe mo pwat pǝ mun ɗi, mo kǝ dǝm daampee nwun shi pwoo mo, kǝ mmo ringshii nwun. Ɓǝ baa a mun mu lep mo kas. <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Kaaɗe mu kuur ashak, ɓǝ pwoo fun mo seet ndangshak, ɓǝ mu naa nǝ, nǝ ret kǝ mmun bǝlǝp pak gurum mo, mbǝkǝ mmun lep mo dǝm pǝ wun ɗi. Mo dǝm ashak kǝ shaar fun mo Barnabas kǝ Pool. <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>Mo kǝ shin seen fur mo mbǝ cìn ɗak mǝ Daa fun Jesu Kristi. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ, mu lep Judas kǝ Silas dǝm pǝ wun ɗi. Mo shikáa fur, mon nyakshii mǝ mbii ɗe mǝ nran nɗǝǝn lep a rǝran nǝ nwun shi pwoo. <verse eid="ACT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>Mbǝɗǝ Riin Ɗeɓang kǝ naa nǝ ret, ɗang mmun mu naa nǝ ret a kǝsǝ zak, mbǝkǝ taji mo le mee lée toon nkaa wun, waa met mbii ɗesǝ mo kas. <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>Taji wu se mbiise ɗe mo kǝ ten shin nkùm kas, kǝzak taji wu se luwaa ashak kǝ toom kas. Taji wu se luwaa mǝ long ɗe mo miyoor took nǝ kas, ɗang taji wu cìn ngaa kas. Katɗang baa wuu cìn mbii ɗesǝ mo kas, ɓǝ nǝ ret zam. Ɗang mukaat. Wu tongriyang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Mo lep nenlep nǝ mo shinseet, ɓǝ mo dǝm Antiyok, a mpee ɗe kuur mǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu mo ɗi ashak, ɓǝ mo shin lep ɗe a rǝran nǝ mmo. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Kaaɗe mo tang lep a rǝran nǝ ngurum nǝ mo, ɓǝ mo kǝlǝng retnyit zam, mbǝɗe pwoo nǝ fes gangkwak mmo zam. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Mbǝɗǝ Judas kǝ Silas, mo a nensatpwoo mǝ Naan mo zak, ɓǝ mo shínɓal ngurum nǝ mo mputuup zak. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Aɓwoon ɗe mo cìn rep teer mo nɗǝǝn Antiyok ɓǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo ɓwet mo ryang, mbǝkǝ mmo baa ɗi pǝ nen ɗe dǝ mo lep mo. <verse eid="ACT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34"/>Ɗangɓǝ Silas naa nǝ nǝ ret kǝ nɗyin ɗi tong ɗi mpee mǝnǝ. <verse eid="ACT 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Ɓǝ Pool kǝ Barnabas mo tong nɗǝǝn Antiyok mbǝ rep teer mo. Mo nkaa kám, kǝzak mo nkaa satpwoo mǝ Daa, ashak kǝ pak gurum mo ɗes.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Mo Ɓakshak Kǝ Barnabas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Aɓwoon meeteer mo ruk, ɓǝ Pool sat mBarnabas nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Nǝ ret kǝ mmun cin mu dǝm, mbǝkǝ mmun tok kǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu mo nɗǝǝn koo a pee nkaam ɗeɗangyii ɓe kǝ mun nakoom mu ɗi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Barnabas reɓet kǝ mmo seet ashak kǝ Joon ɗe moo pet wur a Maak. <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/>Ɗangɓǝ Pool naa baa nǝ ret kǝ nwur seet ashak kǝ mo a peeɗak nǝ kas. Mbǝɗǝ dǝ wur kǝ su yit mo ɗe nyil mPamfiliya kǝzak baa wur sekyeen ashak kǝ mo nɗǝǝn ɗak nǝ kas. <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Ɓǝ ɓeetshik yool mmo nnaar, ɗe nǝ le mmo ɓàkshak. Barnabas mang Maak ashak kǝ wur, ɓǝ mo ɗel nɗǝǝn tii kǝ mmo dǝm ɗi nSaiprus. <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>Ɗangɓǝ Pool bǝlǝp Silas. Ɓǝ aɓwoon ɗe nenseet nɗang Jesu mo ɗangnaan (leshap kǝ Naan), ɓǝ mo le mo nsar ɗeret mǝ Daa Naan, ɓǝ mo pwat seet. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Pool ɗel dǝm nɗǝǝn yil nSiriya kǝ Silisiya, wur nkaa gangkwak nnenseet nɗang Jesu ɗe mo mpeemǝnǝ jir.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Timoti Seet Nɗang Pool Kǝ Silas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Pool jì wul nDebi kǝ Listira. Yaksǝ wur kat mee nguseet nɗang Jesu nɗǝǝn Listira nǝ, ɗe sǝm wur a Timoti. Wur a làa mee mat Yahudi ɗe war shinzeen nDaa Jesu, ɗang puun wur a ngu Heleni. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Nenseet nɗang Jesu ɗe mon nListira kǝ Ikoniyum, moo kwoop mǝse kǝ Timoti nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Pool reɓet kǝ nTimoti seet nɗang wur, a kǝsǝ ɓǝ Pool can Timoti, mbǝ nnen Yahudi ɗe mo nɗǝǝn peemǝnǝ mo. Mbǝɗǝ mo jir, mo man nǝ, puun Timoti a ngu Heleni. <verse eid="ACT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Kaaɗe mo a ar mwaan, ɓǝ mo dǝm ɗel nɗǝǝn pee nkaam mo, kǝ mo leshap kǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu ɗe mon mpeemǝnǝ mo, nkaa Wàar ɗe jeplep mo, kǝ nennan mǝ Eklesiya ɗe nJerusalem mo kǝ sat, mbǝkǝ nnenseet nɗang Jesu mo tap ɗi kǝ Wàar nǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Aasǝ ɓǝ, nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo ɗar ɓalɓal nɗǝǝn shinzeen fur, ɗang mo ɓul shidaar shidaar zak<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Suun Nkaa Mee Ngu Masidoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Pool kǝ nen ɗe mo ashak kǝ wur, mo ɗel dǝm nɗǝǝn yil nFirjiya kǝ yil nGalati zak, mbǝɗe baa Riin Ɗeɓang yit kǝ mmo satpwoo Naan nɗǝǝn yil Eshiya kas. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Kaaɗe mo wul a pee ɓàkyil mǝ nen Misiya mo, ɓǝ moo reɓet ɗel dǝm nyil mBisiniya, ɗang Riin Jesu tǝǝrsar mmo. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Aasǝ ɓǝ, mo ɗel dǝm nɗǝǝn yil mMisiya, mbǝkǝ mmo ɗel sham ɗi nyil nTrowas. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Mparmǝnǝ, ɓǝ Pool teer suun nǝ, ɗi naa mee ngu Masidoniya kǝ ɗar, ɗang wur nkaa ɗang pǝ ɗyin nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A can a ɗel nyil mMasidoniya kǝ nghan ɓam mun ɗi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Kaaɗe Pool suun suun ɗesǝ, ɓǝ abet-abet mu ɗak sun mbǝ dǝm Masidoniya nǝ, mbǝɗe mu man azeen-zeen nǝ, a Naan pet mun, mbǝkǝ mmun dǝm mu satpwoo fin ɗi mpee mǝnǝ.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lidiya Shinzeen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Mu yool nɗǝǝn tii nTrowas, ɓǝ mu ɗel mu seet wur-wur mbǝ dǝm nSamotras. Daar nǝ ɓǝ mu jì mu wul Niyapolis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Mu yool a mpeemǝnǝ, ɓǝ mu mwan shi ji nFilipi, ɗe nǝ a pee nkaam ɗeɗes ngaar mMasidoniya. Nǝ a mee yil ɗe nǝn ndǝr nen Rom mo. Yaksǝ mu cìn meeteer mo ruk nɗǝǝn pee nkaam mǝnǝ.<verse eid="ACT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Parpuus Nookɗi, ɓǝ mu put mpee nkaam nǝ, kǝn mmun dǝm ɗi mpwoo dung, a pee ɗe mu pan nǝ, mun nkat mee pee ɗangnaan ɗi. Mu tong ɗi mpwoo dung nǝ, mu leshap kǝ shurep ɗe mo jì kuur ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Mee mat war ɗi mɓut nnen ɗe mo kǝlǝng mun, sǝm war a Lidiya ɗe war a mat Tayatira, ɗe war kǝ seet kǝ leelep ɗe rǝrret mo, kǝzak war a mat ɗe war kǝ seyil nNaan zak. Daa Naan wang pǝtuup war, nǝ le nwar lappwoo ɗe Pool kǝ sat mo. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Aɓwoon ɗe mo cìn baptisma nwar kǝ nenlu war mo jir, ɓǝ war ɗang pǝ mun nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Katɗang wu le, nǝ an a mat ɗe wen shinzeen nDaa azeen-zeen, ɓǝ wu jì ntul fen.&gt;&gt; Nǝ le nwar ɗyiin shi mun, mbǝ dǝm ntul fer nǝ.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Shoot Pool Kǝ Silas Nyil nFilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Par sǝ kaaɗe mun mbǝ dǝm mbǝ ndang Naan ɓǝ mukaat kǝ mee reep ɗe war mat joon, ɗe nii le kǝn nwar naa mbii ɗe mo mbǝ jì a kyeen. War kǝ naa njì kǝ shool ɗes mpuun fer mo, mbǝɗe war kǝ naa mbii ɗe mo mbǝ cìn a kyeen ngurum mo. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>War naa jì nɗang Pool kǝ mun, ɗang war le or nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Nen ɗesǝ mo a kǝrem mǝ Naan Ɗehai, kǝzak mon nkaa sat a ar ɗe mǝ ɓam nwun!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>War naa ncìn a kǝsǝ, mbǝ meeteer mo ɗes, dǝm wul a ɗe nǝ láa mPool mɓut ɗes hakyeng, ɓǝ wur ciir sat nriin ɗebish nǝ nǝnee, &lt;&lt;An pǝ sat nghan nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Jesu Kristi, a put aku mɓut nwar.&gt;&gt; Abet-abet ɓǝ riin ɗebish nǝ put nɗǝǝn war.<verse eid="ACT 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Ɗangɓǝ kaaɗe puun war mo naa ar kat shool mo nǝ duu, ɓǝ mo yaa Pool kǝ Silas, mo dul mo dǝm kǝ nǝ ntoom nen tokɗyeel mo mpeepring. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Kaaɗe mo jì kǝ mo ntoom nentokɗyeel nǝ mo, ɓǝ mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Nen ɗesǝ mo a nnen Yahudi. Moo ring gurum mo nɗǝǝn pee nkaam fun. <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>Mo nkaa kám mbii mo mmun, ɗe baa muu loot cìn mo kas. Mbǝ mǝnǝ, baa mu lap mbii ɗe mon nkaa kám nǝ kas, mbǝɗe mun a nnen Rom mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Yaksǝ ɗuu gurum nǝ mo jir mo yool táa nkaa Pool kǝ Silas. Nen tokɗyeel nǝ mo le kǝ mmo yilang nlǝr mPool kǝ Silas. Ɓǝ mo le kǝ mmo nǝrem mo shi kam. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Kaaɗe mo nǝrem mo ɗes, ɓǝ mo dǝm shoot mo nɗǝǝn lushoot. Mo sat ngutap nen ɗe mo a shishoot nǝ, kǝn nwur tap mo ɗe rǝret. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Kaaɗe gwar nǝ kǝlǝng pwoo nǝ ɓal a kǝsǝ, ɓǝ wur dǝm shoot Pool kǝ Silas nɗǝǝn lushoot ɗe nǝ ndǝǝn-ndǝǝn, ɓǝ wur jwal shii mo mo mɓut nfut.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Nnaar par, ɓǝ Pool kǝ Silas mo nkaa ɗangnaan kǝ kook mǝ kwoop Naan. Nen ɗe mo a shishoot nǝ mo lekom kǝ moo kǝlǝng Pool kǝ Silas ɗe. <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Ɓǝ nnen mman, yil nǝ sǝǝn ɗes hakyeng, yaksǝ kuk lushoot nǝ mo yoon. Abet ɓǝ pwoo lushoot nǝ mo wang, ɓǝ shoolbǝring ɗe mo ɓwoot nen ɗe mo a shishoot nǝ jir mo fwen. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Kaaɗe ngutap nen ɗe mo, a shishoot nǝ mo mii nsaam, ɓǝ wur naa pwoo lushoot nǝ mo a wuwang jir, ɓǝ wur shang kwai fin, mbǝkǝ nwur tu shik ɗe, mbǝɗe wur pan nǝ nnen ɗe mo a shishoot nǝ jir mo, mo kǝ pwat shwe seet jee. <verse eid="ACT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Ɗangɓǝ Pool ɗiyeep ɗoo ɓalɓal nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Taji a le mee láa nsak kas, mbǝɗe mun ɗi jir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Yaksǝ ngutap nen ɗe mo a shishoot nǝ wur pet mo jì kǝ wus, ɓǝ wur yool kǝkǝlak, ɗel taa ntoom Pool kǝ Silas, wur nkaa ɗaar mbǝ kǝǝrmuut. <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Ɓǝ wur put kǝ mo a tool, kǝn nwur sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Daa mo, an cin a miyi, kǝ nghan kat ɓam ɗi yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Mo sat nwur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A shinzeen nDaa Jesu. Ɓǝ gha mbǝ nkat ɓam, waa kǝ nenlu fwaa mo jir.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Mo satpwoo Naan nwur ashak kǝ nenlu fin mo jir. <verse eid="ACT 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Ɓǝ mparmǝnǝ, wur vwang láa mo mo. Yaksǝ abet-abet mo cìn baptisma nwur, ashak kǝ nenlu fin mo jir. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Wur jì kǝ mo ntul fin, kǝn nwur shin mbiise mmo. Pǝtuup wur nǝ gam kǝ retnyit ɗes hakyeng, mbǝɗe wur ashak kǝ nenlu fin mo jir, mo shinzeen nDaa Naan.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Ɓǝ kaaɗe ɓitmang, ɓǝ nenɗyeel nǝ mo lep jepkam mo, mbǝkǝ mmo sat ɗi ngutap nen ɗe mo a shishoot nǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A ɓwet des ɗevǝl sǝ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Yaksǝ ngutap nen ɗe mo a shishoot nǝ sat mPool nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Nenɗyeel mo lep-lep nǝ, mun ɓwet gha kǝ Silas, mbǝkǝ nwun seet mbuu ɗi. Mbǝ mǝnǝ wu put yaksǝ, kǝn nwun seet ɗi ryang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Ɗang Pool sat njepkám nǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Doo mo kǝ nǝrem mun agaak, ɓǝ baa mo kǝ tokɗyeel mmun, mbǝkǝ mmo man ɗi nǝ kyet muu cin mee mbii ɗebish ɗi kas. Mun ɗe mun a nnen Rom mo. Kǝzak doon mo dǝm shoot mun nlushoot zak. Ɗangɓǝ yaksǝ, ɓǝ moo reɓet ceen mun a sǝsok aa? Dǝm wu sat mo jì pwat kǝ mun shikáa fur.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Aasǝ ɓǝ, jepkam nǝ mo baa, ɓǝ mo satpwoo ɗe Pool sat nnentokɗyeel nǝ mo. Kaaɗe nentokɗyeel nǝ mo kǝlǝng nǝ, Pool kǝ Silas mo a nnen Rom mo, ɓǝ kǝǝrmuut yaa mo. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Ɓǝ nentokɗyeel nǝ mo jì ɗang pǝ Pool kǝ Silas, mbǝkǝ mmo fwoo ɗi mmo. Yaksǝ mo tap put kǝ mo nɗǝǝn lushoot nǝ, ɗangɓǝ mo sat mPool kǝ Silas kǝ mmo yit pee nkaam nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Aɓwoon ɗe Pool kǝ Silas mo kǝ pwat nɗǝǝn lushoot nǝ, ɓǝ mo dǝm ntul Lidiya. A pee ɗe mo kat nenseet nɗang Jesu mo ɗe, ɓǝ mo leshap mǝ caa pǝtuup ngurum nǝ mo, ɗang mo yool yit pee nkaam mǝnǝ ɗi.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Nɗǝǝn Yil nTasoloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Pool kǝ Silas mo yaa ar dǝm put Amfipolis kǝ Apoloniya, ɓǝ mo jì wul nTasoloni, a pee ɗe lu Naan mǝ nnen Yahudi mo ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>Ɓǝ Pool ɗel nLu Naan, kaaɗe wur loot kǝ cìn nǝ sǝ. Mbǝ puus Nookɗi mo yitkun, ɓǝ Pool nkaa ɓeetpwoo kǝ gurum nǝ mo nɗǝǝn pwoo Naan. <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>Wur nkaa kámshii mǝ pwoo Naan nǝ mmo, ɗe mo naa nǝ ɗee agaak nǝ, nǝ a tǝng kǝn Kristi shwaajeel, ɗang wur nyool a peemúut zak. Wur sat zak nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Jesu ɗe an kǝn satpwoo nwun nkaa wur sǝ, a wur a Kristi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Pak nnen Yahudi nǝ mo shinzeen mpwoo ɗe Pool sat ɓǝ, nǝ le mmo seet nɗang Pool kǝ Silas. Aasǝ zak, ɓǝ nnen Heleni mo ɗes ɗe mo kǝ kǝǝr Naan, mo shinzeen ashak kǝ pak shurep ɗǝnan-nan mo.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Ɗangɓe nnen Yahudi mo gam kǝ zuur, mbǝɗe gurum mo ɗes mo dǝm nɗang kám mǝ Pool kǝ Silas, ɓǝ mo dǝm pǝrep pak nen ɗebish mo, kǝ jepkut ɗe mo kǝ tong mpwoo lutuk mo, mo kuur mo ashak. Yaksǝ mo yool kǝ or kǝ pwoo ɗebuu koo mo tǝttar sǝ nɗǝǝn pee nkaam nǝ. Ɓǝ mo shwe dǝm ntul Jesen, mo nkaa yap Pool kǝ Silas, mbǝkǝ mmo put ɗi kǝ mo pǝ ɗuu mǝ gurum nǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Ɗang kaaɗe baa mo kat mo kas, ɓǝ mo fee Jesen, kǝ pak nenseet nɗang Jesu mo pwat, ɓǝ mo jì kǝ mo ntoom nen ɗǝnan-nan mǝ pee nkaam nǝ mo. Mo nkaa le or nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Nen ɗesǝ mo, ɗe mo kǝ ciir kǝ yil nǝ shikáa atuum, mo jì mpee ɗesǝ zak. <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>Nǝ le Jesen lap mo le ntul fin! Moo tep a Wàar mǝ Siza, mbǝɗe mon nkaa sat nǝ, mee mishkoom ɗi, ɗe mo kǝ pet wur a Jesu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Kaaɗe gurum nǝ mo kǝ nen ɗǝnan-nan mǝ pee nkaam nǝ mo kǝlǝng pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ nǝ daampee mmo, ɓǝ tuup tu mo zam. <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Yaksǝ nen ɗǝnan-nan mǝ pee nkaam nǝ mo le Jesen kǝ pak nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo kwat shool ɓwet, akuɗang mo ɓwet mo.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Kǝ Silas Nɗǝǝn Yil mBeriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Kaaɗe par cìn, ɓǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu mo sat mPool kǝ Silas, kǝn mmo dǝm nyil mBeriya. Kaaɗe mo dǝm wul mBeriya, ɓǝ mo ɗel nɗǝǝn lu Naan mǝ nnen Yahudi mo. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Nen Yahudi ɗe mon mBeriya, mo kǝ ɗyen met nnen Yahudi ɗe mon nTasoloni, mbǝɗe mo kǝlǝngkar nǝ shi pǝtuup mǝndong rǝret, ɗang mo nkaa bǝlǝp pwoo Naan, shidaar shidaar mbǝkǝ mmo naa ɗi nǝ, kyet pwoo ɗe Pool sat mo azeen aa? <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Nen Yahudi mo ɗes mo shinzeen, kǝ pak nnen Heleni mo ɗes mo shinzeen, daas mo kǝ pak shurep ɗǝnan-nan mo zak.<verse eid="ACT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Ɗangɓǝ kaaɗe nnen Yahudi ɗe mon nTasoloni, mo kǝlǝng nǝ, Pool nkaa sat pwoo Naan nɗǝǝn yil mBeriya. Yaksǝ mo dǝm kar ɗuu mǝ gurum ɗe mon nyil mBeriya nǝ, mbǝkǝ mmo yool kǝ lek nkaa Pool kǝ Silas zak. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Abet, ɓǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu mo lep Pool dǝm mpwoo Am kuur ɗang Silas kǝ Timoti mo pan yém ɗi nyil mBeriya nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Nen ɗe mo dǝm ɓwet Pool, mo seet ndangshak kǝ wur ɓǝ mo dǝm wul Atens. Ɓǝ mo baa nyil mBeriya ashak kǝ lep mǝ Pool pǝ Silas kǝ Timoti nǝ, mo dǝm kat ɗyin kǝkǝlak.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Nɗǝǝn Pee Nkaam Atens</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Kaaɗe Pool nkaa ɗarnaa jì Timoti mpee nkaam Atens nǝ, ɓǝ nǝ daampee nwur zam, mbǝɗe wur naa pee nkaam nǝ gam kǝ kùm mo koo a pee ɗǝɗangyi. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Yaksǝ Pool bǝlǝp shii pwoo Naan nǝ ashak kǝ nnen Yahudi mo, kǝ nnen Heleni ɗe mo kǝ seyil nNaan, nɗǝǝn lu Naan mǝ nnen Yahudi nǝ mo, kǝ wur satpwoo Naan nɗes gurum ɗe mo kǝ jì nɗǝǝn lutuk zak. <verse eid="ACT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Yaksǝ pak nnen Ipikuriyan mo, kǝ nnen Stoyik mo, des ɗesǝ mo a nenman mo. Mo kaat kǝ Pool, ɓǝ mo ɗoom ɓeetshik kǝ wur. Yaksǝ pak mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ngulupwoo buu koo mwen sǝ, kǝ reɓet sat a miyi?&gt;&gt; Ɗang pak mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Muu kǝlǝng koo wur leshap a nkaa mee Naan ɗecì mo sǝ.&gt;&gt; Mo leshap ɗesǝ, a mbǝɗe Pool nkaa satpwoo ɗeret nkaa Jesu, kǝ yool a peemúut zak. <verse eid="ACT 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Mo yaa Pool, ɓǝ mo kàa kǝ wur a peekuur ɗe mo kǝ pet a Ariyopagus, ɓǝ mo sat nwur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Muu reɓet manshii mǝ kám ɗepwoo ɗe gha nkaa leshap nkaa nǝ sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Mbǝɗǝ pak mbii ɗe waa a sat nǝ mo a ɗepwoo pǝ mun ɗi, kǝzak muu reɓet manshii mo nǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>(Nen pee nkaam Atens mo jir, kǝ mǝzep ɗe mo jì tong ɗi, mo kǝ fes reɓet kǝlǝng, kǝ leshap nkaa mbii ɗepwoo mo, ɓǝ mo le nǝ ɗee a koo ɗak sǝ.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Pool yool ɗar a peekuur ɗe moo pet a Ariyopagus nǝ, ɓǝ wur sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wun nnen Atens mo! An pǝ naa wun a nen ɗe wuu seyil nnaan mo ɗes hakyeng. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Mbǝɗǝ kaaɗe an pǝ mwaan nɗǝǝn pee nkaam fuu nǝ, ɓǝ an pǝ naa mbii ɗe wuu seyil mmo shini-shinǝ. Nǝ le nghan kat mee peewus mbiizuum, ɗe mo ran-ran nkaa nǝ nǝnee, &lt;Mbǝ Naan ɗe baa mu man wur kas.&gt; Naan ɗe baa wu man wur kas, ɗe wuu seyil nwur sǝ, an pǝ kǝn leshap nwun a nkaa wur.<verse eid="ACT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>&lt;&lt;Naan ɗewur leyil ɗesǝ, kǝ mbii ɗe mo nɗǝǝn yil nǝ jir. Wur a Daa mǝ ɗeng kǝ yil ɗesǝ, kǝ baa wur kǝ tong a nɗǝǝn lu ɗe gurum mo ɗyik shi sar mbǝ seyil nwur kas. <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>Baa wur kǝ yap mee ɓam pǝ gurum kas koo dǝɓen, mbǝɗe a wur shikáa fin, kǝ shin seen kǝ nook ngurum mo, kǝ mbii mo jir zak. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>A nɗǝǝn gurum mǝndong, ɓǝ Naan le peeput mǝ gurum ɗe mo nɗǝǝn yil nǝ mo shini-shinǝ jir. Wur le kǝ mmo tong nkaa yil nǝ jir. Wur kǝ tap le ɓit nǝ mo, kǝ peekaat mǝ yil fur nǝ mo shini-shinǝ zak. <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>Naan cìn kǝsǝ, a mbǝkǝ ngurum mo yap wur ɗi, meeɓe, mon nyap wur kat, mbǝɗe baa wur jong kǝ mun gurum kas. <verse eid="ACT 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>A mbǝ ɗeɓal mǝ Naan, ɓǝ muu kat seen, kǝ muu mwaan, ɗang mun ɗe zak. Kaaɗe pak nenkook fuu mo kǝ sat sǝ nǝnee, &lt;Mun zak, a jep wur mo.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>Kaaɗe mun a jep mǝ Naan mo sǝ, ɓǝ baa nǝ ret kǝ mmun pan nǝ, mǝse mǝ Naan nǝ a koo mbii ɗe gurum mo kǝ ɗak a shi zinariya, koo azurfa, koo ngǝk, koo mee mbii ɗe gurum mo am shi seen fur kas. <verse eid="ACT 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Gyet yam-yam ɓǝ baa Naan leɗyeen nkaa mwen mǝ gurum nǝ mo kas, ɗang yaksǝ, ɓǝ wur kǝ sat ngurum mo tuwap jir, koo a nɗǝǝn yil ɗǝɗang yi. <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>Mbǝɗǝ Naan lepuus ɗewur mbǝ tokɗyeel ngurum ɗe nɗǝǝn nyil nǝ jir, shi gwar ɗewur kǝ ten bǝlǝp. Naan wur kǝ woo langtǝng mǝnǝ ngurum mo agaak jir, mbǝɗe wur kǝ yool kǝ gwar mǝnǝ a peemúut.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Kaaɗe mo kǝlǝng Pool leshap nkaa yool a peemúut, ɓǝ pak mo shwar wur shi shwar mǝ ɓákpee, ɗang pak mo nǝnee. Muu reɓet kǝn nghan cin a leshap ɗi nkaa mbii ɗesǝ zak. <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Aasǝ ɓǝ Pool yool yit peekuur nǝ ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Pak gurum nǝ mo seet nɗang wur, ɓǝ mo shinzeen. Mɓut nnen ɗe mo shinzeen nǝ, a Diyonisiyus ɗewur a memee mɓut nennan mǝ peekuur ɗe mo kǝ pet nǝ a Ariyopagus, kǝ mee mat ɗe moo petsǝm war a Damaris, kǝ pak gurum mo.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Pool Nɗǝǝn Yil nKoronti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Aɓwoon ɗesǝ, ɓǝ Pool yool yit Atens, ɓǝ wur dǝm nKoronti. <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Ɓe wur kat mee ngu Yahudi, ɗe moo pet sǝm wur a Akila, ɗe mo làa wur a mPontus. Wur kǝ mat fin Priskila mo yool a Itali mo jì nKoronti nǝ. Mbǝɗe mishkoom Klodiyus sat nǝ, nen Yahudi mo jir, mo yool aku nRom. Pool dǝm pǝ mo ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>Ɓe wur tong pǝ mo ɗi, mbǝɗe wur a nguɗak Tent koo mo sǝ, ɗang mo cìn ɗak fur ashak zak. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Koo a parpuus Nookɗi ɗeɗangyii, ɓǝ Pool kǝ naa mɓeetshik kǝ nnen Yahudi mo, kǝ nen Heleni mo mbǝkǝ mo shinzeen ɗi.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Kaaɗe Silas kǝ Timoti mo tong mMasidoniya jì wul, ɓǝ Pool fes lekáa fin kyap, mbǝ satpwoo ɗeret nǝ, ɗang wur ɗee a langtǝng nen Yahudi mo nǝ, Jesu a Kristi. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Ɗangɓǝ kaaɗe nen Yahudi mo ciipwoo nǝ, kǝzak mo leshap ɗebuu nwur, ɓǝ wur ciir kǝɓwoon mmo, ɓǝ wur sat mmo kǝ tuup nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Katɗang wu murep nɗǝǝn shikbish fuu mo, ɓǝ a wun wu lesuk. Baa mee sar fen ɗiɓut kas. Yool nyaksǝ, ɓǝ an mbǝ dǝm a pǝ nen ɗe baa mo a nen Yahudi mo kas.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Wur yool yit lu Naan mǝ nen Yahudi nǝ mo, ɓǝ wur dǝm ɗel ntul mee gwar ɗe mo kǝ petsǝm wur a Titus Jastus. Wur a mee nguseyil nNaan, ɗe lu wur nǝ kus kǝ lu Naan nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Krispus ngwe ɗeɗes nlu Naan nǝ, shinzeen nDaa ashak kǝ nenlu wur mo jir. Kǝzak gurum mo ɗes nɗǝǝn nen Koronti mo, ɗe mo kǝlǝng pwoo Pool nǝ, ɓǝ mo shinzeen, yaksǝ mo cìn baptisma mmo zak.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Parmeeci sǝ mpar, ɓǝ Daa leshap kǝ Pool nɗǝǝn suun nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Taji kǝǝrmuut yaa gha kas, a satpwoo nǝ, kǝzak taji a nook sat nǝ kas. <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/>Mbǝɗǝ an ɗi ashak kǝ gha. Baa mee gurum mmak cìn mee mbii nghan kas. Mbǝɗǝ an ɗi kǝ gurum mo ɗes nɗǝǝn pee nkaam ɗesǝ nǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Aasǝ ɓǝ, Pool tong nɗǝǝn pee nkaam nKoronti, mbǝ ɓit mǝndong kǝ koor, wur nkaa kámpwoo Naan ngurum mo.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Ɗangɓǝ nɗǝǝn ɓit ɗe moo le Galiyo a gofna mǝ yil Akaya, ɓǝ nnen Yahudi mo ɓalkaa ashak, ɓǝ mo yaa Pool dǝm kǝ wur pǝ nentokɗyeel mo ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>Mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Gwar ɗesǝ wur nkaa pǝring kǝ pan mǝ gurum mo, mbǝkǝ mmo seyil ɗi nNaan nɗǝǝn ar ɗe baa nǝ nciit kǝ Wàar nǝ kas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Ɗangɓǝ kaaɗe Pool ɗoom leshap, ɓǝ Galiyo ɗewur a gofna, sat nnen Yahudi nǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wun nnen Yahudi mo! Katɗang ɓǝ ɗe gwar ɗe ɗesǝ wur cìn a mee mbii ɗebish, kǝ koo ɗewur wat a mee mbii, ɓǝ yoo an mmak lekom kǝn nghan nkǝlǝng wun ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>Ɗangɓǝ kaaɗe nǝ a ɓeetshik nkaa pak pwoo mo, kǝ sǝmpwoo, kǝ Wàar fuu mo, ɓǝ wu dǝm wu ɓeet mǝnǝ mbuu shikáa fuu. Baa an mbǝ reɓet ɗee a ngutokɗyeel mǝ mbii koo mǝnǝ mo sǝ kas.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Yaksǝ wur ceen mo shin pwat aku nɗǝǝn luɗyeel nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Mo jir mo yaa Sostenis, ngwe ɗeɗes nkaa lu Naan nǝ, ɓǝ mo nǝrem wur mpwoo luɗyeel nǝ, ɗang baa Galiyo lekáa ɗyikye kas.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Baa Dǝm Antiyok Ɗe Nǝn Nyil nSiriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>Pool waa cin tong ɗi nKoronti nǝ ɗes ashak kǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo. Ɓǝ wur yool yit mo, ɓǝ wur ɗel nɗǝǝn tii mbǝ dǝm nyil nSiriya, ashak kǝ Priskila kǝ mish war Akila. Akuɗang Pool yool seet, ɓǝ wur sak káa fin nSenkiriya, mbǝkǝ nwur gampwoo ɗewur kǝ ten cweer nǝn nNaan nkaa shin fin. <verse eid="ACT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Mo jì wul nɗǝǝn yil Afisus ɓǝ Pool yit Priskila kǝ Akila mpee mǝnǝ. Yaksǝ wur dǝm ɗel nɗǝǝn lu Naan, kǝ wur yakshii mǝ pwoo mo ashak kǝ nnen Yahudi mo. <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Kaaɗe mo ɗang pǝ wur kǝ nwur pan yém ɗe pǝ mo, ɓǝ wur cíi. <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>Ɗangɓe kaaɗe wur yool yit mo, ɓǝ wur cweerpwoo mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Katɗang Naan reɓet, ɓǝ an mbǝ baajì pǝ wun ɗi.&gt;&gt; Aasǝ ɓǝ, wur ɗel nɗǝǝn tii dǝm nAfisus. <verse eid="ACT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>Kaaɗe wur dǝm wul nSizariya, ɓǝ wur kàa nJerusalem, kǝ nwur tok ɗi kǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo. Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ wur dǝm Antiyok. <verse eid="ACT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Aɓwoon ɗewur pan cìn rep teer mo ɗe, ɓǝ wur yool dǝm shipee-shipee, ngaar yil nGalati, kǝ Firijiya, wur nkaa gangkwak mputuup nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo jir.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Apolos Nɗǝǝn Yil Afisus Kǝ Koronti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Mee ngu Yahudi ɗe moo petsǝm wur a Apolos, ɗe mo làa wur a nAlekzandriya, ɓe wur ji Afisus. Wur a mee nguman, ɗang wur man ɓǝǝt-haal mǝ Naan ɗes hakyeng. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>Mo kǝ kám ar ɗe nǝ a mǝ Daa nwur, ɗang wur ɗar ɓalɓal nɗǝǝn nǝ. Wur leshap, ɗang wur kám ngurum mo nkaa Daa Jesu ndǝre-ndǝre, ɗang jir kǝsǝ, ɓe wur man a baptisma mǝ Joon ɓejee ɗak. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>Wur ɗoom kop pwoo Naan agaak, baa ashak kǝ mee kǝǝrmuut kas, nɗǝǝn lu Naan nǝ. Kaaɗe Priskila kǝ Akila mo kǝlǝng wur, ɓǝ mo pet wur dǝm kǝ nǝ ntul fur, kǝn mmo sǝǝt kám ar mǝ Naan ɗi nwur ndǝre-ndǝre. <verse eid="ACT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Apolos yool mbǝ dǝm Akaya, ɓe nenseet nɗang Jesu ɗe mon Afisus mo ɓam wur, shi ran lep a rǝran shin nwur pán nenseet nɗang Jesu ɗe mon nyil Akaya, mbǝkǝ mmo kaat wur ɗi, katɗang wur dǝm wul. Kaaɗe wur dǝm wul, ɓǝ wur ɓam nnen ɗe mo kǝ shinzeen mbǝ ɗeret mǝ Daa zam. <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Wur gan nnen Yahudi mo ntoom kǝ gurum mo, mbǝ ɓeetshik, kǝzak wur kám ngurum mo agaak, wur nkaa leshap mmo nkaa mbii ɗe mo nɗǝǝn pwoo Naan nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Jesu wur a Kristi azeen-zeen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Pool Nyil Afisus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Kaaɗe Apolos ɗi nɗǝǝn Koronti, ɓǝ Pool nkaa mwaan nɗǝǝn yil mo, ɓǝ wur jì wul Afisus. Yaksǝ wur jì kat pak nenseet nɗang Jesu mo ɗi mpee nkaam mǝnǝ. <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>Ɓǝ wur tal pǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Kaaɗe dǝ wu shinzeen, ɓǝ wuu lap Riin Ɗeɓang ee?&gt;&gt; Mo lap nwur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Hai, baa muu cam kǝlǝng mee pwoo nkaa Riin Ɗeɓang kas.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>Wur tal pǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ dǝ mo cìn a baptisma ɗǝɗang nwun yii?&gt;&gt; Mo lap nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A baptisma mǝ Joon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>Pool sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Baptisma mǝ Joon nǝ a mbǝ nen ɗe mo kǝ tuwap. Gyet Joon sat nnen Yahudi mo shinzeen a ngwe ɗewur mbǝ jì mɓwoon fin. A Jesu mmǝnǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Kaaɗe mo kǝlǝng pwoo ɗesǝ, ɓǝ mo cìn baptisma mmo nɗǝǝn sǝm kǝ Daa Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Pool lesar fin nkaa mo, ɓǝ Riin Ɗeɓang sham nkaa mo, ɓǝ mo leshap shi liispwoo ɗecì mo, ɗang mo satpwoo Naan ngurum mo. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Nen ɗe mo lap baptisma nǝ, mo wul kaapaat baavǝl.<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Pool wur ɗel nɗǝǝn lu Naan, mbǝ tar mo kun, ɓǝ wur leshap nǝ, baa ashak kǝ kǝǝrmuut kas, kǝzak wur cìn ɓeetshik kǝ mo, ɗang wur ɗaar mbǝkǝ nwur kám ɗe mmo agaak nkaa mulki mǝ Naan. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Ɗangɓǝ pak mo cǝǝr ɓal mputuup, kǝ mmo cii shinzeen, ɓǝ mo leshap ɗebuu nkaa pwoo mǝ Naan ntoom gurum mo jir. Aasǝ ɓǝ, Pool yit mo ɗe, ɓǝ wur pǝrep nen shinzeen nǝ mo shin jì ashak. Ɓǝ koo a puus ɗeɗangyii, ɓǝ wur yakshii kǝ pwoo mo nɗǝǝn lu kam-kam ɗe mǝ Tairanus. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Moo naa ncìn a kǝsǝ dǝm wul mbǝ ɓit vǝl. Aasǝ ɓǝ, nen ɗe mo kǝ tong nɗǝǝn yil Eshiya, nen Yahudi mo, kǝ nnen ɗe baa mo a nen Yahudi mo kas, mo jir mo kǝlǝng pwoo kǝ Naan.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jep Skiiva Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Naan le kǝ Pool cìn mbii lukshik mo ɗes, ɗe baa mo kǝ cam naa mo kas. <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>Nǝ le har mmo lap lee ɗewur kǝ pwes wun ɗishik, kǝ nlǝr ɗewur kǝ lep mo, kǝ mo dǝm tung nengok mo ɗishik, ɓǝ mo kat bar nɗǝǝn shwal mo mo shini-shini, kǝzak riin ɗebish mo pwat mɓut ngurum mo ɗes zak.<verse eid="ACT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Ɗangɓǝ mee des mo ɗi mɓut nnen Yahudi mo, ɗe moo mwaan dǝm shiyil-shiyil, kǝn mmo kǝ ceen riin ɗebish mo ɗi. Mo ɗoom leshap nnen ɗe mo kǝ riin ɗebish mo nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Jesu, ɓǝ mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Jesu ɗe Pool kǝ leshap nkaa wur sǝ, ɓǝ an nsat ngha, a put aku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Mee ɗyemnǝǝnshak mo ɗi pwoovǝl, ɗe mo a jep mee pris ɗeɗes mǝ nnen Yahudi mo, ɗi sǝm wur a Skiiva. A mo a nnen cìn mǝnǝ. <verse eid="ACT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Riin ɗebish nǝ lap mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wen man Jesu, kǝ wen mman Pool zak, ɗang wun a wii mo yii?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Ɓǝ gwar ɗewur kǝ riin ɗebish nǝ, wur yool met nkaa mo, ɓǝ wur met mmo mɓal jir mo. Wur nas mo, ɗang wur le láa mmo, ɓǝ wur yilang nlǝr mmo, ɓǝ mo yool shwe pwat nɗǝǝn lu nǝ ngúm, ɓǝ toom kǝ sham mmo. <verse eid="ACT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Kaaɗe mbii ɗesǝ nǝ ɗee a ɗemǝman pǝ nnen Yahudi mo, kǝ nnen Heleni mo ɗe mo kǝ tong nɗǝǝn yil Afisus, ɓǝ kǝǝrmuut yaa mo jir, ɓǝ gurum mo le ɗeɗes nsǝm kǝ Daa Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Gurum mo ɗes mɓut nnen ɗe mo shinzeen, mo jì woo shikbish mo mo, kǝ ɗak mo ɗebish mo agaak zak. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Pak gurum mo ɗes mɓut nnen ɗe moo cìn yen ɗebish mǝ gwampee mo, mo kok ɓǝǝt-haal mǝ yen mo nǝ mo, kǝn mmo jì fwoo mo nwus ntoom gurum nǝ mo jir. Kaaɗe mo tang shool mǝ ɓǝǝt-haal ɗe mo fwo nwus nǝ mo, ɓǝ mo kat shool azurfa mo wul ngal laarpaat. <verse eid="ACT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Aasǝ ɓǝ, pwoo mǝ Daa nǝ mwaan shipee-shipee jir, nǝ le nǝ ɓal hakyeng.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Demetriyus Yool Kǝ Pwoo Ɗebish Nkaa Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Aɓwoon ɗe mbii ɗesǝ mo kǝ cìn, ɓǝ Pool naa nǝ ret nǝ, kǝ nɗyin dǝm nJerusalem, ɓǝ ɗyin mbǝ yaa ar nǝ dǝm put a mMasidoniya kǝ Akaya. Ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Aɓwoon ɗe an ndǝm wul nJerusalem, ɓǝ nǝ atǝng an mbǝ ndǝm nyil nRom zak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Pool lep Timoti kǝ Erastus ɗe mo a nenɓam wur mo, kǝ mmo dǝm mMasidoniya akyeen wur, ɗang wur shikáa fin, wur mpan yém ɗi lee nɗǝǝn yil Eshiya nǝ.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Nciit kǝ mǝnǝ, ɓǝ gurum mo yool kǝ pwoo ɗebish ɗe nǝ daampee zam nkaa pwoo Naan nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Mee ngukǝlem, ɗewur kǝ ɗak mbii mo shi azurfa, ɗe moo pet sǝm wur a Demetriyus. Wur naa nkǝlem pak jep kùm mo, shi azurfa ɗe mo lapshak kǝ war kùm Atemis ɗeɗes nǝ, ɓǝ ɗak ɗesǝ nii jì kǝ shool nnenkǝlem nǝ mo zam. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Demetriyus pǝrep nenkǝlem nǝ mo jì ashak jir, kǝ nen ɗe ɗak mo nǝ mo, a koo mǝ nenkǝlem nǝ mo sǝ zak. Yaksǝ wur sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Daa mo! Wu man nǝ, mmun muu kat shool ɗes a nɗǝǝn ɗak fun ɗesǝ. <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Yaksǝ wun shikáa fuu, ɓǝ wu naa, kǝ wuu kǝlǝng mbii ɗe gwar ɗe moo pet wur a Pool sǝ wur kǝ cìn. Wur sat nǝ, naan ɗe gurum mo kǝ ɗak mo a shi sar, ɓǝ baa mo a naan kas koo lee lee, ɗang wur ciir kǝ pǝtuup gurum mo ɗes nɗǝǝn pee nkaam Afisus, kǝ yil ɗe mo ngaar Eshiya jir. Nǝ, taji mo seet kùm nǝ mo kas. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Wu naa zak, yaksǝ baa ɗak fun nǝ kutɗi kǝ mee sǝm ɗeret kas. Baa a ɗak fun nǝ ɓejee ɗak kas, kǝ Atemis ɗeɗes, war mbǝ ɗee a mbii shwar ngurum mo, kǝ naan nǝ war shikáa fer zak. Gurum ɗe mo ngaar yil Eshiya, kǝ yil sǝ jir, mo kǝ seyil a nwar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Kaaɗe mo kǝlǝng pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ nǝ láa mmo mɓut zam, mo le or pwoo mǝndong, mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Atemis mǝ Afisus war a ɗeɗes!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Gurum ɗe mo nɗǝǝn pee nkaam nǝ, mo jir mo lap or nǝ zak. Gurum nǝ mo dǝm yaa Gayus kǝ Aristakus ɗe mo a nen Masidoniya mo, kǝ ɗe mo a shaar mwaan mǝ Pool, ɓǝ mo dǝm kǝ mo kǝkǝlak a peekuur. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Pool reɓet dǝm ɗar akyeen gurum nǝ mo, ɓǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu mo cíi nwur. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>Pak nen ɗenan-nan ɗe nyil Eshiya mo, ɗe mo a shaar Pool. Mo lep shindǝm nwur nǝ, taji wur dǝm ɗi a peekuur nǝ kas. <verse eid="ACT 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Gurum nǝ mo le or a peekuur nǝ jir, mon nkaa sat mbii mo shini-shini, mbǝɗe ɗes mǝ gurum nǝ mo, baa mo man mbii ɗe nǝ le kǝ mo kuur ashak kas. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Nen Yahudi mo le kǝn Alekzanda dǝm ɗar akyeen mǝ gurum nǝ mo, ɓǝ wur ɗiyeep sar, mbǝkǝ ngurum nǝ mo ɗok ɗi tǝtǝk, mbǝɗe wur kǝ reɓet leshap ngurum nǝ mo nǝ, baa ɗyin kǝ nen fin mo, ɗuu cìn mee mbii ɗebish kas. Mbǝɗǝ kaaɗe gurum nǝ mo naa Alekzanda kǝ ɗar akyeen, ɓǝ mo pan nǝ, a wur kǝ mbii nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Kǝzak kaaɗe mo naa nǝ, wur a ngu Yahudi, ɓǝ mo sǝǝt le or pwoo mǝndong jir, mbǝ awa vǝl. Mo nkaa sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Atemis, kǝ nǝ Afisus mo, war a ɗeɗes!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Kaaɗe nguran mǝ pee nkaam nǝ wur le kǝ ngurum mo ɗok tǝtǝk, ɓǝ wur sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wun nen Afisus mo! A wii nook man nǝ, a wun a nnen ɗe wun pǝ tap kǝ lu kùm mǝ Atemis ɗeɗes nɗǝǝn Afisus kas yii? Kǝzak nghǝk ɗe gyet nǝ tong aɗeng sham taa mpee ɗesǝ kas yii? <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Baa mee gurum mak cíipwoo mǝ mbii ɗesǝ mo kas. Mbǝ mǝnǝ ɓǝ nǝ ret kǝ nwun tong coot, taji wu cìn mee mbii kǝkǝlak kǝsǝ kas. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Wun wu jì kǝ nen ɗesǝ mo mpee ɗesǝ, ɓǝ baa mo kǝ cìn mee wat nɗǝǝn lu kùm fuu nǝ mo kas, kǝ baa mo sat mee pwoo ɗebish nkaa naan fuu ɗeɗes war kas zak. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Katɗang Demetriyus ashak kǝ nniyee fin mo, mo kǝ mee pwoo nkaa mee gurum, ɓǝ mo dǝm kǝ pwoo nǝ nluɗyeel mpee ɗe nenɗyeel mo ɗi, mbǝkǝ mmo ɓeetpwoo nǝ ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Ɗangɓǝ kat wun pǝ tang a mee mbii ɗecì, ɓǝ wu ɓeetpwoo mǝnǝ a peekuur kǝ nenyil nǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Azeen-zeen mun mbǝ teer ɗiɓut katɗang mo dǝm kǝ mun nluɗyeel mbǝ or ɗǝ cicinsǝ, mbǝɗe baa mun manshii mǝ mbii ɗe wun pǝ ɗyeep or nkaa nǝ kas, kǝzak, baa kuur fuu nǝ kǝ mee koop nǝ kas.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41"/>Aɓwoon ɗewur kǝ leshap mǝnǝ, ɓǝ wur sat ngurum nǝ mo dǝm ntul mo.<verse eid="ACT 19:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Pool Baa Dǝm mMasidoniya Kǝ Gris</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Aɓwoon ɗe or nǝ kyes, ɓǝ Pool pǝrep nenseet nɗang Jesu mo, ɓǝ wur leshap kǝ mo, mbǝ shínɓal mmo mputuup, ɓǝ wur sat ɗang mukaat mmo, ɓǝ wur yool dǝm mMasidoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>Wur mwaan dǝm ngaar nyil mǝnǝ mo jir, wur nkaa caa pǝtuup ngurum nǝ mo, ɓǝ wur jì wul nyil nGris. <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>A mpee ɗewur cìn tar kun ɗi. Nen Yahudi mo ɓalpwoo mo ashak nkaa wur, ɓǝ kaaɗe wur mbǝ ɗel nɗǝǝn tii mbǝ dǝm nyil nSiriya, ɓǝ wur waa yaa ar nǝ a mMasidoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Ɓǝ Sopata làa Pires ngu Beriya, dǝm nɗang Pool kǝ Aristakus kǝ Sekundus, ɗe mo a nnen Tasoloni mo, kǝ Gayus ngu Debi, kǝ Timoti, kǝ Tikikus, kǝ Trofimus ɗe mo a nen Eshiya mo. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Nen ɗesǝ mo shee dǝm wul nTrowas mmun akyeen, kǝn mmo ɗar naa jì fun a mpee nkaam mǝnǝ. <verse eid="ACT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Mun mu ɗel nɗǝǝn tii nFilipi, aɓwoon retnyit mǝ se gǝǝl aas ɗe baa nǝ kǝ yist kas. Ɓǝ nɗǝǝn teer mo paat, ɓǝ mu dǝm mu wul pǝ mo ɗe nTrowas nǝ. Mun cìn teer pwoovǝl ɗi mpee mǝnǝ.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Yool Kǝ Yutikus A Peemúut nTrowas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Parpuus ɗenshee mɓut nteer ɗepwoovǝl, ɓǝ mu kuur ashak mbǝ se Tong Ashak. Pool kǝ ɗak shin, mbǝkǝ daar wur yool mwaan ɗi, ɓǝ wur leshap ngurum mo. Wur naa a nleshap nǝ ɗak, dǝm wul nnaar mpar. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Mo lewus naapee mo ɗi ɗes nɗǝǝn luɗeng ɗe muu kuur ɗe nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Mee zǝlang ɗe mo kǝ pet sǝm wur a Yutikus kǝ tong mpwoo fung mǝ luɗeng nǝ, ɓǝ kaaɗe Pool naa an satpwoo Naan nǝ ɗak, ɓǝ saam ɗoom yaa Yutikus, ɓǝ saam nǝ jì met nwur mɓal, ɓǝ wur yool mpwoo fung mǝ luɗeng ɗekun nǝ, sham taa nyil, kaaɗe mo sham mang wur, ɓǝ mo kat wur kǝ muut. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Yaksǝ Pool sham zan shik fin nkaa kúm mǝ zǝlang nǝ, ɓǝ wur kup kúm nǝ, ɓǝ wur sat ngurum nǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Taji nǝ daampee nwun kas, mbǝɗe wur ɗe kǝ seen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Ɓǝ Pool baakàa ɗi nluɗeng nǝ, wur tep gǝǝl aas se. Aɓwoon ɗewur kǝ leshap kǝ mo har ɓit mang, ɓǝ wur yool seet. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Mo dǝm kǝ ɗyem zǝlang nǝn ntul kǝ seen, ɓǝ mo kat retnyit ɗes hakyeng.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Pool sat mmun nǝ, ɗyin pǝ reɓet dǝm Asos a nshii, mbǝmǝnǝ ɓǝ mun mu dǝm mu ɗel nɗǝǝn tii dǝm mu wul Asos nwur akyeen, a pee ɗe mu mang wur ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>Kaaɗe wur jì kat mun Asos, ɓǝ mu mang wur nɗǝǝn tii nǝ, kǝ mu dǝm mMitilini. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Mu yool mMitilini nǝ, ɓǝ ɗaar nǝ mu dǝm mu wul kus kǝ yil nKiyos. Daar nǝ zak, ɓǝ mu jì mu wul ngaar Samos, kǝ daar nǝ zak, ɓǝ mu jì mMiletus. <verse eid="ACT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Pool leɗyeen mbǝ ɗel dǝm Afisus nɗǝǝn tii nǝ, mbǝkǝ taji wur waa taa ɗee nɗǝǝn yil Eshiya kas, mbǝɗe wur reɓet wurung, mbǝkǝ kat nǝ mak cìn, ɓǝ wur wul ɗi nJerusalem parpuus Pentikos.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Leshap Kǝ Eklesiya Ɗe Afisus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>Kaaɗe Pool wul mMiletus, ɓǝ wur lep shindǝm nen ɗenan-nan mǝ Eklesiya ɗe Afisus mo, nǝ mo jì kat nɗyin ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Ɓǝ kaaɗe mo jì wul pǝ wur ɗi, ɓǝ wur leshap mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wun shikáa fuu, wu man tong fen nnaar fuu peedǝ ɗi an nshee jì ɗi ngaar nyil Eshiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Gyet ncìn ɗak mǝ Daa nǝ, baa a shi mee ɗiyeepkáa kas, kǝzak an kǝ shwaajeel ɗes mbǝ cìn ɗak nǝ shiɓit shiɓit, kǝ mbǝ gwak ɗe dǝ nen Yahudi mo ɓwet mbǝ an. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Wun shikáa fuu wu man zak nǝ, baa gyet nsak shii mbǝ sat mee mbii ɗe nǝ kǝkoop nwun pǝ wun ɗi kas. An mbǝ kámpwoo nkaa Jesu nwun jir agaak, kǝ an kǝ dǝm nkámpwoo nǝ nwun shilu-shilu zak. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Gyet wen kǝn sat zeen nnen Yahudi mo, kǝ nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas, ɓalɓal nǝ, nǝ ret kǝ mmo tuwap jir, kǝ mo jì pǝ Naan ɗi, kǝ mmon shinzeen ɗe nDaa fun Jesu Kristi zak. <verse eid="ACT 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>Yaksǝ, wu naa an mbǝ dǝm nJerusalem, mbǝɗe a Riin Ɗeɓang lep an shindǝm, ɗang baa wen man mbii ɗe nǝn ndǝm kat an ɗi mpee mǝnǝ kas. <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Ɗangɓǝ Riin Ɗeɓang kǝ kám nghan nǝ jir nɗǝǝn pee nkaam ɗeɗangyii, kǝ jeel pǝ ɗarnaa an, ɓǝ gurum mon yaa an shoot zak. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/>Baa wen lesen fen nǝ kǝ mee koop nǝ pǝ an ɗi kas, ɗang an kǝn reɓet kǝ nghan kyes a ɗak ɗe Daa Jesu kǝ shin nghan mbǝ cìn nǝ. Ɗak ɗewur shin nǝ nghan nɗesǝ, kǝ nghan leshap ɗeret ɗi ngurum mo nkaa zuum mǝ Naan.<verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>&lt;&lt;Yaksǝ wen man nǝ, baa memee nɗǝǝn wun, ɗe gyet an kǝn mwaan nnaar fuu, mbǝ leshap nwun nkaa yil mishkoom mǝ Naan nǝ, wun baa wu naa an ɗi kas. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ, wen kǝn sat nwun cicinsǝ nǝ, katɗang ɓǝ memee fuu muut mɓut shikbish, ɓǝ sar fen mo paat. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Mbǝɗǝ baa gyet wen nsak shii mbǝ sat pan mǝ Naan mo jir nwun kas. <verse eid="ACT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ, wun nen ɗe Riin mǝ Naan kǝ le a nennaa kuur mǝ tǝm nǝ mo jir, wu tap kǝ káa fuu mo rǝret, kǝn nwun kyeer Eklesiya mǝ Naan ɗewur kǝ seet nshin shi toom mǝ káa fin. <verse eid="ACT 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Wen man nǝ, aɓwoon ɗe wen kǝn seet, ɓǝ ncuwe ɗeɓyaal mo, mon njì ɗel nnaar fuu, ɓǝ baa mon nyit tǝm nǝ mo ɗe kas. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Pee nǝ pǝ jì, ɓǝ pak gurum mon nyool nnaar fuu, mo mbǝ sat pwoo ɗe mo a ɗung nkaa zeen nǝ, mbǝkǝ mmo dul nenseet nɗang Jesu mo dǝm ɗi nɗang mo. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ, ɓǝ wu tong shi gongpee, taji wu munsuk kas nǝ, gyet mbǝ ɓit mo kun, ɓǝ baa wen nook leshap nǝ nwun mpar kǝ puus ɓalɓal, kǝ yitmwaa kas.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>&lt;&lt;Yaksǝ, ɓǝ wen le wun nsar Naan, kǝ pwoo ɗeret wur ɗe nǝ kǝ ɓal mbǝ ɗyik wun, mbǝkǝ nǝ shin ɗeret mǝ Naan, ɗi wur kǝ nǝ mbǝ nnen wur mo jir nwun zak. <verse eid="ACT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>Baa wen kǝn coor mee azurfa, koo zinariya, koo nlǝr mǝ mee gurum kas. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Wun shikáa fuu wu man nǝ, a shi sar fen ɗesǝ mo, ɓǝ an kǝn cìn ɗak shi mo, mbǝ mbii ɗe an kǝn reɓet mo, kǝ mbǝ mbii ɗe nnen ɗe mo ashak kǝ an mo kǝ reɓet zak. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>An kǝn nkám nwun nɗǝǝn mbii mo jir, nǝ, a shi ɗak mǝ káa fuu mo, ɗang wun ɓam nen ɗe baa mo katɓal kas, kaaɗe muu panpwoo ɗe Daa Jesu kǝ sat shikáa fin sǝ nǝnee, &lt;Kat gurum shin mbii, ɓǝ wur nkat ɗeret met ngwe ɗewur lap nǝ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Aɓwoon ɗe Pool sat pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ wur kurum nkaa furum ashak kǝ mo jir, kǝn nwur ɗangnaan ɗi <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Kaaɗe mo ɗoom sat ɗang mukaat mPool, ɓǝ mon nkaa wal, ɗang mo kǝ jì lesar nwur ntook, kǝ mo kǝ tung wur shi mishpwoo zak. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>Mbii ɗe nǝ sǝǝt wàt pǝtuup mmo met jir, nǝ aapwoo ɗe Pool sat mmo nǝ, baa mon nkutɗi mbǝ naa yit fin kas. Mo dǝm ɓwet wur mpwoo tii.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Pool Pǝ Kàa nJerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Aɓwoon ɗe muu sat ɗang mukaat mmo, ɓǝ mu ɗel nɗǝǝn tii ɓǝ mu yaa ar wur-wur mu dǝm nyil nKos. Daar nǝ, ɓǝ mu dǝm mu wul nRodes. Mu yool mpeemǝnǝ, ɓǝ mu dǝm mPatara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Kaaɗe mu kat mee tii ɗe nǝ mbǝ canɗel mFonisha, ɓǝ mu ɗel nɗǝǝn nǝ, ɓǝ mu yool. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Kaaɗe mu naa yil nSaiprus kǝ ɗee, ɓǝ mu yit nǝ nsarkul, mu ɗel mǝ dǝm akyeen nyil nSiriya. Mu dǝm mu sham mpee nkaam nTaya, mbǝɗe tii nǝn nsham kǝ lee mo a mpee mǝnǝ. <verse eid="ACT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Kaaɗe mu katpee ɗe pak nenseet nɗang Jesu mo ɗe, ɓǝ mo sat mPool nǝ, taji wur dǝm nJerusalem kas. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Ɗangɓǝ kaaɗe puus seet fun nǝ jì wul, ɓǝ mu yool mǝ sekyeen kǝ mwaan fun. Ɓǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo ashak kǝ shurep fur mo, kǝ jep fur mo, mo dǝm nɗang mun mɓwoon pee nkaam nǝ, a pee ɗe mǝ kurum nkaa furum mbǝ ɗangnaan ɗi ashak kǝ mo mpwoo am kuur nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>Aɓwoon ɗe mu sat ɗang mukaat nshak, ɓǝ mmun mu ɗel nɗǝǝn tii nǝ, ɓǝ mo baa ntul. <verse eid="ACT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Yaksǝ mmun mu sekyeen kǝ mwaan fun. Mu yool nTaya, ɓǝ mu jì mǝ wul mPolemayas. Ɓǝ mu dǝm mu tok kǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu mo mpeemǝnǝ, ɓǝ mu tong ashak kǝ mo, mu teer mǝndong. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/>Daar nǝ, ɓǝ mu yool, mu dǝm mu wul nSizariya, ɓǝ mu tong ntul Filip ngusat pwoo Naan ɗewur a memee mɓut nnen ɗepwoovǝl sǝ mo, ɗe gyet mo bǝlǝp mo nJerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Filip kǝ jiraap mo feer, ɗe baa mo kǝ yool ɗyik kas. Jiraap ɗesǝ nǝ mo kǝ leshap nkaa mbii ɗe nǝ mbǝ jì. <verse eid="ACT 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Kaaɗe mu pan mu yém ɗe, mbǝ meeteer mo ruk, ɓǝ mee ngusatpwoo mǝ Naan ɗi sǝm wur a Agabus, wur kǝ tong nJudiya jì ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Kaaɗe wur jì pǝ mun ɗi, ɓǝ wur mang zaal ɗe Pool kǝ ɗyiin mɓwoon, ɓǝ wur ɓwoot sar kǝ shii fin mo ɗishik. Ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Riin Ɗeɓang sat nǝ, nnen Yahudi ɗe mon nJerusalem, mon ndǝm ɓwoot ngu zaal ɗesǝ nǝ a kǝsǝ zak, kǝn mmo shin wur nsar mǝ nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Kaaɗe mu kǝlǝng pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mmun kǝ koor nǝ mo, mu ɗang pǝ Pool mbǝkǝ taji wur dǝm nJerusalem kas. <verse eid="ACT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Ɗangɓǝ Pool lap nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A mii le ɗang wun pǝ wal, kǝn nwun wàt pǝtuup fen ɗi yii? Yaksǝ wen kǝn ɗak sen, baa a mbǝkǝ mmo ɓuɓwoot an ɗi ɓejee ɗak kas, koo a mbǝkǝ nghan muut ɗi nɗǝǝn yil nJerusalem zak, mbǝ sǝm mǝ Daa Jesu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Kaaɗe baa mu mak daam wur kas, ɓǝ mu nook, ɗang mu sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗee a mbii ɗe Daa Naan naa kǝ gha ɗak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Aɓwoon rep meeteer mo, ɓǝ mu ɓwoot lee fun mo, kǝ mmun kàa ɗi nJerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Pak nen Jesu ɗe mon nSizariya mo jì nɗang mun, ɗe mo jì wul kǝ mun ntul Mason, a mpee ɗe mǝ tong ɗi. Wur a ngu Saiprus, ɗang wur a memee mɓut nenseet nɗang Jesu ɗenshee mo.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Kaaɗe mu jì mu wul nJerusalem, ɓǝ nenseet nɗang Jesu mo kaat mun shi retnyit. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Daar nǝ, ɓǝ Pool dǝm kǝ mun pǝ Jemis ɗi, a pee ɗe nennan mǝ Eklesiya mo ɗe ashak jir. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Aɓwoon ɗe Pool kǝ tok kǝ mo, ɓǝ wur yaa yakshii nǝ mmo ɓang-ɓang, mbii ɗe Naan le kǝn nwur cìn mo nɗǝǝn nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas.<verse eid="ACT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Aɓwoon ɗe mo kǝlǝng pwoo nkaa mbii mǝnǝ mo, ɓǝ mo kwoop Naan hakyeng. Ɓǝ mo sat mPool nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗyemnǝǝn fun, a naa nnen Yahudi mo ɗes hakyeng mo kǝ ɗee a nen shinzeen mo, ɗang mo fes le pǝtuup fur mo nkaa Wàar mǝ Mosis. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Mo kǝ kǝlǝng pwoo nkaa gha nǝnee, &lt;Waa a kám nnen Yahudi mo jir, ɗe mo kǝ tong mɓut nnen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas, nǝ, mo yit Wàar Mosis mo, ɗang nǝ taji mo can jep fur mo kas, kǝzak nǝ taji mo tap kǝ mbii ɗe puun fun mo kǝ loot kǝ cìn mo kas.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Ɓǝ, yaksǝ, ɓǝ gha arang yaksǝ yii? A lekom kǝn nghan kǝlǝng mbii ɗe mun nsat, ɗe nǝ ret kǝ nghan cìn. Mbǝɗǝ tǝng mon nkǝlǝng nǝ, aa jì. <verse eid="ACT 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/>A mbii ɗe muu reɓet kǝ nghan cìn nɗesǝ. Mun kǝ gurum mo feer, ɗe mo kǝ cweerpwoo nDaa Naan nkaa káa fur. <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>A dǝm ashak kǝ mo, kǝn nwun cìn mbii ɗe wun nlesuk ɗee ɗi a ɗeɓang nyit mǝ Naan. A gha nkwat shool mbǝ mbii ɗe mon ncìn jir. Ɓǝ mon mmak sak shweepkáa fur mo zak. A nɗǝǝn ar ɗesǝ, ɓǝ jir mo mman nǝ, baa mee zeen mɓut pwoo ɗe mo kǝ sat nkaa gha nǝ kas, mbǝɗe gha shikáa fwaa aa tap kǝ Wàar mǝ Mosis nǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/>Mbǝ nnen ɗe mo shinzeen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas, ɓǝ mu ten mulep a rǝran mmo, nkaa pwoo ɗe gyet mu yool mu ɗar nkaa nǝ, nǝ, taji mo se mee mbiise ɗe mo kǝ ten shin nkùm kas, kǝ taji mo se toom kas, kǝzak taji mo se long ɗe mo miyoor took nnǝ kas, kǝ taji mo cin ngaa kas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Daar nǝ, ɓǝ Pool seet ashak kǝ des ɗefeer nǝ mo, kǝ mmo cìn mbii ɗe mon nlesut ɗee ɗi a ɗeɓang nyit mǝ Naan. Yaksǝ wur ɗel nɗǝǝn Lu Naan Ɗeɗes nǝ, mbǝkǝ nwur sat ɗi ngurum mo, puus ɗe mon nlesut ɗee a ɗeɓang nǝn nkyes ɗi, parpuus ɗe koo a wii, ɓǝ wur nshin mbiizuum mbǝ shik.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Yaa Pool Nɗǝǝn Lu Naan Ɗeɗes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Kaaɗe teer ɗepwoovǝl nǝ mo kus kǝgam, ɓǝ pak nnen Yahudi ɗe mo kǝ tong Eshiya mo jì naa Pool nɗǝǝn Lu Naan ɗeɗes, ɓǝ mo kar, kǝzak mo lepshii nkuur mǝ gurum nǝ mo jir, ɓǝ mo yaa Pool. <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>Moo le or, ɓǝ mon nkaa sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wun nnen Isreil mo, wu ɓam mun! Wu naa gwar ɗe dǝ wur dǝm shipee-shipee nɗǝǝn yil nǝ mo, mbǝkǝ nwur kám ngurum mo, kǝn mmo ɓák mun nnen Isreil mo ɗe, kǝ Wàar mǝ Mosis mo, kǝ Lu Naan ɗeɗes sǝ zak. Baa a mǝnǝ ɓejee ɗak kas, wur kǝ ɗel kǝ pak nnen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas nɗǝǝn Lu Naan ɗeɗes zak. Wur kǝ le Lu Naan ɗeɗes nǝ ɗee a ɗebuu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/>Mo leshap ɗesǝ, a mbǝɗe mo kǝ naa Trofimus ngu Afisus ashak kǝ wur nɗǝǝn pee nkaam, ɓǝ mo pan nǝ, ntong a Pool kǝ jì kǝ wur nɗǝǝn Lu Naan ɗeɗes nǝ.<verse eid="ACT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Ɓǝ nen pee nkaam nǝ mo yool jir, gurum nǝ mo shwe jì kuur ashak abet, koo a nkoop pee ɗeɗangyii, mo yaa Pool, ɓǝ mo fee wur put mɓwoon Lu Naan ɗeɗes nǝ, ɓǝ mo shoot pwoolu nǝ mo abet-abet. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Kaaɗe mo nkaa tangpee tu Pool, ɓǝ ngwe ɗeɗes mǝ shiitoon mǝ nnen Rom mo, kǝlǝng nǝ, Jerusalem nǝ gam kǝ or ɗes zam. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Abet-abet ɓǝ wur pǝrep shiitoon mo, kǝ pak ɗǝnan-nan mǝ shiitoon nǝ mo, ɓǝ mo shwe dǝm pǝ nen ɗe mo yaa Pool ɗi. Kaaɗe mo naa ngwe ɗeɗes nǝ kǝ shiitoon mo, ɓǝ mo nook nǝrem Pool. <verse eid="ACT 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Yaksǝ ngwe ɗeɗes nǝ jì kus kǝ Pool, ɓǝ wur yaa Pool, wur le kǝ mmo ɓwoot Pool shi shoolbǝring mo vǝl. Wur tal nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Gwar ɗesǝ wur a wii? Kǝzak wur cìn a mii?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Yaksǝ kuur mǝ gurum nǝ mo le or. Pak mo nkaa sat mee mbii, ɗang pak mo nkaa sat mee mbii ɗecì mo zak. Kaaɗe baa ngwe ɗeɗes nǝ wur mak manshii mǝ mbii ɗe nǝ le kǝn ngurum nǝ mo kǝ ɗyeep ɗoo ɗes kas, ɓǝ wur le kǝ mmo dǝm kǝ wur mpeetong mǝ shiitoon mo. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Kaaɗe mo jì wul a pee kǝkàa mpwoo lu nǝ, ɓǝ shiitoon mo mang wur ɗiyeep aɗeng mbǝɗe kuur mǝ gurum nǝ mo ɗee a koo nentar mo sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>Mo nkaa ɗiyeep ɗoo ɓǝ, mo nkaa sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wu tu wur, wu tu wur!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Leshap Gurum Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Kaaɗe mo nkaa ɗel kǝ Pool nɗǝǝn peetong mǝ shiitoon nǝ mo, ɓǝ wur sat ngwe ɗeɗes mǝ shiitoon nǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Kyet a mmak yit nghan nsat mee mbii ɗi nghan wo?&gt;&gt; Ngu taakyeen nǝ tal pǝ wur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A man pwoo mǝ nnen Heleni mo ee? <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Tan! Baa a gha a ngu Ijip ɗe gyet nɗǝǝn meeteer ɗeɗel sǝ mo, ɓǝ wur ɓwetɓeer nkaa gwomnati, ɗewur dul gurum mo ngal feer, dǝm nɗang shin a naaryil, mbǝ twe gurum mo sǝ kas ee?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Pool lap nwur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;An a ngu Yahudi. Mo làa an a nTarsus nɗǝǝn yil nSilisiya. An a laayil mǝnǝ, ɗe nǝ a mǝ man nkòo a wii. An pǝ ɗang pǝ gha, a shínpee nghan nleshap ɗi kǝ kuur mǝ gurum nǝ mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Ngu taakyeen nǝ wur shínpee nwur. Yaksǝ Pool ɗar nkaa pee kǝkàa nǝ, wur ɗiyeep sar nkuur mǝ gurum nǝ mo, mbǝkǝ mmo ɗok ɗe tǝtǝk. Kaaɗe mo ɗok tǝtǝk, ɓǝ wur leshap ngurum nǝ mo shi liispwoo Hiburu. Wur sat mmo nǝnee,<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>&lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa mo, kǝ puun fen mo, wu lekom kǝn nwun kǝlǝng an ɗi, kǝn nghan leshap ɗe nwun agaak, ɗe nenkám nǝ, baa wen kǝn cìn mee mbii ɗebish kas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Kaaɗe mo kǝlǝng wur leshap mmo a shi liispwoo Hiburu, ɓǝ mo sǝǝt ɗok tǝtǝk. Yaksǝ Pool sat nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>&lt;&lt;An a ngu Yahudi, ɗe mo làa an a nTarsus mǝ yil nSilisiya. Ɗangɓǝ nwurang a nɗǝǝn pee nkaam ɗesǝ. An nkam tang ran a nsar mǝ Gamaliyel. Mo kǝ tap kám nghan rǝret hakyeng nɗǝǝn Wàar ɗe mo a mǝ puun fun mo, ɗe an kǝ zuur ɗes zam mbǝ cìn ɗak Naan, koo wun sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/>Nǝ le gyet wen kǝn shinjeel ɗes, nnen ɗe mo kǝ seet nɗang Jesu Kristi, kǝzak, wen kǝn twe pak mo, ɗang kǝn mɓwoot shurep mo kǝ daas mo, ɗe nle mo nlushoot. <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>Koo a pris ɗeɗes sǝ, kǝ nen ɗenan-nan ɗesǝ mo, ɓǝ mon mmak ɗar langtǝng fen, nǝ pwoo ɗe an pǝ sat nǝ azeen. Mbǝɗǝ gyet wen kǝn lap ɓǝǝt-haal a pǝ mo, mbǝkǝ nghan ndǝm kǝ nǝ nɗyemnǝǝn fun nnen Yahudi mo, ɗe mo kǝ tong nɗǝǝn Damaskus, kǝ nghan nyak nenseet nɗang Jesu, ɗe mo kǝ tong pee nkaam mǝnǝ. Mbǝkǝ nghan jì ɗi kǝ mo nJerusalem a ɓuɓwoot, kǝn mmo shinjeel ɗi mmo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Leshap Nkaa Tuwap Fin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>&lt;&lt;Kaaɗe an a ar yoo mwaan nǝ, ɓǝ jì nwul kus kǝ Damaskus, koo puus a naar sǝ. Nnen mman, ɓǝ mee peeɓang ɗeɗes, tong aɗeng sham ɓangpee ɗe an ɗi cǝǝrkaat. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Yaksǝ ntaa nyil, ɓǝ kǝlǝng mee ɗoo nǝ pǝ sat nghan nǝnee, &lt;Sool, Sool, a mii le ɗang aa shin jeel nghan yii?&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>Ɓǝ ntal nǝnee, &lt;A gha wii Daa?&gt; ɓe wu sat nghan nǝnee, &lt;A an Jesu ngu Nazaret ɗe gha nkaa shinjeel nghan.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Nen ɗe mo ashak kǝ an, mo naa peeɓang nǝ, ɗang baa mo kǝlǝng ɗoo mǝ ngwe ɗewur leshap kǝ an nǝ kas. <verse eid="ACT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>Ɓǝ ntal nǝnee, &lt;Daa, waa a reɓet kǝn nghan cìn a mii?&gt; Yaksǝ Daa sat nghan nǝnee, &lt;A yool a dǝm nDamaskus, a mpeemǝnǝ ɓǝ mon nsat mbii mo nghan jir, ɗe an kǝn nle mo mbǝkǝ gha cìn ɗi.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Wen ncǝǝr nɗee a vum, mbǝ ɓal mǝ peeɓang nǝ. Ɓǝ nen ɗe mo ashak kǝ an, mo yaa sar nghan, ɓǝ mo dǝm kǝ an nDamaskus.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>&lt;&lt;Mee gwar ɗi ɗe mo kǝ petsǝm wur a Ananiyas, wur a mee nguseet ndang Naan, ɗewur kǝ cìn mbii ɗe Wàar Mosis moo sat rǝret. Nnen Yahudi ɗe mo kǝ tong nDamaskus jir, moo shin ɗeɗes nwur. <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>Wur jì ɗar kus kǝ an, ɓǝ wur sat nghan nǝnee, &lt;Ɗyemnǝǝn fen Sool, a naapee&gt; Abet-abet ɓǝ nnaapee, ɗe nǝ le nghan nnaa wur. <verse eid="ACT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>Ɓǝ wur sat nghan zak nǝnee, &lt;Naan mǝ puun fun mo, kǝ bǝlǝp gha, mbǝkǝ nghan man mbii ɗe Naan kǝ reɓet kǝn gha cìn ɗi, kǝ mbǝkǝ nghan naa Ngwe ɗe ndǝre sǝ, kǝ nghan kǝlǝng ɗoopwoo wur ɗi zak. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Mbǝɗǝ gha mbǝ ɗee a langtǝng wur, mbǝkǝ nghan leshap ɗi ngurum mo nkaa mbii ɗe aa naa, kǝ mbii ɗe aa kǝlǝng zak. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Yaksǝ, ɓǝ aa yap a mii? A yool kǝn mmo cìn baptisma ɗe ngha, Mbǝkǝ nghan ɗang ɗi nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Daa, kǝn nwur vwang shikbish fwaa mo ɗi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Naan Pet Pool Mbǝ Satpwoo Fin Nnen Heleni Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>&lt;&lt;Kaaɗe waa baa nji nJerusalem, ɓǝ an nkaa ɗangnaan nɗǝǝn Lu Naan ɗeɗes, ɓǝ nsuun suun. <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>An naa Daa, ɓǝ wur sat nghan nǝnee, &lt;A yool nkyen, a put aku nɗǝǝn Jerusalem nǝ, mbǝɗe baa mon lap langtǝng ɗe gha mbǝ sat nǝ nkaa an kas.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>Ɓǝ nlap nǝ, daa, mo shikáa mo, mo man nǝ, gyet an kǝn ɗel nkòo a lu Naan ɗeɗangyii, mbǝkǝ nghan twe nen ɗe mo shinzeen ngha, kǝ gyet an kǝn nǝrem mo zak. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/>Kǝzak, kaaɗe gyet mo tu Stivin ngusatpwoo fwaa, ɓǝ gyet an kǝn ɗar ɗi zak, ɗang gyet an aɓwoon mǝ mbii ɗe mo cìn nǝ jir, ɗe gyet a an nyaa leelep mǝ nen ɗe mo tu Stivin nǝ zak. <verse eid="ACT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>Ɓǝ Daa sat nghan nǝnee, &lt;A yool a dǝm, mpeeɗe an mbǝ lep gha dǝm jong-jong, pǝ nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngu Taakyeen Mǝ Shiitoon Mo Ɓam Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Kuur mǝ gurum nǝ mo lekom pǝ kǝlǝng Pool ɓǝ jì wul mpwoo ɗewur sat nǝ, ɗangɓǝ mo waa baa ɗyeep ɗoo ɗi zak, mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wu tu wur! Wu tu wur! Wu baa kǝ gwar ɗe mǝnǝ aku nɗǝǝn yil nǝ. Baa nǝ ret kǝ mmo yit gwar ɗe mǝnǝ ɗi mmeen kas!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Kaaɗe mo nkaa ɗyeep ɗoo nǝ, kǝ mo nkaa taat leelep fur mo shin kaa aɗeng, ɗang mo nkaa woo ǝrong kaa kǝ nǝ aɗeng zak. <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>Yaksǝ ngwe ɗeɗes mǝ shiitoon mo, le kǝn mmo ɗel kǝ Pool nɗǝǝn lu ɗe a peetong mǝ shiitoon nǝ mo. Wur le kǝ mo cam Pool shi mbwat, mbǝkǝ nwur mak manshii mǝ mbii ɗe nǝ le kǝ nkuur gurum nǝ mo kǝ ɗyeep ɗoo ɗi nkaa wur. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Ɗangɓǝ kaaɗe mo ɓwoot wur shi teng shim, mbǝkǝ mmo shin mbwat ɗi nwur, ɓǝ Pool sat mmee ɗeɗes mǝ shiitoon nǝ mo, ɗewur ɗar kus kǝ wur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Tan, kyet nǝ a ndǝre kǝn nwun shin mbwat ngwe ɗewur a ngu Rom, ɓǝ baa mo kǝ tok mee ɗyeel ɗe nǝ yaa wur kas aa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Kaaɗe shiitoon ɗeɗes kǝlǝng pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ wur dǝm sat ngwe ɗeɗes mǝ shiitoon nǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Aa reɓet cìn a mii ngwar ɗesǝ yii? Gwar ɗesǝ nǝ wur a ngu Rom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Ɓǝ ngwe ɗeɗes nǝ wur jì sat mPool nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A sat an azeen-zeen, gha a ngu Rom ee?&gt;&gt; Yaksǝ wur lap nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Kǝzak an a ngu Rom!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Ɓǝ ngwe ɗeɗes nǝ sat nwur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Gyet wen nkwat a shool ɗes, akuɗang ɓǝ wen ɗee a nguyil nRom nǝ.&gt;&gt; Pool sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗang mo làa wen a ngu Rom.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ ɓǝ nen ɗe mo kǝ reɓet cìn tal pǝ wur ɗe, mo yool abet ɓǝ mo yit wur mbǝshin. Kaaɗe ngwe ɗeɗes nǝ man nǝ, Pool a ngu Rom, ɓǝ kǝǝrmuut yaa wur hakyeng, mbǝɗe wur kǝ ten ɓwoot wur.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Ntoom Nenɗyeel Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Ɗangɓǝ daar nǝ, ɓǝ ngwe ɗeɗes nǝ reɓet man zeen mǝ mbii ɗe nǝ le kǝ nnen Yahudi mo reɓet yaa wur nǝ. Yaksǝ wur fwen Pool, wur le kǝn mmo pǝrep pris ɗenan mo, kǝ nenɗyeel mo, mo kuur ashak jir, ɗang wur dǝm le Pool ɗar ntoom nenɗyeel nǝ mo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Pool ban yit nkaa nenɗyeel nǝ mo, ɓǝ wur sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa mo, an kǝn ncìn ɗak mǝ Naan a shi pan kǝ pǝtuup fen ɗe nǝ a nɗe ndǝre ntoom mǝ Naan jiwul nCicinsǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Kaaɗe Ananiyas, pris ɗeɗes kǝlǝng pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ wur sat nnen ɗe moo ɗar kus kǝ Pool, kǝ mmo shweer wur mpwoo. <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/>Ɓǝ Pool sat nwur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Naan nshweer gha zak, gha a koo shiɓutlu ɗe mo pwes shi tweep piyaa piyaa sǝ. Waa aa tong mbǝkǝ nghan tokɗyeel ɗi nghan shi wàar nǝ mo, ɗang a gha waa ciir a tep wàar nǝ zak. Mbǝɗǝ a gha sat nǝ mo shweer an.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Nen ɗe moo ɗar ɗi a pee nǝ, mo sat mPool nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Waa aa fǝlǝp a pris ɗeɗes mǝ Naan mmǝnǝ.<verse eid="ACT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>Pool sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa mo, baa wen mman nǝ, wur a pris ɗeɗes mǝ Naan kas, mbǝɗe mo kǝ ten ran nɗǝǝn ɓǝǝt-haal mǝ Naan nǝnee, &lt;Taji a sat mee pwoo ɗebish nkaa ngwe ɗeɗes ɗewur nkaa nen fwaa mo kas.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>Kaaɗe Pool man nǝ, pak mo nɗǝǝn nenɗyeel nǝ mo a nnen Sadusi mo, kǝ pak mo a nnen Farisi mo, ɓǝ wur ɗiyeep ɗoo nɗǝǝn luɗyeel nǝ. Wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa mo, an a ngu Farisi, ɗang a ngu Farisi làa an zak. A mbǝɗe wen shinzeen nǝ, gurum mon nyool a peemúut, a nǝ le ɗang mo mbǝ tokɗyeel nghan nɗesǝ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Kaaɗe Pool sat pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ ɓǝlep yool nnaar nnen Farisi mo, kǝ nnen Sadusi mo, ɓǝ kuur kǝ gurum nǝ mo ɓak sut vǝl. <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/>Nen Sadusi moo sat nǝ baa gurum mon nyool a peemúut kas, kǝ baa mee nenlep mǝ Naan mo ɗi kas, kǝ baa mee mǝ riin mo ɗe kas zak, ɗang nnen Farisi mo shinzeen nǝ mbii ɗesǝ mo ɗe jir. <verse eid="ACT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Ɓǝ or ɗeɗes yool ɗi nɗǝǝn luɗyeel nǝ. Pak nenkám Wàar mǝ Mosis ɗe mo a nnen Farisi mo, mo yool ɗar atǝng, mo yaa ɓeetshik ɗes hakyeng. Mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Baa mu naa mee mbii ɗebish nɗǝǝn gwar ɗesǝ kas, ngul a mee riin, koo a mee ngulep mǝ Naan leshap kǝ wur.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Kaaɗe ɓeetshik nǝ naat zam, ɓǝ ngwe ɗeɗes kǝǝr nǝ, mon nyool tu Pool, ɓǝ wur lep shiitoon mo dǝm dul wur ɓalɓal shin put nɗǝǝn luɗyeel nǝ, kǝ mmo dǝm kǝ wur a mpeetong mǝ shiitoon nǝ mo.<verse eid="ACT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Parmǝnǝ mpar, ɓǝ Daa jì woo shin mPool, ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Taji kǝǝrmuut yaa gha kas, kaaɗe aa leshap ngurum mo nkaa an nɗǝǝn Jerusalem kǝ kaaɗe a ɗee a langtǝng nkaa an sǝ, ɓǝ tǝng gha mbǝ dǝm a leshap ngurum mo nkaa an nɗǝǝn Rom a kǝsǝ zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Ɓalpwoo Mbǝ Tu Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Daar mɓít, ɓǝ pak nnen Yahudi mo ɓalpwoo mo shi ɓal ashak, kǝ mmo ɓǝlemcuk shi toom nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Naan nǝ, baa ɗun nse mee mbii, koo shwaa mee am kas, tǝng ɗun tu Pool akuɗang. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Nen ɗe mo ɓalpwoo ashak mbǝ tu Pool nǝ, mo met nlaarfeer. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Yaksǝ mo jì pǝ pris ɗenan mo, kǝ nen ɗenan-nan mo, mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Mun muu ɓalpwoo fun ɓalɓal ashak, kǝ mmun tuweer nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Naan nǝ, baa mun cam mee mbiise kas, tǝng mun tu Pool akuɗang.<verse eid="ACT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>&lt;&lt;Mbǝ mǝnǝ yaksǝ, wun kǝ nenɗyeel mo jir, wu sat ngwe ɗeɗes, kǝn nwur jì kǝ Pool pǝ wun ɗi, koo wuu tang a naa pwoo wur nǝ ɗi rǝret sǝ. Mun mun ten mu ɗak sun, mbǝkǝ mun taa mu tu wur ɗi a ar, akuɗang wur jì wul pǝ wun ɗi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Ɗangɓǝ kǝn Pool, kǝlǝng pwoo ɗe mo sat nkaa loom ndǝm mo pǝkom ar nǝ, ɓǝ wur dǝm ɗel nɗǝǝn Peetong shiitoon nǝ mo, ɓǝ wur woo pwoo mǝnǝ mPool. <verse eid="ACT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Yaksǝ Pool pet memee mɓut ɗenan mǝ shiitoon nǝ mo, ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A dǝm kǝ làa zǝlang ɗesǝ pǝ ngwe ɗeɗes ɗi, mbǝɗe wur kǝ mee pwoo ɗewur kǝ reɓet sat nǝ ngwe ɗeɗes.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Mee ɗeɗes nkaa shiitoon nǝ mo, wur mang làa zǝlang nǝ, wur dǝm kǝ wur pǝ ngwe ɗeɗes ɗi, ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A Pool ɗewur a ɓuɓwoot sǝ, a wur pet an, kǝn nwur ɗang pǝ an, kǝn nghan njì kǝ làa zǝlang ɗesǝ pǝ gha ɗi. Nǝ, làa nǝ wur kǝ mee pwoo ɗewur kǝ reɓet sat nǝ ngha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Ɓǝ ngwe ɗeɗes nǝ yaa sar làa zǝlang nǝ, wur dǝm kǝ làa zǝlang nǝ mmee koop mbǝshin. Yaksǝ wur tal pǝ làa zǝlang nǝ coot nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Waa aa mee pwoo ɗǝɗang ɗe aa reɓet sat nǝ nghan yii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Làa zǝlang nǝ sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A nnen Yahudi mo kǝ ɓalpwoo mo ashak nǝ, mo mbǝ jì ɗang pǝ gha, mbǝkǝ daar a dǝm ɗi kǝ Pool a pee ɓeetpwoo. Mo mbǝ cìn koo mo a mbǝ baa naa pwoo nǝ ɗi rǝret sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Taji a reɓet mmo kas, mbǝɗe gurum mo met nlaarfeer mɓut mmo, mo kǝ lǝǝm a ar, mo mbǝ yap Pool dǝm. Mo kǝ ɓǝlemcuk shi toom nɗǝǝn sǝm mǝ Naan nǝ, baa ɗun nse, koo shwaa mee mbii kas, tǝng ɗun ntu Pool akuɗang. Yaksǝ mo kǝ ɗak sut, moo ɗar naa a ɗe gha mbǝ lep Pool shindǝm ɓejee.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ ngwe ɗeɗes nǝ wur ɓwet làa zǝlang nǝ shinseet, ɓǝ wur sat làa zǝlang nǝ nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Taji a woo mmee gurum nǝ aa leshap ɗesǝ nǝ nghan kas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Lep Pool Shindǝm Pǝ Gofna Feliks Ɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ ngwe ɗeɗes nǝ pet mee ɗǝnan-nan mǝ shiitoon mo vǝl, ɗe mo kǝ tap shiitoon mo kambil kambil. Wur sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wu le shiitoon mo kambil vǝl, kǝ shiitoon mǝ lang bǝring mo laarpwoovǝl, kǝ shiitoon mǝ lek lek shi kop mo kambil vǝl zak. Mbǝkǝ mmo dǝm nSizariya, koo naapuus pwoofeer ɗe mǝ par cicinsǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Wur sat kǝn mmo le mee bǝring ɗe nǝn mang Pool, mbǝkǝ mo seet kǝ wur ryang pǝ gofna Feliks ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Ngu taakyeen nǝ ran mee lep a rǝran shindǝm ngofna Feliks, ɗe nǝ sat nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>&lt;&lt;Tokshik nsar ngwe ɗeɗes Klodiyus Lisiyas, dǝm pǝ ngwe ɗeɗes gofna Feliks ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Nnen Yahudi mo kǝ yaa gwar ɗesǝ, ɗang dǝ mo yappee ɗe mon ntu wur ɗi, a kǝsǝ ɓǝ a, an ndǝm kǝ shiitoon mo, ɓǝ a an mɓam wur, mbǝɗe nkǝlǝng nǝ, wur a ngu Rom. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Kaaɗe an pǝ reɓet manshii mǝ mbii ɗe nǝ le ɗang mo yaa wur, ɓǝ ndǝm kǝ wur nɗǝǝn luɗyeel mo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Yaksǝ nkat mo yaa wur a mbǝ pak mbii ɗe mo nɗǝǝn Wàar mo mo, ɗang pwoo ɗe mo sat nkaa wur nǝ, ɓǝ baa nǝ mak muut nwur, koo nǝ le kǝ mo shoot wur kas. <verse eid="ACT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Ɓǝ kaaɗe nkǝlǝng nǝ pak nnen Yahudi nǝ mo kǝ ɓalpwoo mo mbǝ tu gwar nǝ, ɓǝ nlep wur shindǝm pǝ gha ɗi abet. An kǝn nsat nnen ɗe mo kǝ pwoo nkaa wur nǝ, kǝn mmo dǝm leshap ɗe mo kǝ nǝ nkaa wur ɗi ntoom fwaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Aasǝ ɓǝ shiitoon nǝ mo mang Pool, kaaɗe mo kǝ sat mmo sǝ, mo dǝm kǝ wur Antipatris mpar. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Daar nǝ, ɓǝ mo yit kǝn nnenbǝring mo dǝm kǝ wur, kǝn nnenshii mo waa baa ɗi a peetong shiitoon nǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Kaaɗe nenbǝring ɗesǝ nǝ mo dǝm wul nSizariya, ɓǝ mo shin Pool kǝ lep ɗi a rǝran nǝ ngofna. <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Kaaɗe gofna tang lep ɗi a rǝran nǝ, ɓǝ wur tal pǝ Pool nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Waa a put a nkoop yil ɗeɗangyii&gt;&gt; Ɓǝ kaaɗe wur kǝlǝng nǝ Pool put a nkoop nSilisiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>Yaksǝ gofna nǝ sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;An mbǝ kǝlǝng pwoo fwaa nǝ, katɗang nen ɗe mo pungwool fwaa nǝ mo jì wul.&gt;&gt; Wur le kǝn mmo shoot Pool nkoop tul mǝ mishkoom Herot.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Nen Yahudi Mo Dǝm Kǝ Ɗyeel nkaa Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Aɓwoon meeteer mo paat, ɓǝ Ananiyas pris ɗeɗes, jì ashak kǝ pak pris ɗenan mo, kǝ mee Nguɓerepdyeel ɗe sǝm wur a Tartulus, mo dǝm kǝ ɗyeel nkaa Pool pǝ gofna ɗi.<verse eid="ACT 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>Kaaɗe mo pet Pool, ɓǝ Tartulus ɗoom leshap nkaa Pool nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Waa Feliks ngwe ɗeret met jir. A mbǝ gha, ɗang muu tongriyang, hakyeng, kǝ a mbǝ ɗak ɗeret fwaa mo zak, ɗang yil fun ɗesǝ nǝ ɗee a ɗe ɗak, koo a mpee ɗeɗangyii. <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>Mbii ɗe a cìn nǝ mo, ɓǝ mu plang ɗes zam, koo a nii, ɓǝ gurum moo plang gha. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Ɗangɓǝ mbǝkǝ taji nle kǝn nghan yool a yaa pwoo a tong mpee ɗesǝ kas, ɓǝ an pǝ ɗang pǝ gha mbǝ ɗeret fwaa, a lekom kǝn nghan kǝlǝng mun ɗi mbǝ reppee lee. <verse eid="ACT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>Mu kat gwar ɗesǝ wur a ngu tǝkook kǝ pee, ɗǝ wur le ɓǝlep ɗebish yool nnaar kǝ nnen Yahudi mo. Koo mpee ɗeɗangyii nɗǝǝn yil nǝ. Kǝzak wur a ngu taakyeen mǝ soon mǝ nnen Nazarin mo zak. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>Nǝ le gyet wur reɓet le Lu Naan ɗeɗes nǝ ɗee a mbii ɗebuu, ɗang mu yaa wur. Muu reɓet tokɗyeel nwur a shi wàar fun mo. <verse eid="ACT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7"/>Ɗangɓǝ gyet ngwe ɗeɗes Lisiyas jì dul wur put kǝnǝ shiɓal nsar fun. <verse eid="ACT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>Yaksǝ Lisiyas sat nnen ɗe mo kǝ pwoo nkaa wur nǝ, kǝn mo jì pǝ gha ɗi. Katɗang a tal pwoo mo nkaa mbii ɗe muu sat sǝ mo shikáa fwaa pǝ wur, ɓǝ a mman zeen mǝ pwoo ɗesǝ mo jir, ɗe muu jì kǝ mo nkaa wur.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>Nen Yahudi mon mɓwoon pwoo ɗe Ngu ɓǝrep ɗyeel nǝ sat, dǝm mo tong a langtǝng nǝ, pwoo ɗe Ngu ɓǝrep ɗyeel sat nǝ mo azeen jir.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Put Kaa Fin Ntoom Kǝ Feliks</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Ɓǝ gofna kam sar mPool, mbǝkǝ nwur leshap ɗi. Yaksǝ Pool sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Wen man nǝ, waa aa cìn ɓit mo ɗes, ɓǝ gha nkaa tokɗyeel nnen ɗesǝ mo. Mbǝ mǝnǝ ɓǝ an pǝ leshap ɗesǝ nǝ a shi retnyit, mbǝ put kǝ káa fen. <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Waa shikáa fwaa a mak bǝlǝp shii mǝnǝ, ɓǝ a mman nǝ, mɓut teer ɗe mo ɗel kaapaat baavǝl sǝ mo, ɓǝ gyet wen nkàa nJerusalem mbǝ seyil nNaan. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Baa nnen Yahudi mo kǝ cam kat an mpwoo kǝ mee gurum nɗǝǝn Lu Naan ɗeɗes kas, kǝ baa mo cam kat wen nle mee gurum ɓwetɓeer kas, koo a nɗǝǝn Lu Naan mo, kǝ koo a nɗǝǝn pee nkaam nǝ kas zak. <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Kǝzak, baa mon mmak kám nghan agaak azeen-zeen nkaa mbii ɗe mo ji kǝ dyeel fen pǝ gha yaksǝ nǝ kas. <verse eid="ACT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>Ɗangɓǝ nǝ azeen-zeen, an kǝn seyil nNaan mǝ puun fun mo a nɗǝǝn ar ɗe mǝ mo kǝ pet a ɗung. An kǝn seyil nNaan mǝ puun fun mo, ɗang nshinzeen mbii ɗe mo ran mo nɗǝǝn ɓǝǝt-haal mǝ Mosis mo jir. Kǝ mbii ɗe mo ran mo nɗǝǝn ɓǝǝt-haal mǝ nen satpwoo mǝ Naan mo zak. <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>An kǝn canciin nɗǝǝn Naan, kaaɗe mǝ mo kǝ canciin nɗǝǝn Naan sǝ zak nǝ, mon nyool kǝ gurum mo a peemúut jir, nnen ɗe ndǝre mo, kǝ nen ɗebish mo zak. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>A mbǝ canciin mǝnǝ, ɗang an pǝ mbǝ gung, mbǝkǝ nghan tong ɗe shi mǝse ɗeret ntoom kǝ Naan, kǝ ntoom kǝ gurum mo shidaar-shidaar.<verse eid="ACT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>&lt;&lt;Aɓwoon mǝ ɓit mo ruk, ɓǝ wen njì kǝ shool mbǝ ɓam nen fen mo, kǝ mbii mo mbǝ wus mbiizuum nNaan zak. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Kaaɗe an nkaa cìn mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo jì kat an nɗǝǝn Lu Naan ɗeɗes nǝ, ɓǝ kǝn lesen a ɗeɓang. Ɓǝ baa mo kat an ashak kǝ mee kuur gurum mo, ɗe mun nkaa ɗyeep ɗoo koo wat mee mbii mo kas. Gyet pak nnen Yahudi ɗe mo pwat Eshiya mo ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Katɗang yoo mo kǝ mee pwoo nkaa an, ɓǝ yoo nǝ nret kǝn nnen Yahudi ɗe mo pwat Eshiya sǝ, mo ɗe ntoom fwaa, mbǝ jì kǝ ɗyeel nkaa an nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>An mbǝ reɓet kǝ nnen ɗe mon mpee ɗesǝ shikáa fur kǝn mmo sat mbii ɗebish ɗe mo kat nɗǝǝn an, kaaɗe ɗe nɗar ntoom nenɗyeel mo sǝ ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/>Ɗee a mbii mǝndong, ɗe ɗiyeep ɗoo fen nnaar mo, ɓǝ a an sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;A mbǝ pwoo nkaa yool a peemúut, ɗang wun bǝ tokɗyeel nghan ntoom fuu cicinsǝ, ɓejee ɗak.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo Le Pool Nlushoot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Ɗangɓǝ mbǝɗe Feliks pan man pwoo nkaa ar nǝ rǝret, ɓǝ wur ɗar kǝ ɗyeel nǝ. Wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Katɗang parpuus ɗe Lisiyas ngwe ɗeɗes mǝ shiitoon mo jì wul, ɓǝ an nsǝǝt nnaa pwoo fuu nǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>Wur sat ngwe ɗeɗes nkaa shiitoon mo, kǝ nwur tap kǝ Pool, ɗang wur shínpee mPool, taji mo daampee nshaar mǝ Pool mo mbǝ jì cìn ɓam nwur kas.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Aɓwoon pak meeteer mo, ɓǝ Feliks jì ashak kǝ mat fin Drusila, ɗe war a reep Yahudi. Yaksǝ wur lep mmo dǝm jì kǝ Pool. Feliks lekom kǝn nwur kǝlǝng pwoo ɗe Pool nkaa sat nǝ, ɗe nǝ a mǝ shinzeen nɗǝǝn Jesu Kristi. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Pool leshap nkaa tong ɗe ndǝre-ndǝre, kǝ ngurum yaashin, kǝ pwoo nkaa tokɗyeel ɗe nǝn mbǝ jì. Ɓǝ kǝǝrmuut yaa Feliks, nǝ le nwur sat mPool nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A mak seet yaksǝ aku, katɗang parpuus ɗe nkatpee, ɓǝ an mbǝ pet gha zak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Feliks leɗyeen nǝ, tong Pool mbǝ shin a shool nɗyin, a nǝ le ɗang wur naa mpet Pool shidaar-shidaar, mbǝkǝ nwur leshap ɗe kǝ nwur.<verse eid="ACT 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Aɓwoon ɓit mo vǝl, ɓǝ Poncus Festus wur kaa a gofna a koppee Feliks. Gyet a mbǝɗe Feliks reɓet kǝn nnen Yahudi mo ɗee a shaar fin mo, a nǝ le ɗang gyet wur yit Pool nɗǝǝn lushoot.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Pool Ɗyeep Ɗyeel Fin Shindǝm nSiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Aɓwoon meeteer mo kun, ɗe Festus kǝ jì nɗǝǝn yil mǝ mulki mishkoom fin, ɓǝ wur yool nSizariya kàa nJerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Yaksǝ pris ɗenan mo, kǝ nennan mǝ nnen Yahudi mo jì kǝ ɗyeel mǝ mbii ɗebish mo, ɗe nǝ, Pool kǝ cìn mo pǝ Festus ɗi, mo ɗang pǝ wur, <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>mbǝkǝ nwur ɓam mo ɗi. Moo reɓet kǝn Festus lep mmo jì kǝ Pool nJerusalem, mbǝɗe mo kǝ tap ɗaksut, mbǝkǝ mmo táa tu Pool ɗi a ar. <verse eid="ACT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Ɗangɓǝ Festus lap mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Pool wur a ɓuɓwoot nSizariya. An shikáa fen, wen nreɓet yool sham nSizariya nǝ nɗǝǝn meeteer ɗesǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>Wur sat zak nǝnee, wu yit kǝn mpak nen ɗenan-nan mo mɓut nwun, mo sham ashak kǝ an, mbǝkǝ mmo sat mbii ɗebish ɗe gwar nǝ wur cìn mo ɗi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Aɓwoon ɗe Festus tong ashak kǝ mo mbǝ teer mo pwookun koo kaapaat, ɓǝ wur yool sham nSizariya. Yaksǝ wur tong nkaa mbii tong mǝ tokɗyeel, ɓǝ wur sat mmo dǝm jì kǝ Pool. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>Kaaɗe mo jì wul kǝ Pool, ɓǝ nnen Yahudi mo jì, ɗe mo tong nyil Jerusalem kǝ pwoo ɗebish mo ɗes nkaa wur, ɗe baa mǝ mo shikáa mo mo mak kám agaak zeen mǝ pwoo nǝ mo kas. <verse eid="ACT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Pool ɗar ɓalɓal mbǝ shang káa fin, ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Baa an kǝn cìn mee mbii ɗebish kas, koo a nkaa Wàar mǝ nnen Yahudi mo, kǝ koo a nkaa Lu Naan ɗeɗes nǝ, kǝ koo a nkaa Wàar mǝ mishkoom Siza kas koo lee lee.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Ɗangɓǝ mbǝɗe Festus reɓet kǝ nnen Yahudi mo ɗee a shaar fin, ɓǝ wur tal pǝ Pool nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Kyet aa reɓet kàa nJerusalem, kǝn nghan tokɗyeel ɗi nghan mpeemǝnǝ nkaa mbii ɗesǝ mo aa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Ɓǝ Pool sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;An mbǝ ɗar a ntoom mbii tong mǝ tokɗyeel mǝ Siza, a pee ɗe nǝ ret kǝ mmo tokɗyeel ɗi nghan mmǝnǝ. Baa an kǝn cìn mee shikbish nnen Yahudi mo kas. Waa shikáa fwaa a man azeen-zeen nǝ, baa an kǝn cìn mee mbii ɗebish kas. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Katɗang yoo an kǝn tep Wàar nǝ, koo cìn mee mbii ɗebish ɗe nǝ mak kǝn mmo tu an, ɓǝ ɗi baa an kǝǝrmuut nǝ kas. Ɗangɓǝ katɗang ɓǝ baa mee zeen ɗi nɗǝǝn mbii ɗe nnen ɗesǝ moo ɗyeel fen mbǝ nǝ kas, ɓǝ baa mee gurum mak shin an nsar mo kas. An kǝn reɓet kǝ a Siza tokɗyeel nǝ nghan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Ɓǝ aɓwoon ɗe Festus ɓeetpwoo nǝ ashak kǝ nnen ɗe moo ɓam wur nɗyéel, ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Waa a ɗang mbǝ dǝm pǝ Siza ɗi! Ɓǝ gha mbǝ dǝm a pǝ Siza ɗi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Ntoom Agripa Kǝ Barnis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Aɓwoon teer mo ruk, ɓǝ mishkoom Agripa kǝ Benis mo jì wul nSizariya, mbǝkǝ mmo sat mwaanlee ɗi nFestus. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Mbǝɗǝ mo kǝ cìn teer mo ɗes ɗi nSizariya nǝ, ɓǝ Festus yakshii mǝ pwoo nkaa Pool mishkoom Agripa, wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Mee gwar ɗi, ɗe gyet Feliks yit wur a ɓuɓwoot nlushoot. <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Kaaɗe dǝ nkàa nJerusalem, ɓǝ pris ɗenan mo, kǝ nen ɗenan-nan mǝ nnen Yahudi mo jì kǝ ɗyeel nkaa gwar nǝ pǝ an ɗi. Mo ɗang pǝ an, mbǝkǝ nghan canɗyeel muut ɗi ngwar nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>Ɗangɓǝ nlap mmo nǝ, baa nǝ a mǝse mǝ nnen Rom mo, kǝn mmo canɗyeel mmee gurum, ɗe mo kǝ jì kǝ ɗyeel nkaa wur nen pee mmo kǝn shínpee nwur, kǝn nwur leshap mǝ shang káa fin ɗi nluɗyeel ashak kǝ nen ɗe mmo ji kǝ ɗyeel nǝ mo kas. Ɗangɓǝ tǝng mo nshee shínpee nwur, kǝn nwur leshap mǝ shang káa fin ɗi akuɗang mon ncanɗyeel ngwar nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>Kaaɗe mo jì mpee ɗesǝ ashak kǝ an, ɓǝ baa wen nɗar ɗi kǝ pwoo nǝ kas, ɓǝ daar nǝ, ɓǝ wen tong nkaa mbii tong mǝ tokɗyeel, ɓǝ wen nle kǝ mmo dǝm jì kǝ gwar nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Kaaɗe nen ɗe mo jì kǝ ɗyeel nkaa gwar nǝ, mo yool ɗar leshap, ɓǝ baa mo sat mee pwoo ɗebish mo nkaa gwar nǝ, kaaɗe an kǝn pan sǝ kas. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Ɗangɓǝ pwoo ɗe mo sat nkaa wur nǝ, a pwoo nkaa pak mbii ɗe mo a mǝ mǝse mǝ seyil nNaan mo, kǝ pwoo nkaa mee ngwe ɗe moo pet sǝm wur a Jesu zak. Ɗe nǝ, wur muut. Ɓǝ nǝ, Pool leshap ngurum mo ɓalɓal nǝ, Jesu ɗe mmeen. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Kaaɗe baa wen mman mbii ɗe an mbǝ cìn nkaa pwoo ɗesǝ nǝ mo kas, ɓǝ wen ntal pǝ Pool nǝ, kyet aa reɓet kàa nJerusalem, kǝ mmo tokɗyeel ɗe nghan nkaa mbii ɗesǝ mo mpeemǝnǝ aa? <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Ɗangɓe kaaɗe Pool ɗang nǝ, tǝng a Siza tokɗyeel nǝ nɗyin, ɓǝ wen nle kǝ mmo tap kǝ wur rǝret, dǝm wul parpuus ɗe an mbǝ lep wur shindǝm pǝ Siza ɗi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Ɓǝ Agripa sat nFestus nǝnee, &lt;&lt;An kǝn nreɓet kǝlǝng pwoo mǝ gwar mǝnǝ shikáa fen.&gt;&gt; Festus sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Dǝɗaar ɓǝ gha mbǝ nkǝlǝng wur.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Ntoom Mishkoom Agripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Daar nǝ, ɓǝ Agripa kǝ Benis mo jì nɗǝǝn ɗeɗes mo hakyeng, ɓǝ mo ɗel nɗǝǝn luɗyeel nǝ ashak kǝ pak shiitoon ɗǝnan-nan mo, kǝ nnen ɗǝnan-nan mǝ pee nkaam nǝ mo. Yaksǝ Festus lep mmo dǝm jì kǝ Pool. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Ɓǝ Festus sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Mishkoom Agripa, kǝ wun nen ɗe wun ashak kǝ mun jir mpee ɗesǝ. Wu naa gwar ɗesǝ, dǝ nnen Yahudi mo jir, mo kǝ jì kǝ ɗyeel nkaa wur pǝ an ɗi nJerusalem, kǝ mpee ɗesǝ zak. Dǝ mon nkaa ɗyeep ɗoo ɗang moo sat nǝ baa nǝ ret kǝ mmo yit gwar ɗesǝ ɗi mmeen kas. <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Ɗangɓǝ baa wen kat wur kǝ cìn mee mbii ɗebish ɗe nǝn mmak kǝ mmo tu wur kas. Pool shikáa fin, ɗang kǝ mmo dǝm kǝ ɗyeel fin nǝ pǝ Siza ɗi. Yaksǝ ɓǝ wen kǝn leɗyeen mbǝ lep Pool shindǝm pǝ Siza ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>Ɗangɓǝ baa wen mman zeen kǝ mǝ mbii ɗewur cìn nǝ, ɗe wen nran Agustus nkaa nǝ kas. Mbǝ mǝnǝ wen njì kǝ wur ntoom fuu, met jir, ɓǝ a ntoom fwaa mishkoom Agripa, mbǝkǝ aɓwoon ɗe mo bǝlǝp pwoo wur nǝ, ɓǝ an nkat mee mbii ɗe an nran shindǝm ɗi Agustus. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Mbǝɗǝ wen naa nǝ ɗee a koo ɗak mwen sǝ, kǝn mmo lep mee gurum shindǝm a ɓuɓwoot, baa ashak kǝ satpwoo nkaa mbii ɗebish ɗe ngwe nǝ cìn kas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Pool Leshap Mǝ Shang Káa Fin Ntoom Agripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Mishkoom Agripa sat mPool nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Mo shínpee ngha, mbǝkǝ nghan leshap ɗi shikáa fwaa.&gt;&gt; Aasǝ ɓǝ Pool ɗiyeep sar fin, ɓǝ wur leshap mǝ shang káa fin. Wur sat nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>&lt;&lt;Azeen-zeen, mishkoom Agripa, yaksǝ ɓǝ nǝ fes shang nghan zam, mbǝɗe wen nkatpee leshap mǝ shang nkáa fen ntoom fwaa cicinsǝ, nkaa mbii ɗe nnen Yahudi moo sat cin nkaa an mo jir. <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>Mbǝɗǝ gha kǝ man ɗes zam, nkaa mǝse mǝ mbii ɗe mo a mǝ nnen Yahudi mo, kǝ pwoo nkaa mbii ɗe moo ɓǝlep nkaa nǝ zak. Wen nɗang pǝ gha, a gung kǝn nghan kǝlǝng mbii ɗe an mbǝ nsat mo shi pǝtuup mǝ gung. <verse eid="ACT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>Nnen Yahudi mo jir, mo man tong fen, peegyet nkutɗi a nzǝlang. Mɓut nnen fen mo, kǝ nɗǝǝn Jerusalem zak, jì wul cicinsǝ. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>Mo man an peegyet ɗi nshee. Kǝzak katɗang ɓǝ ɗe moo reɓet langtǝng nǝ, yoo mon nsat nǝ, azeen an a ngu Farisi, ɗe nǝ a mee soon ɗe mo fes ɗar ɓal-ɓal nkaa seyil nNaan fun nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Mbǝmǝnǝ kǝn ɗar mpee ɗesǝ, mbǝkǝ mmo tokɗyeel ɗi nghan, a mbǝɗe an pǝ canciin nkaa gampwoo ɗe gyet Naan kǝ cweer nǝn mpuun fun mo. <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>A pwoo ɗe gyet Naan kǝ cweer nsoon fun ɗe kaapaat baavǝl sǝ mo, ɗe moo canciin mbǝ lap nǝ, ɗang mo kǝ gung mbǝ seyil nNaan mpar kǝ puus, mbǝ canciin ɗesǝ. Ɓǝ nnen Yahudi mo dǝm kǝ ɗyeel fen, ntoom fwaa mishkoom! <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>A mii le ɗang baa nnen Yahudi mon mmak shinzeen nǝ, Naan mbǝ nyool kǝ nnen ɗe mo kǝ murep a peemúut kas yii? <verse eid="ACT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>Gyet wen mpan shikáa fen nǝ, an mbǝ cìn mbii ɗe mmak jir, mbǝkǝ nghan tekook kǝ sǝm Jesu ngu Nazaret ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Gyet a mbii ɗe ncìn nJerusalem mmǝnǝ, ɗe kǝn nlap ɓal pǝ pris ɗenan mo. Gyet kǝn shoot nenseet nɗang Jesu mo ɗes nɗǝǝn lushoot, kǝzak gyet an mɓwoon nnen ɗe mo twe nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo zak. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Yit ɗes, ɓǝ nshinjeel nnenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo nɗǝǝn lu Naan mo zak. Gyet kǝn reɓet le kǝn mmo cíipwoo nǝ, baa Jesu a Kristi kas. Mbǝɗǝ gyet njar naa mo nyit bǝbish zam. Mbǝ mǝnǝ ɓǝ gyet mmwaan ndǝm mpee nkaam ɗe baa mo a mǝ nnen Yahudi mo kas, mbǝkǝ nghan nshinjeel ɗi nnenseet nɗang Jesu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Leshap Nkaa Tuwap fin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>&lt;&lt;Par sǝ mpuus ɓǝ an a ar dǝm nDamaskus mbǝ yak nenseet nɗang Jesu nǝ mo, shi ɓal ɗe kǝn nlap pǝ pris ɗenan mo, ɗǝ a mo lep an zak. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Ɓǝ kaaɗe puus a naar, mishkoom! Yaksǝ nnaa mee peeɓang ɗe nǝ tong aɗeng sham ɓangpee, ɗe nǝ met mɓangpee mǝ puus. Nǝ ɓangpee neer an cǝǝrkaat ashak kǝ nen ɗe mo ashak kǝ an. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Ɓǝ mun jir mu ɗong nyil, ɓǝ nkǝlǝng mee ɗoo nǝ sat nghan shi liispwoo Hiburu nǝnee, &lt;Sool, Sool, a mii le ɗang waa aa shinjeel nghan yii? Nǝn nshwal ngha, kǝn nghan cut sak shi deelkam ɗe peet peet.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>Ɓǝ ntal nǝnee, &lt;A gha wii Daa?&gt; Yaksǝ Daa sat nghan nǝnee, &lt;A an Jesu ɗe aa shinjeel nghan sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>Yaksǝ a yool a ɗar atǝng, mbǝɗe an mbǝ woo sen fen ngha, a mbǝkǝ nghan ɗee ɗe a nguɗak fen, kǝ nguɗar langtǝng ngurum mo nkaa mbii ɗe aa naa, kǝ mbii ɗe an mbǝ kám mo nghan zak.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/>An mbǝ ɓam gha nsar nnen Isreil mo, kǝ nsar nnen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas. An mbǝ lep gha shindǝm pǝ nnen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas zak. <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/>Mbǝkǝ nghan wang yit mo mo ɗi. Kǝn mmo yit peenkwoo, kǝ mmo ɗel ɗi nɗǝǝn peeɓang. Kǝzak mbǝkǝ mmo put ɗi mɓut mɓal mǝ ngujwaan. Kǝn mmo jì ɗi pǝ Naan zak. Mbǝkǝ katɗang mo shinzeen, ɓǝ mon nkat fwoo mǝ shikbish fur mo, kǝn mon nkat peetong ɗe ashak kǝ nen ɗe Naan kǝ ten bǝlǝp mo zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Leshap Nkaa Ɗak Fin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>&lt;&lt;Mishkoom Agripa, baa gyet ncii cìn mbii ɗe suun ɗe nǝ tong aɗeng sham sat nghan kas. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/>Gyet nshee satpwoo Naan nǝ a nnen Damaskus mo, ɗang ndǝm kǝn nghan sat ɗe nnen Jerusalem mo, kǝ yil ɗe mo neer Judiya jir. Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ nsat nnen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas zak. An pǝ sat mmo tuwap, kǝn mmo ciir pǝ Naan ɗi, kǝn mmo cìn ɗak ɗe nǝ kám tuwap mo nǝ ɗi zak. <verse eid="ACT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>A mpeemǝnǝ, ɗang nnen Yahudi mo yaa an nɗǝǝn Lu Naan ɗeɗes, kǝ gyet mo kǝ tang ar mbǝ tu an. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Ɗangɓǝ mbǝɗe nkat ɓam pǝ Naan ɗi, a nǝ le ɗang kǝn nɗar ɗi ntoom fwaa mbǝ cicinsǝ. An nkaa satpwoo Naan nǝ nennan mo, kǝ jep ɗeɗyeen mo jir. Baa nsat a mmee pwoo ɗecì kas, tǝng a pwoo ɗe nensatpwoo Naan mo, kǝ Mosis mo kǝ ten sat nǝ, nǝn nyool cìn a kǝsǝ. <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/>Nǝ, tǝng Kristi mbǝ shwaajeel, kǝ a wur a ngwe ɗenshee mǝ yool a peemúut zak. A wur mbǝ shee leshap nkaa peeɓang nǝ nnen Yahudi mo, kǝ nen ɗe baa mo a nnen Yahudi mo kas zak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Reɓet Kǝn Agripa Shinzeen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Kaaɗe Pool nkaa leshap mbǝ shang káa nǝ, ɓǝ Festus sat shii ɗoo ɗeɗes nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Pool aa tǝttar aa? Man fwaa nii le gha ɗee a ngutar.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Ɓǝ Pool lap nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Baa an a ngutar kas Festus, ngwe ɗeret met jir. An kǝn sat a pwoo ɗe mo azeen-zeen kǝ ɗe mo a ndǝre zak. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Mishkoom man mbii ɗe kǝn nsat sǝ mo agaak. Mbǝɗǝ mman azeen-zeen nǝ, baa mee mbii loom gha mɓut mbii ɗesǝ mo jir kas. Mbǝɗǝ baa gyet mo cìn mbii mǝnǝ mo a sǝsok kas. <verse eid="ACT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>Mishkoom Agripa, a shinzeen nnensat pwoo mǝ Naan mo ee? Mman nǝ, a shinzeen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Mishkoom Agripa sat mPool nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Nɗǝǝn reppee ɗi lee sǝ, ɓǝ aa reɓet ciir kǝ an, kǝn nghan nɗee ɗi a nguseet nɗang Jesu ee?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>Pool lap nǝnee, &lt;&lt;koo a nɗǝǝn reppee lee. Koo a nɗǝǝn pee ɗe nǝ ɗes, ɓǝ an nkaa ɗangnaan mbǝ gha, kǝ nnen ɗe mo nkaa kǝlǝng an cicinsǝ jir, mbǝkǝ mmo tuwap kǝn mmo ɗee ɗi a nenseet nɗang Jesu koo an sǝ. Ɗangɓe taji a shi shoolbǝring kaaɗe an kǝ nǝ sǝ kas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mishkoom yool, kǝ gofna, kǝ Benis, kǝ nnen ɗe mo kǝ tong ashak kǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>Ɓǝ mo dǝm mmee koop mbǝsut, ɓǝ mo ɓeet kǝ shak nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Baa gwar ɗesǝ kǝ cìn mee mbii ɗebish ɗe nǝ mak muut, koo mo nle wur nɗǝǝn lushoot kas.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Agripa sat nFestus nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Katɗang yoo baa gwar ɗesǝ wur kǝ ɗang mbǝ dǝm kǝ ɗyeel nǝ pǝ Siza ɗi kas, ɓǝ yoo mon ɓwet wur.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Pool Ɗel Nɗǝǝn Tii Mbǝ Dǝm nRom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Kaaɗe mo ɓeet nǝ, mun nɗel ntii kǝn mmo dǝm ɗi nyil Itali, ɓǝ mo le Pool kǝ pak nen ɗe mo a ɓuɓwoot, nsar mǝ mee ngwe ɗeɗes nkaa shiitoon mo, ɗe moo pet sǝm wur a Juliyus, ɗe nǝ a soon mǝ nentap mǝ mishkoom Agustus. <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Mu ɗel nɗǝǝn mee tii ɗe nǝ tong a nyil Adramitiyum jì, ɗang nǝn mbǝ yool mbǝ dǝm ngaar yil ɗe mo nkoop yil Eshiya mo. Yaksǝ mu yool mwaan nǝ nɗǝǝn tii nǝ. Aristakus mee ngu Masidoniya mǝ yil nTasoloni, wur ɗi ashak kǝ mun zak. <verse eid="ACT 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Daar nǝ, ɓǝ mǝ wul nSidon. Juliyus cìn ɗeret mPool, wur shínpee mPool kǝ nwur dǝm pǝ shaar fin mo, mbǝkǝ mmo ɓam wur ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Kaaɗe mǝ yool mpeemǝnǝ, ɓǝ mu dǝm shigǝng mǝ yil nSaiprus nǝ, mbǝɗe kut nǝ daampee mmun zam. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mu dǝm mu wul nkor kuur ɗe nǝn ngaar Silisiya kǝ Pamfiliya. Yaksǝ mu dǝm mu wul mMira ɗe nǝn nyil nLisiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>A mMira nǝ, ɓǝ ngwe ɗeɗes nkaa shiitoon mo, kat mee tii ɗe nǝ tong Alekzandriya jì, ɗe nǝn mbǝ dǝm Itali, ɓǝ wur le mun nɗǝǝn nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Mu cìn teer mo ɗes-ɗes mun mmwaan lee-lee, nkaa am kuur nǝ, a purut-purut ɗang mǝ jì mǝ wul kus kǝ Nidus. Kaaɗe baa kut nǝ yit mmun dǝm ɗe a kyeen kas, ɓǝ mǝ waa mǝ yaa ar nǝ shigǝng mǝ yil nKrit, kus kǝ Salmone. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>A purut-purut ɗang mu jì mu wul ɗi a pǝkom ɗǝǝr nǝ, ɓǝ mu jì mǝ wul mmee mpee ɗe mo kǝ pet a peekaat ɗeret, ɗe nǝ kus kǝ pee nkaam nLasiya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Mbǝɗǝ mun mbǝ yém ɗi mpeemǝnǝ mbǝ teer mo ɗes, ɓǝ kaaɗe mǝ yaa mwaan, ɓǝ nǝ jì kǝ jeel ɗes, mbǝɗe tar mwaan nkaa am nǝ kǝ ten ɗel, ɗang nǝ aɓwoon tartong kǝ neen, ɓǝ Pool leshap nnen ɗe mo nɗǝǝn tii nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>Wur sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Daa mo, wen nnaa mwaan fun ɗesǝ nǝn nɗen kǝ jeel, kǝ lée ɗe mun kǝ mo nɗǝǝn tii nǝ mon ntǝkook, ɗang tii mǝnǝn ntǝkook, dǝm wul kǝ seen fun mo zak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Jir aasǝ baa ngwe ɗeɗes nkaa shiitoon nǝ mo, leɗyeen mpwoo ɗe Pool sat kas, tǝng wur nkǝlǝng a pwoo mǝ ngutung tii nǝ ɗak, kǝ mǝ ngu tii nǝ met mbii ɗe Pool sat nwur. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Baa peeɗar mǝ tii ɗesǝ nii ret ntarkut kas, a kǝsǝ ɓǝ ɗes mǝ gurum nǝ mo ɓeet nǝ, ngyel mǝ yool aku mpeemǝnǝ, kǝ koo ɗe arang yii ɓǝ mu nwul ɗi nFoniks, ɗe nǝ a mee pee am kuur ɗeret nɗǝǝn pee nkaam nKrit, nii naa gaar ngyeen, nsar puusru, kǝ ngaar ndeng nsar puusru zak, mu hos ntarkut a mpee mǝnǝ.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kut Ɗeɗes Yool Nkaa Am kuur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Kaaɗe kut nǝ ɗoom cut pee lee-lee ngaar ngyeen, ɓǝ mo pan nǝ, nǝn njì wuɗun nciit kǝ pan fur mo, ɓǝ mo dul ɓwootsǝǝp nǝ, kǝ mmo tung tii nǝ shindǝm kus kǝ pǝkom ɗǝǝr mǝ yil nKrit. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Ɗangɓǝ kaaɗe mo lang ɗi lee, ɓǝ mee kut ɗeɗes ɗe moo pet a Yurakium dǝ nǝ put nnar kwang ɗeng kǝ sar puus kaa nǝ cutpee jì ɗi nkaa pee nkaam nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Kaaɗe kut ɗeɗes nǝ cut tii nǝ, ɓǝ baa tii nǝ mak dǝm ngaar pee ɗe kut nǝ kǝ jì ɗe kas. Ɓǝ mu yit nkut nǝ tǝp mun shindǝm ɗi mmee ngaar ɗyik. <verse eid="ACT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Mu ɗel shigǝng mǝrep mee yil ɗe am neer ciirkaat ɗe moo pet a Kauda. A purut-purut ɗang mu mak ɓwoot làa tii nǝ nkaa ɗeɗes nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Aɓwoon ɗe mo kǝ ɗiyeep làa tii nǝ le nɗǝǝn tii ɗeɗes nǝ, ɓǝ mo ɓwoot teng shin ciir nkaa tii ɗeɗes nǝ. Mo sham kǝ nlǝr mǝ tii nǝ mo. Mbǝɗǝ mo kǝǝr nǝ, taji kut nǝ tǝp tii nǝ dǝm shweer shi pǝkom ɗyees nSirtis kas. Mo dul ɓwootsǝǝp mǝ tii nǝ kàa nɗǝǝn am nǝ kǝn mmo yit, kǝn nkut nǝ tǝp tii nǝ shindǝm ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Mbǝɗǝ kut nǝ ɗes zam, ɗang nǝ fes yoon mun ɗes zam. Daar nǝ, ɓǝ mo ɗoom kok pak lee ɗe mo nɗǝǝn tii nǝ car mɓut am. <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>Parpuus ɗekun nǝ zak, ɓǝ mo shikáa fur, mo kok lee tii nǝ mo car mɓut am zak. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Mu cìn teer mo ɗes, baa mu mak naa puus koo zar mo kas. Ɗee a kut ɗeɗes, kǝ tungzung mo kàa paa mun ɗak, ɗe nǝ le kǝn mmun put kǝ pǝtuup nǝ baa mun mbar kas.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Mbǝɗǝ gurum nǝ mo kǝ cìn teer mo ɗes nnen se mbiise, ɓǝ Pool yool nnaar mo, ɓǝ wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Daa mo, katɗang dǝ wu kǝlǝng pwoo fen, ɓǝ baa dǝ wun nyool nɗǝǝn yil nKrit, kǝn nwun shwaajeel ɗesǝ, kǝn nwun bǝlang nlée fuu mo kǝrong kas. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Mbǝmǝnǝ an pǝ sat nwun, wu yaa pǝtuup fuu mo, mbǝɗe baa mee gurum nɗǝǝn wun, mbǝ mmuut kas, a tii nǝn mpyan kash-kash ɗak. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Mbǝɗǝ dǝdoon mpar, ɓǝ mee ngulep mǝ Naan ɗe an a mǝwur, kǝ ɗe an kǝn nseyil nwur zak, wur jì woo shin nghan.<verse eid="ACT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>&lt;&lt;Ɓǝ wur sat nghan nǝnee, &lt;Taji kǝǝrmuut yaa gha kas Pool. Nǝ a tǝng gha mbǝ ɗar ntoom kǝ Siza. A naa Naan kǝ cìn ɗeret ngha, ashak kǝ nen ɗe mo nɗǝǝn tii nǝ jir. Baa mee gurum nɗǝǝn tii nǝn mmuut kas.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Mbǝ mǝnǝ, daa mo, wu cìn retnyit. Mbǝɗǝ wen nshinzeen nNaan nǝ, mbii ɗe mo woo nghan, ɓǝ nǝn ncìn a kǝsǝ. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Ɗang jir kǝsǝ ɓǝ kut nǝn tǝp tii nǝ shweer nkaa mee yil ɗe am neer nǝ ciirkaat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tii Nǝ Pyan Kash-Kash</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Nɗǝǝn teer ɗe kaapaat baafeer nǝ, ɓǝ kut nǝ tǝp mun kàa kǝ sham nɗǝǝn am kuur mǝ Adriya. Yaksǝ nnaar par, ɓǝ nen tii nǝ mo pan nǝ, muu wul kus kǝ mee yil. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Ɓǝ mo kam lu mǝ am nǝ, ɓǝ mo kat nǝ a shii mo kambil mǝndong kǝ laarvǝl (120). Kaaɗe mu gyes mu dǝm ɗi lee, ɓǝ mo cin shin kam lu mǝ am nǝ ɗe zak, ɓǝ mo kat nǝ wul a shii laarpwoofeer (90). <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Mbǝ kǝǝrmuut ɗe nǝ, meesǝ, kut nǝn ndǝm shweer tii nǝ nkaa ngǝk, ɓǝ mo fwen ɓwootsǝǝp nǝ mo sham feer mɓwoon mǝ tii nǝ, mbǝkǝ ntii nǝ ɗar ɗi coot, mbǝɗe mo le pan nkaa ɓit ɗe nǝn mbǝ mang. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Nentung tii nǝ mo nkaa yap ar ɗe mon nshwe yit tii nǝ ɗi, ɓǝ mo kǝ ten shang làa tii nǝ shinsham mɓut am kuur nǝ. Mo cìn kǝsǝ a mbǝ gwam gurum mo, kǝn mmo naa ɗi nǝ, wuɗun a mbǝ fwo ɓwootsǝǝp nǝ ɗe mon mpǝkyeen mǝ tii nǝ, ɗe moo ɓwet shinsham sǝ. <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Ɗangɓe Pool sat ngwe ɗeɗes mǝ shiitoon nǝ mo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Katɗang ɓǝ baa nentung tii nǝ mo tong ɗi nɗǝǝn tii nǝ kas, ɓǝ wu mmurep jir.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Ɓǝ shiitoon mo can teng mǝ làa tii nǝ, mo yit nǝ sham taa nɗǝǝn am nǝ, yaksǝ kut mang nǝ seet kǝ nǝ.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Kaaɗe ɓit kus kǝ mang, ɓǝ Pool sat ngurum nǝ mo jir kǝ mmo se mbiise, wur sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;A teer mo kaapaat baafeer nɗesǝ, ɓǝ wun pǝ tong gongpee, kǝ baa wu se mee mbiise kas. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Mbǝmǝnǝ kǝn ɗang pǝ wun, mbǝkǝ nwun se mbiise, mbǝɗe mǝnǝn nshínɓal nwun nɗǝǝn shik fuu mo. Baa mee shweepkáa mǝ mee gurum mǝndong nɗǝǝn wun nǝn nloom kas.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Kaaɗe Pool sat pwoo mǝnǝ, ɓǝ wur mang gǝǝl aas, ɓǝ wur ɗangnaan ɗe mǝ plang Naan a yit gurum nǝ mo jir, ɓǝ wur tep gǝǝl aas nǝ, ɓǝ wur yaa se nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Yaksǝ gurum nǝ mo jir mo kat retnyit, ɓǝ mo shikáa fur mo se gǝǝl aas nǝ zak. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Mun gurum ɗe mun nɗǝǝn tii nǝ jir, mu wul kambil vǝl kǝ laarpwoovǝl kǝ peemee (276). <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Kaaɗe gurum mo se mbiise mo ǝɓǝl, ɓǝ mo kok aàs ɗǝɓen ɗe nǝ nɗǝǝn tii nǝ, mo car shinsham mɓut am kuur nǝ, kǝn ntii nǝ pan fiyeel ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 27:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Kaaɗe ɓitmang, ɓǝ baa nentung tii nǝ mo man yil ɗe mo ɗi nǝ kas, ɓǝ mo naa mee pǝkom ɗǝǝr ɗe nǝ kǝ ɗyees, ɓǝ mo ɓeet nǝ, katɗang nǝ mak cìn, ɓǝ mo dǝm kǝ tii ɗi pǝkom nǝ. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Ɓǝ mo saa teng ɗe mo yaa ɓwootsǝǝp nǝ mo, kǝn mmo yit ɓwootsǝǝp nǝ mo mɓut am kuur nǝ, kǝn mmo fween teng ɗe moo yaa mbii ciir kǝ tii nǝ. Yaksǝ mo ɗiyeep nlǝr ɗe nǝn mpǝkyeen mǝ tii nǝ nkor ɗe kut kǝ jì ɗi, ɓǝ mo yaa ar dǝm pǝkom ɗǝǝr. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Ɗangɓǝ kaaɗe mu wul mmee mpee ɗe kut kǝ cut am nǝ jì kaat ɗi, ɓǝ tii nǝ ɗel shamru mɓut ɗiyees, ɗe baa nǝ kutɗi kǝ tungpee kas, ɓǝ koor mɓwoon mǝ tii nǝ ɗoom pyan, mbǝ ɓal mǝ kut ɗe nii cut nǝ.<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Yaksǝ shiitoon nǝ mo ɓeetpwoo, mbǝ twe nen ɗe mo a ɓuɓwoot jir, mbǝkǝ taji mo cut lung, kǝ mo dǝm loom ɗi kas. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Ɗangɓǝ ngwe ɗeɗes nkaa shiitoon nǝ mo, kǝ reɓet ɓam Pool, ɓǝ wur cíi mmo. Wur le kǝ nnen ɗe mo man lung jir, mo mǝrep sham mɓut am nǝ, kǝn mmo taa lung dǝm wul ɗe a pwoo ɗǝǝr. <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ koor gurum nǝ mo mǝrep sham taa nkaa shiyeep mo, kǝ pak mo nkaa yoom mǝ tii ɗe nǝ pyan nǝ zak.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Pool Nɗǝǝn Yil mMalta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Aɓwoon ɗe mu wul nɗǝǝn yil nǝ nkoom jir, ɓǝ mu kǝlǝng nǝ, moo pet sǝm yil ɗe am neer nǝ cǝǝrkaat a Malta. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Nenyil nǝ mo kaat mun jir, kǝzak mo ɓam mun zam, ɓǝ mo ɓil wus mmun, mbǝɗe fwan nkaa jì, kǝ pee zuum zak. <verse eid="ACT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Ɗangɓǝ kaaɗe Pool kok yoom le nwus, ɓǝ mbǝ tal mǝ wus nǝ, ɓǝ mee nwòo ɗe sǝm nǝ a pang, nǝ pus sar mPool, ɗang nǝ ɗyiin nkaa sar wur. <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Kaaɗe nenyil nǝ mo naa nwòo ɗesǝ nii ɗyiin mPool nkaa sar, ɓǝ mo sat nshak nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Azeen-zeen gwar ɗesǝ wur a ngutukáa, koo ɗewur kǝ put mɓut njeel mǝ am kuur nǝ, ɓǝ baa kwat mǝ shikbish nǝ mak yit wur ɗe mmeen kas.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Ɓǝ Pool vwet nwòo nǝ sham taa nwus. Mbǝɗǝ nwòo ɗe nǝ pus wur nǝ, ɓǝ baa nǝ cìn mee mbii nwur kas. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Nenyil nǝ mo pan nǝ, yak mon nnaa Pool wup, koo mo nnaa wur taa nyil muut. Ɗangɓǝ kaaɗe mo tong naapee, ɓǝ baa mo naa mee mbii cìn Pool kas, ɓǝ mo waa sheepwoo ɗe, mo sat nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Gwar ɗesǝ wur a mee naan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Kus kǝ peemǝnǝ, ɓǝ mee maar mǝ Pubiliyus ngwe ɗeɗes nkaa yil ɗe am neer cǝǝrkaat nǝ, wur kaat mun le nlu fin mbǝ teer mo kun, ɗang wur tap kǝ mun, wur cìn ɗeret mmun zam. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Puun mǝ Pubiliyus, baa wur nkoom kas, wur a peesaam kǝ shikshwal, kǝ ɗyestoom zak. Pool ɗel pǝ ngunan nǝ ɗi, ɓǝ wur ɗangnaan ɓǝ wur lesar fin nkaa ngunan nǝ, ɓǝ ngunan nǝ bar. <verse eid="ACT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Kaaɗe Pool cìn mǝnǝ, ɓǝ koor nengok ɗe mo nɗǝǝn yil ɗe am neer cǝǝrkaat nǝ, mo jì jir, mbǝkǝ mPool bar mo ɗi. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Nenyil nǝ mo shin zuum mo mmun ɗes, ɗang kaaɗe mun mbǝ ɗel nɗǝǝn tii nǝ mbǝ seet, ɓǝ mo shin mbii ɗe mon mɓam mun a ar mwaan nǝ jir zak.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Wul nRom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Aɓwoon tar mo kun, ɓǝ mǝ yool nɗǝǝn mee tii ɗe nǝ tong a Alekzandriya jì, ɗe nii hos ntarkut nɗǝǝn yil ɗe am neer cǝǝrkaat sǝ. tii ɗesǝ nǝ kǝ sǝmpwoo (alaama) mǝ káa Jan ɗemish mo nkaa nǝ, ɗe mo a Kasto, kǝ Pollukus, mee naan mǝ mo, nǝ mo. <verse eid="ACT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Mu jì mǝ wul nSirakus, ɓǝ mu cìn teer mo kun ɗi, mpee mǝnǝ. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Kaaɗe mu yool mpee mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mu jì mu wul nRegiyum. Mu teer mpeemǝnǝ, ɓǝ mee kut yool nkor ngyeen, ɓǝ ɗaar nǝ, ɓǝ mu dǝm mu wul mPutiyoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Mu kat nenseet nɗang Jesu mo mpeemǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo ɗang mun kǝn mmun cìn teer mo pwoovǝl ɗi ashak kǝ mo. A mwaan fun nǝ mmǝnǝ, ɗee mu dǝm mu wul nRom. <verse eid="ACT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Kaaɗe nenseet nɗang Jesu ɗe mon mpee nkaam nRom, mo kǝlǝng pwoo nkaa mun, ɓǝ mo pwat jì mbǝ kaat mun, ɓǝ mo jì wul mpeepring Apiyus, kǝ pee ɗe lumǝzep mo ɗekun. Kaaɗe Pool naa mo, ɓǝ wur plang Naan, ɗang pǝtuup wur nǝ sǝǝt katɓal. <verse eid="ACT 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Kaaɗe mu jì mu wul nɗǝǝn pee nkaam nRom, ɓǝ mo shínpee mPool tong ɗi mbǝshin mpee ɗewur rǝɓet, ashak kǝ shiitoon ɗewur kǝ tap Pool.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool Sat Pwoo Naan Nɗǝǝn Pee Nkaam nRom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Aɓwoon teer mo kun, ɓǝ Pool pǝrep nen ɗenan-nan mǝ nnen Yahudi mo. Kaaɗe mo kuur ashak, ɓǝ wur sat mmo nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Ɗyemnaa mo, baa kǝn cìn mee mbii ɗebish nnen fun mo kas. Koo a nkaa mǝse mǝ wàar puun fun mo, ɓǝ baa kǝn cìn mee mbii ɗebish kas, jir kǝsǝ, ɓǝ mo yaa an shin nnen Rom mo a ɓuɓwoot nɗǝǝn yil nJerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Kaaɗe nnen Rom mo tokɗyeel nghan, ɓǝ mo rǝɓet ɓwet an, mbǝɗe baa kǝn cìn mee mbii ɗebish ɗe nǝ mak kǝ mmo tu an kas. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/>Ɗangɓǝ baa nnen Yahudi mo rǝɓet kǝ mmo ɓwet an kas, ɓǝ nǝ ɗee nghan a tǝng kǝn nghan ɗang nǝ, mo jì kǝ ɗyeel fen nǝ pǝ Siza ɗi. Baa nǝ, kǝn rǝɓet yap a nen fun mo kǝ ɗyeel kas. <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>A mbǝ pwoo ɗesǝ, ɓǝ wen nyappee ɗe an nnaa wun ɗi, mbǝkǝ wen leshap ɗi kǝ wun, mbǝɗe a mbǝ canciin ɗe nnen Isreil mo kǝ nǝ, ɗang an ɗi a ɓuɓwoot shi shoolbǝring ɗesǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Mo sat nwur nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Baa mmun muu kat mee lep a rǝran nyil Judiya nkaa gha kas. Kǝzak baa mee ɗyemnǝǝn fun mo jì mpee ɗesǝ, kǝn mmo satpwoo ɗi mmun nkaa gha, koo mo sat mee pwoo mmun nkaa mbii ɗebish ɗe a cìn mo kas zak. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Ɗangɓǝ mu rǝɓet kǝlǝng nǝ mpwoo fwaa mbii ɗe gha naa nǝ ret, mbǝɗe katɗang a pwoo nkaa Ar ɗesǝ nǝ, ɓǝ mu man nǝ, koo a nii, ɓǝ mo nkaa leshap ɗebish nkaa nǝ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Aɓwoon mǝnǝ, ɓǝ mo lepuus. Ɓǝ kaaɗe puus nǝ wul, ɓǝ gurum mo ɗes mo jì pǝ Pool ɗi a pee ɗewur kǝ tong ɗi. Yool mbít, dǝm wul nkansǝǝn, ɓǝ Pool kámshii mǝ mulki mǝ Naan nǝ ngurum mo, ɗang wur tong a langtǝng nkaa nǝ zak. Wur rǝɓet dul mo jì pǝ Jesu ɗi, shi kám mǝ Wàar mǝ Mosis, kǝ shi kám mǝ nensatpwoo mǝ Naan mo zak. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Pak gurum nǝ mo shinzeen mpwoo ɗewur sat nǝ, ɗang baa pak mo shinzeen kas. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Kaaɗe baa mo kǝlǝngkar nǝ ashak jir kas, ɓǝ akuɗang moo rangkáa, ɓǝ Pool sat mee pwoo mmo mǝndong, nǝnee, &lt;&lt;Azeen-zeen pwoo ɗe gyet Riin Ɗeɓang wur kǝ sat mpuun fuu mo nsar kǝ ngusat pwoo Naan Aizaya nǝnee, <verse eid="ACT 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>&lt;A dǝm pǝ nnen ɗesǝ mo ɗi, kǝn nghan sat mmo nǝnee, wun nsat a kǝlǝngpee, ɗang baa wun mmanshii mǝ mbii ɗe wun kǝlǝng nǝ kas koo dǝɓen. Wun nsat a nnaapee ɗak, ɗang baa wun mmanshii mǝ mbii ɗe wuu naa nǝ kas koo dǝɓen. <verse eid="ACT 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>Mbǝɗǝ pǝtuup mǝ nnen ɗesǝ nǝ mo fii ɗee kakras. Mo kǝ duur kom fur mo, ɗang mo kǝ kup ar fur mo zak. Mbǝkǝ taji mo naapee shi yit fur mo, kǝ taji mo kǝlǝngpee shi kom fur mo zak, kǝzak, mbǝkǝ taji mo manshii nǝ nɗǝǝn pǝtuup fur mo. Kǝn mmo ciir pǝ an ɗi, ɓǝ yool an ɓam mo.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>&lt;&lt;Mbǝ mǝnǝ, ɓǝ wen nrǝɓǝt kǝ nwun man nǝ, mo kǝ lep pwoo nkaa ɓam mǝ Naan nǝ shindǝm nnen ɗe baa mo a nen Yahudi mo kas. Yaksǝ mon nlekom mbǝ pwoo nǝ, ɓǝ mon nkǝlǝng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>Kaaɗe Pool leshap ɗesǝ mmo, ɓǝ nnen Yahudi mo rangkáa, kǝ mon nkaa ɓeetpwoo nǝ kǝ shak.<verse eid="ACT 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Pool tong nɗǝǝn lu ɗe a wur kwat shikáa fin, mbǝ ɓit mo vǝl. Wur kǝ kaat nen ɗe mo jì pǝ wur ɗi jir. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Wur leshap ngurum mo nkaa mulki mǝ Naan nǝ, baa ashak kǝ mee kǝǝrmuut kas, kǝ baa mee ngwe cíi nwur kas, kǝzak, wur kámpwoo ngurum mo nkaa Daa Jesu Kristi.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
